		.funcnumber	0356H
		.data
L0000:	db	'"Our gratitude is thine, Avatar. Thou hast saved Britannia f'
	db	'rom what might have become a second Age of Darkness. Again, '
	db	'thou dost prove thy worthiness to be the instrument of Lord '
	db	'British."'
L00BD:	db	00
L00BE:	db	'"Salutations, Avatar. I can assist thee no more, but remembe'
	db	'r my words: the Psyche returns to the Core..."*'
L0129:	db	00
L012A:	db	'Suddenly, your mind is filled with the crystal-clear resonan'
	db	'ce of an authoritative voice.~"Greeting to thee. I am the ke'
	db	'eper of Truth. Dost thou seek the wisdom and boon of Truth?"'
L01DE:	db	00
L01DF:	db	'The Shrine of Truth speaks. "Greetings, seeker. Once again I'
	db	' ask thee, Dost thou seek my enlightenment?"'
L0247:	db	00
L0248:	db	'"Very well. Prepare thyself." The voice falls silent.*'
L027E:	db	00
L027F:	db	'"I wish thee well, then."*'
L0299:	db	00
L029A:	db	'"Thy Love for life is boundless. Thine heart-felt actions ar'
	db	'e a shining example to all of Britannia."*'
L0300:	db	00
L0301:	db	'"Welcome, Avatar. I can help thee no further, save to offer '
	db	'the advice I gave before: A great evil stirs in Britannia...'
	db	'"*'
L037B:	db	00
L037C:	db	'An unearthly beautiful voice sighs gently into your concious'
	db	'ness. "Greetings, Avatar. I represent the embodiment of Love'
	db	'. If thou dost seek enlightenment , thou must take the Test '
	db	'of	Love. Its path lies through the glowing, blue portal to t'
	db	'he south."*'
L0477:	db	00
L0478:	db	'"I welcome thee again, seeker. I cannot aid thee until thy s'
	db	'uccessful completion of the Test of Love."*'
L04DF:	db	00
L04E0:	db	'"Thine onus is abated and Britannia is free of Exodus' grasp'
	db	' once more. Thy deeds will long be rembered as the most cour'
	db	'ageous in the history of this land."*'
L057D:	db	00
L057E:	db	'"Hail, mighty Avatar! Thou must not fail in thy quest to fin'
	db	'd the Talisman of Infinity. Remember: the scroll that will u'
	db	'nlock its secret lies within this castle."*'
L0621:	db	00
L0622:	db	'A strong, vibrant voice rings out in your mind. "Greetings s'
	db	'eeker! I am the Keeper of Courage. If thou hast the will to '
	db	'seek my reward, thou must enter the portal to the south."*'
L06D4:	db	00
L06D5:	db	'"Again I say to thee, my path lies through the portal to the'
	db	' south. Enter if thou hast the Courage, seeker..."*'
L0744:	db	00
L0745:	db	'"Thou hast mastered the Test of Truth, and so a boon of grea'
	db	't intellect and magical ability will be bestowed upon thee. '
	db	'Use -- and respect -- thy powers well, Avatar."'
L07EC:	db	00
L07ED:	db	'"My heart is gladdened to learn that Love is a Principle tho'
	db	'u dost hold dear, evident by thy successful completion of th'
	db	'e Test of Love. Now, then, shall a blessing of quickness and'
	db	' skill be thine."'
L08B2:	db	00
L08B3:	db	'"Well done, mighty warrior! The unsurpassed Courage which fl'
	db	'ows through thy veins could be none other than that of the A'
	db	'vatar. Thou hast proven thyself worthy of the reward of Cour'
	db	'age with Valor, Sacrifice, Honor, and Spirituality... Receiv'
	db	'e it now	in Humility."*'
L09BA:	db	00
L09BB:	db	'"Thou hast now experienced the full meaning of the Principle'
	db	' of Truth. The value of such is beyond measure, for truth sh'
	db	'all guide thee throughout thy life's endeavors."'
L0A63:	db	00
L0A64:	db	'The statue's voice takes on a warning tone. "Know this Truth'
	db	': the Psyche returns to the Core..." With that said, the sta'
	db	'tue becomes quiet once more.*'
L0AF9:	db	00
L0AFA:	db	'"Now hast thou earnestly experienced all that is Love. 'Tis '
	db	'a benefit never to be taken lightly, for Love is a formidibl'
	db	'e motivator. Remember always the lessons in Compassion, Sacr'
	db	'ifice, and Justice thou hast mastered."'
L0BD5:	db	00
L0BD6:	db	'The voice of the Keeper of Love fills with compassion as she'
	db	' speaks. "Do have a care, Avatar. For a great evil stirs wit'
	db	'hin Britannia, I know not the source."*'
L0C75:	db	00
L0C76:	db	'Urgency breaks into the voice of the statue. "I lay upon the'
	db	'e a geas, and as thou art the Avatar, thou art bound to resp'
	db	'ond. Thy quest is to seek the Talisman of Infinity. Within t'
	db	'his castle there lies a scroll which can tell thee of its us'
	db	'e. Go now, for time grows short.*'
L0D87:	db	00
