		.funcnumber	03DEH
		.data
L0000:	db	'You feel as if your mind is being probed, delicately at firs'
	db	't, then with more insistance. Images of long past memories f'
	db	'lit before your eyes and old emotions resurface. At one poin'
	db	't, the images pause as you remember the words Love, Sol, Moo'
	db	'ns, and Death then a strange sense of deja vu comes over you'
	db	' as the vision comes up to the current time. The images ceas'
	db	'e and a vast wave of power overwhelms you. A wall of darknes'
	db	's falls...'
L01AE:	db	00
L01AF:	db	'Your mind is quickly probed, then cast aside, leaving you fe'
	db	'eling slightly ill and filled with an irrational sense of fo'
	db	'rboding.'
L022F:	db	00
