L0151:	db	'! If I did not trust the infallibility of mine own eyes, I w'
	db	'ould not believe it! I was just thinking to myself, 'If only'
	db	' the Avatar were here!' Then...~~"Lo and behold! Who says th'
	db	'at magic is dying! Here is living proof that it is not!~~ "D'
	db	'ost thou realize, '
L0253:	db	00
L0254:	db	', that it hath been 200 Britannian years since we last met? '
	db	'Why, thou hast not aged at all!"'
