L04EB:	db	'Salamon'
L04F2:	db	00
L04F3:	db	'"Salamon is the wisest Emp. Humans have been met by her. -Ma'
	db	'ny- things have been seen by her. She is very experienced an'
	db	'd knowledgeable."'
L057C:	db	00
L057D:	db	'Salamon'
L0584:	db	00
L0585:	db	'wisps'
L058A:	db	00
L058B:	db	'"Wisps are known to me," he nods. "Wisps are found in the wo'
	db	'ods. What is your concern?"'
