		.data
L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'woman'
L0012:	db	00
L0013:	db	'man'
L0016:	db	00
L0017:	db	'The peasant looks at you as if he has seen a ghost! "Iolo! T'
	db	'his '
L0057:	db	00
L0058:	db	' did appear from thin air! Help me!"*'
L007D:	db	00
L007E:	db	'You see a distraught peasant. "Art thou really the Avatar?"'
L00B9:	db	00
L00BA:	db	'Petre bows before you. "^'
L00D3:	db	00
L00D4:	db	'."'
L00D6:	db	00
L00D7:	db	'Petre looks confused. "Thou shouldst not make fun of me!" He'
	db	' turns away.*'
L0120:	db	00
L0121:	db	'"What is it, '
L012E:	db	00
L012F:	db	'?" Petre asks.'
L013D:	db	00
L013E:	db	'footprints'
L0148:	db	00
L0149:	db	'murder'
L014F:	db	00
L0150:	db	'Spark'
L0155:	db	00
L0156:	db	'Klog'
L015A:	db	00
L015B:	db	'Fellowship'
L0165:	db	00
L0166:	db	'"Look in the stables! 'Tis horrible! I will answer thy quest'
	db	'ions, but first look in the stables!"*'
L01C8:	db	00
L01C9:	db	'name'
L01CD:	db	00
L01CE:	db	'"I am called Petre," the man sniffs.'
L01F2:	db	00
L01F3:	db	'name'
L01F7:	db	00
L01F8:	db	'job'
L01FB:	db	00
L01FC:	db	'"I am the stables caretaker."'
L0219:	db	00
L021A:	db	'stables'
L0221:	db	00
L0222:	db	'stables'
L0229:	db	00
L022A:	db	'"I have worked here for years. I can sell thee a nice horse '
	db	'and carriage if thou dost want one. The animal and the carri'
	db	'age are located in a small shelter just outside the north ga'
	db	'te of the town."'
L02EE:	db	00
L02EF:	db	'"Right now the place gives me the creeps!"~~His eyes are wil'
	db	'd with fright.'
L0339:	db	00
L033A:	db	'"The Mayor did not let me clean in there until twenty-four h'
	db	'ours after thou didst leave Trinsic. He thought we had to ke'
	db	'ep the place of the crime unsullied. Well, if thou dost ask '
	db	'me, I can tell thee that it still stinks like the end of the'
	db	' world in there!"'
L043B:	db	00
L043C:	db	'stables'
L0443:	db	00
L0444:	db	'carriage'
L044C:	db	00
L044D:	db	'murder'
L0453:	db	00
L0454:	db	'"I discovered poor Christopher and Inamo earlier this mornin'
	db	'g. I did not touch a thing. Made me sick, it did!"'
L04C2:	db	00
L04C3:	db	'murder'
L04C9:	db	00
L04CA:	db	'Inamo'
L04CF:	db	00
L04D0:	db	'Christopher'
L04DB:	db	00
L04DC:	db	'Christopher'
L04E7:	db	00
L04E8:	db	'"Nice man. He made the shoes for mine horses."'
L0516:	db	00
L0517:	db	'Christopher'
L0522:	db	00
L0523:	db	'Inamo'
L0528:	db	00
L0529:	db	'"He worked for very little money. Did basic chores around th'
	db	'e stables and the pub. I let him sleep in the little back ro'
	db	'om. He must have been in the wrong place at the wrong time."'
L05DD:	db	00
L05DE:	db	'Inamo'
L05E3:	db	00
L05E4:	db	'carriage'
L05EC:	db	00
L05ED:	db	'"The horse and carriage combination sells for 60 gold. Dost '
	db	'thou want a title?"'
L063C:	db	00
L063D:	db	'"Very good. Nothing like a little business transaction to ta'
	db	'ke my mind off the ghastly scene in the stables."'
L06AA:	db	00
L06AB:	db	'"Oh, my. Thine hands are too full to take the title!"'
L06E0:	db	00
L06E1:	db	'"Oh. Thou dost not have enough gold to buy the title."'
L0717:	db	00
L0718:	db	'"Some other time, then."'
L0730:	db	00
L0731:	db	'carriage'
L0739:	db	00
L073A:	db	'footprints'
L0744:	db	00
L0745:	db	'"They doth lead out the back way, yes? They must be the trac'
	db	'ks of the murderer!"~~His eyes widen a bit more.~~"Or... mur'
	db	'derers!"'
L07C5:	db	00
L07C6:	db	'footprints'
L07D0:	db	00
L07D1:	db	'Fellowship'
L07DB:	db	00
L07DC:	db	'"I do not want to join them, but they seem all right."'
L0812:	db	00
L0813:	db	'Fellowship'
L081D:	db	00
L081E:	db	'Klog'
L0822:	db	00
L0823:	db	'"I do not know the man too well. I have no dealings with him'
	db	'."'
L0861:	db	00
L0862:	db	'Klog'
L0866:	db	00
L0867:	db	'Spark'
L086C:	db	00
L086D:	db	'"That be Christopher's son. Nice lad."'
L0893:	db	00
L0894:	db	'Petre ruffles the boy's hair.~~"This here is Christopher's s'
	db	'on. He's a good lad, is Spark, when he's not pilfering thing'
	db	's from honest shopkeepers."'
L0927:	db	00
L0928:	db	'Spark'
L092D:	db	00
L092E:	db	'bye'
L0931:	db	00
L0932:	db	'"Goodbye," the man sniffs.*'
L094D:	db	00
