L00A5:	db	'Klog'
L00A9:	db	00
L00AA:	db	'Fellowship'
L00B4:	db	00
L00B5:	db	'Crown Jewel'
L00C0:	db	00
L00C1:	db	'You see an alert and no-nonsense guard.'
L00E8:	db	00
L00E9:	db	'"What is it?" Johnson asks, sternly.'
L010D:	db	00
L010E:	db	'name'
L0112:	db	00
L0113:	db	'"Johnson."'
L011D:	db	00
L011E:	db	'name'
L0122:	db	00
L0123:	db	'job'
L0126:	db	00
L0127:	db	'"I have the morning watch guarding the dock. I authorize the'
	db	' comings and goings of every ship."'
L0186:	db	00
L0187:	db	'ship'
L018B:	db	00
L018C:	db	'murder'
L0192:	db	00
L0193:	db	'"I did hear of this. When I arrived at my post at sunrise, I'
	db	' found Gilberto lying felled on the ground. If thou art aski'
	db	'ng if I saw anything -- I did not. No one hath passed by me '
	db	'since I arrived at the dock."'
L0264:	db	00
L0265:	db	'murder'
L026B:	db	00
L026C:	db	'Crown Jewel'
L0277:	db	00
L0278:	db	'"The boat left just after sunrise. It did sail to Britain, I'
	db	' believe. Thou canst ask Gargan the Shipwright about that."'
L02EF:	db	00
L02F0:	db	'Crown Jewel'
L02FB:	db	00
L02FC:	db	'Fellowship'
L0306:	db	00
L0307:	db	'"Yes, I am a member. Wouldst thou like to join?"'
L0337:	db	00
L0338:	db	'"Then thou shouldst go to see Batlin in Britain."'
L0369:	db	00
L036A:	db	'"'Tis thy loss."'
L037A:	db	00
L037B:	db	'Fellowship'
L0385:	db	00
L0386:	db	'Klog'
L038A:	db	00
L038B:	db	'"Good man. He is our branch leader here in Trinsic."'
L03BF:	db	00
L03C0:	db	'Klog'
L03C4:	db	00
L03C5:	db	'ship'
L03C9:	db	00
L03CA:	db	'"If thou dost want a ship, thou must get a deed from the shi'
	db	'pwright. Thou must also have the password to leave town."'
L043F:	db	00
L0440:	db	'deed'
L0444:	db	00
L0445:	db	'password'
L044D:	db	00
L044E:	db	'ship'
