		.data
L0000:	db	'You see a stunningly attractive oriental woman. She is armed'
	db	' to the teeth.'
L004A:	db	00
L004B:	db	'"Thou dost wish to speak with me again?" asks Eiko.'
L007E:	db	00
L007F:	db	'Stay thine hand!'
L008F:	db	00
L0090:	db	'bye'
L0093:	db	00
L0094:	db	'job'
L0097:	db	00
L0098:	db	'name'
L009C:	db	00
L009D:	db	'name'
L00A1:	db	00
L00A2:	db	'"My name is Eiko."'
L00B4:	db	00
L00B5:	db	'name'
L00B9:	db	00
L00BA:	db	'job'
L00BD:	db	00
L00BE:	db	'"I have no job. I have a quest. My quest is shared with mine'
	db	' half-sister, Amanda."'
L0110:	db	00
L0111:	db	'quest'
L0116:	db	00
L0117:	db	'"We are leaving this dungeon now that our quest is over."'
L0150:	db	00
L0151:	db	'Amanda'
L0157:	db	00
L0158:	db	'quest'
L015D:	db	00
L015E:	db	'"Eighteen years ago my father was murdered by a cyclops call'
	db	'ed Iskander Ironheart. Mine half-sister Amanda and I are his'
	db	' only surviving kin and we have vowed to avenge him."'
L020B:	db	00
L020C:	db	'quest'
L0211:	db	00
L0212:	db	'Iskander'
L021A:	db	00
L021B:	db	'father'
L0221:	db	00
L0222:	db	'father'
L0228:	db	00
L0229:	db	'"Our father was a mage named Kalideth. He was working to fin'
	db	'd a cause of the disturbances of the ethereal waves that hav'
	db	'e been preventing magic from working for the past twenty yea'
	db	'rs and more, as well as the madness that has afflicted all m'
	db	'ages since then."'
L032A:	db	00
L032B:	db	'"Our father was a wise and kind man. His death was a loss fo'
	db	'r all of Britannia." She sniffs.'
L0387:	db	00
L0388:	db	'"His killer deserves to die."'
L03A5:	db	00
L03A6:	db	'father'
L03AC:	db	00
L03AD:	db	'Amanda'
L03B3:	db	00
L03B4:	db	'"Neither one of us knew that the other existed until after t'
	db	'he death of our father."'
L0408:	db	00
L0409:	db	'"I had always felt like I had a sister somewhere. But I attr'
	db	'ibuted those feelings to the natural loneliness a child feel'
	db	's upon losing a father. Learning about each other has been t'
	db	'he only good thing that has happened to me since father's de'
	db	'ath."'
L04FE:	db	00
L04FF:	db	'Amanda'
L0505:	db	00
L0506:	db	'Iskander'
L050E:	db	00
L050F:	db	'"Yes, I know I am not pronouncing it correctly. I understand'
	db	' he has a more human nickname that is actually a translation'
	db	' from the ancient cyclops language. But I do not know what i'
	db	't is."'
L05C9:	db	00
L05CA:	db	'Iskander'
L05D2:	db	00
L05D3:	db	'Stay thine hand!'
L05E3:	db	00
L05E4:	db	'You explain to Eiko what you have learned. Kalideth had gone'
	db	' mad when he fought with Iskander and the source of what is '
	db	'causing the problems with magic and the mage's minds was the'
	db	' thing that really killed Kalideth!'
L06BB:	db	00
L06BC:	db	'"Then if thou hast discovered the true force that killed my '
	db	'father, my vengeance against Kalideth would be unjust."'
L072F:	db	00
L0730:	db	'"How canst thou say that? I thought that thou wert my sister'
	db	'? Thou art a traitor!"'
L0782:	db	00
L0783:	db	'Stay thine hand!'
L0793:	db	00
L0794:	db	'bye'
L0797:	db	00
L0798:	db	'"Farewell."'
L07A3:	db	00
