		.data
L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'services'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'murder'
L0013:	db	00
L0014:	db	'job'
L0017:	db	00
L0018:	db	'name'
L001C:	db	00
L001D:	db	'Klog'
L0021:	db	00
L0022:	db	'Fellowship'
L002C:	db	00
L002D:	db	'You see a solemn fellow in healer's robes.'
L0057:	db	00
L0058:	db	'"Hello, again," Chantu says. "How may I help thee?"'
L008B:	db	00
L008C:	db	'name'
L0090:	db	00
L0091:	db	'"My name is Chantu," he says with a slight bow.'
L00C0:	db	00
L00C1:	db	'name'
L00C5:	db	00
L00C6:	db	'job'
L00C9:	db	00
L00CA:	db	'"I am the Trinsic healer. I can perform a heal, a poison cur'
	db	'e, or a resurrection on any of thy friends. Or on thee, of c'
	db	'ourse."'
L0149:	db	00
L014A:	db	'murder'
L0150:	db	00
L0151:	db	'"'Tis a sad state for Britannia when events such as these ha'
	db	'ppen. Christopher was a good man. I hope that the villain is'
	db	' caught."'
L01D2:	db	00
L01D3:	db	'murder'
L01D9:	db	00
L01DA:	db	'services'
L01E2:	db	00
L01E3:	db	'Fellowship'
L01ED:	db	00
L01EE:	db	'The healer frowns. "The Fellowship does not appreciate the e'
	db	'fforts of healers in Britannia. Although they do admirable t'
	db	'hings, The Fellowship is short-sighted when evaluating the n'
	db	'eed for healers. They believe that our work can be done thro'
	db	'ugh their so-called 'Triad of Inner Strength'."'
L030D:	db	00
L030E:	db	'Chantu notices your medallion and his eyes widen.'
L033F:	db	00
L0340:	db	'"Excuse me, '
L034C:	db	00
L034D:	db	', I did not mean to offend thee."'
L036E:	db	00
L036F:	db	'Fellowship'
L0379:	db	00
L037A:	db	'Klog'
L037E:	db	00
L037F:	db	'The healer shrugs. "He does his duty as he sees fit. And I d'
	db	'o mine."'
L03C3:	db	00
L03C4:	db	'Klog'
L03C8:	db	00
L03C9:	db	'bye'
L03CC:	db	00
L03CD:	db	'"Goodbye."*'
L03D8:	db	00
L03D9:	db	'@Feeling better?@'
L03EA:	db	00
L03EB:	db	'@How are we today?@'
L03FE:	db	00
L03FF:	db	'@Thy fever has lessened.@'
L0418:	db	00
L0419:	db	'@Try to sleep...@'
L042A:	db	00
