L0000:	db	'Avatar'
L0006:	db	00
L0007:	db	'Dell frowns at you for distracting him during the Fellowship'
	db	' meeting.*'
L004D:	db	00
L004E:	db	'"I do not have time to talk with thee! I must get to the mee'
	db	'ting of The Fellowship! Come to my shop tomorrow!"*'
L00BD:	db	00
L00BE:	db	'bye'
L00C1:	db	00
L00C2:	db	'murder'
L00C8:	db	00
L00C9:	db	'job'
L00CC:	db	00
L00CD:	db	'name'
L00D1:	db	00
L00D2:	db	'You see a stern shopkeeper who might once have been a strong'
	db	' fighter.'
L0117:	db	00
L0118:	db	'"Thou hast entered my shop, so thou had best buy something."'
L0154:	db	00
L0155:	db	'"Who might I be addressing?"'
L0171:	db	00
L0172:	db	'"Hmph. My name is Dell."'
L018A:	db	00
L018B:	db	'"Oh, art thou really? I did not know there were so many of t'
	db	'hee! Why, only last week did an 'Avatar' come through here! '
	db	'He took me for 20 gold, too! An expert trickster, he was!"~~'
	db	'Dell looks you up and down. "Avatar, indeed! I do not like A'
	db	'vatars. But never mind that. I am called Dell. What dost tho'
	db	'u want?"'
L02BF:	db	00
L02C0:	db	'"How may I help thee?" Dell asks.'
L02E1:	db	00
L02E2:	db	'name'
L02E6:	db	00
L02E7:	db	'"My name is Dell. Did I not say that already?"'
L0315:	db	00
L0316:	db	'name'
L031A:	db	00
L031B:	db	'job'
L031E:	db	00
L031F:	db	'Dell looks disgruntled. "I sell weapons, armour, and provisi'
	db	'ons when I am not doing work for The Fellowship."'
L038C:	db	00
L038D:	db	'buy'
L0390:	db	00
L0391:	db	'"If thou art not going to buy anything, then get thy face ou'
	db	't of my sight!"'
L03DC:	db	00
L03DD:	db	'Fellowship'
L03E7:	db	00
L03E8:	db	'murder'
L03EE:	db	00
L03EF:	db	'"I am afraid I know nothing about it save for what is being '
	db	'said in the street, so do not ask me. If thou art not going '
	db	'to buy anything, then thou art wasting my time. Go away."'
L04A0:	db	00
L04A1:	db	'murder'
L04A7:	db	00
L04A8:	db	'Iolo whispers to you, "Pleasant chap, is he not?"'
