L0027:	db	00
L0028:	db	'You see a gorgeous and voluptuous woman in her thirties.'
L0060:	db	00
L0061:	db	'"Hello again!" Apollonia says, her eyes twinkling.'
L0093:	db	00
L0094:	db	'name'
L0098:	db	00
L0099:	db	'as her tongue licks her upper lip.'
L00BB:	db	00
L00BC:	db	'as she sizes you up.'
L00D0:	db	00
L00D1:	db	'"My name is Apollonia," she says, '
L00F3:	db	00
L00F4:	db	00
L00F5:	db	'name'
L00F9:	db	00
L00FA:	db	'job'
L00FD:	db	00
L00FE:	db	'"Why, I run the Honorable Hound Pub and Inn," she purrs.'
L0136:	db	00
L0137:	db	'"Wouldst thou like a room? Or wouldst thou like something to'
	db	' eat or drink? Just say so and I shall try and please thee w'
	db	'ith my delicacies."'
L01C2:	db	00
L01C3:	db	'~~You realize she is flirting with you.'
L01EA:	db	00
L01EB:	db	'flirt'
L01F0:	db	00
L01F1:	db	'"I shall be happy to serve thee during business hours!"'
L0228:	db	00
L0229:	db	'Honorable Hound'
L0238:	db	00
L0239:	db	'Honorable Hound'
L0248:	db	00
L0249:	db	'"I can think of no better place in all of Trinsic to lay thi'
	db	'ne head to rest or to nibble upon treats to satisfy thine ap'
	db	'petite."'
L02C9:	db	00
L02CA:	db	'Honorable Hound'
L02D9:	db	00
L02DA:	db	'murder'
L02E0:	db	00
L02E1:	db	'Apollonia shuts her eyes and shakes her head as if she had j'
	db	'ust bitten into a very sour lemon. "Oooh. That was so... hid'
	db	'eous! How could anyone do something so horrible? Art thou se'
	db	'arching for information? I do hope thou dost find the person'
	db	' responsible."'
L03DF:	db	00
L03E0:	db	'murder'
L03E6:	db	00
L03E7:	db	'food'
L03EB:	db	00
L03EC:	db	'"We serve the finest meat, fish, and cake. Our specialty is '
	db	'a Silverleaf meal. If thou wouldst like to buy something, pl'
	db	'ease say so!"'
