L0000:	db	'"Fool!! What possessed thee to cast that damned Armageddon S'
	db	'pell? I knew it was dangerous! Thou didst know it was danger'
	db	'ous!! Now look at us! We are all alone on the entire planet!'
	db	' Britannia is ruined! What kind of Avatar art thou!?! Now, w'
	db	'ith no Moongates working, we are both forced to spend eterni'
	db	'ty in this blasted wasteland!~~"Of course, it could be viewe'
	db	'd as a clever solution to all of our problems. After all, no'
	db	't even this so-called Guardian would want Britannia now!"*'
L01DE:	db	00
L01DF:	db	'"I felt the passing of the remains of Exodus from this realm'
	db	'. It has lifted a great weight from my shoulders. And so Ava'
	db	'tar, I cannot let this accomplishment go unrewarded. Please '
	db	'kneel, my friend." Lord British holds out his hands as you o'
	db	'bey his command.'
