L0818:	db	'"The state of the land could not be more prosperous. Dost th'
	db	'ou realize that thou hast been away for 200 Britannian years'
	db	'?" Lord British wags a finger at you.~~ "I am certain that t'
	db	'hy friends have rued thine absence. 'Tis a shame thou didst '
	db	'stay away so long! But... I am so very happy to see thee. Br'
	db	'itannia is prosperous and abundant. Look around thee. Explor'
	db	'e the newly refurbished castle. Travel the land. Peace is pr'
	db	'ominent in all quarters.~~"Yes, Britannia has never been bet'
	db	'ter. Well, almost never."'
L0A11:	db	00
L0A12:	db	'Britannia'
