L0A4A:	db	00
L0A4B:	db	'"Well, 'things' are indeed fine. It is the 'people' I am con'
	db	'cerned about.~~"There is something wrong in Britannia, but I'
	db	' do not know what it is. Something is hanging over the heads'
	db	' of the Britannian people. They are unhappy. One can see it '
	db	'in their eyes. There is nothing that is unifying the populat'
	db	'ion, since there has been peace for so long.~~"Perhaps thou '
	db	'couldst determine what is happening. I implore thee to go ou'
	db	't amongst the people. Watch them in their daily tasks. Speak'
	db	' with them. Work with them. Break bread with them. Perhaps t'
	db	'hey need someone like the Avatar to take an interest in thei'
	db	'r lives."'
