L0EA6:	db	'"Mine has not worked since the troubles with magic began. In'
	db	' fact, none of the Moongates have been working reliably for '
	db	'quite a while!'
L0F2C:	db	00
L0F2D:	db	'"Didst thou bring thine Orb of the Moons?"'
