L0F58:	db	'"Really? Where is it? Thou dost not have it on thee! '
L0F8D:	db	00
L0F8E:	db	'"I see. '
L0F96:	db	00
L0F97:	db	'"Hmmm. Thou might be stranded in Britannia. Here. Why not tr'
	db	'y mine? I shall let thee borrow it. Perhaps it will work for'
	db	' thee. Be careful, though. The Moongates have become dangero'
	db	'us."'
