L11C3:	db	'"I will not go near the place! Kings and dirty diapers do no'
	db	't mix. The Great Council talked me into implementing the nur'
	db	'sery after several of my staff started having families. Alth'
	db	'ough it was probably a necessity, I shall pretend it does no'
	db	't exist!"'
