L175B:	db	'"They are an extremely useful and productive group of citize'
	db	'ns. Thou shouldst most certainly visit the Fellowship Headqu'
	db	'arters here in Britain and speak with Batlin. The Fellowship'
	db	' has done many good deeds throughout Britannia, including fe'
	db	'eding the poor, educating and helping those in need, and pro'
	db	'moting general good will and peace."'
