L1B45:	db	'Iolo'
L1B49:	db	00
L1B4A:	db	'"I have seen our friend rarely over the years. I understand '
	db	'he has been spending most of his time in Trinsic."'
L1BB8:	db	00
L1BB9:	db	'"Hello, Iolo! How art thou?"*'
L1BD6:	db	00
L1BD7:	db	'"I am well, my liege! 'Tis good to see thee!"*'
L1C05:	db	00
L1C06:	db	'Iolo'
L1C0A:	db	00
L1C0B:	db	'Trinsic'
L1C12:	db	00
L1C13:	db	'Shamino'
L1C1A:	db	00
L1C1B:	db	'"That rascal does not come around very often, though I under'
	db	'stand he spends most of his time in Britain these days!"'
L1C8F:	db	00
L1C90:	db	'"What dost thou have to say for thyself, Shamino?"*'
L1CC3:	db	00
L1CC4:	db	'"Mine apologies, milord," Shamino says.*'
L1CEC:	db	00
L1CED:	db	'"What's this I hear of a woman? An actress? Hmmmm?"*'
L1D21:	db	00
L1D22:	db	'Shamino blushes and shuffles his feet.*'
L1D49:	db	00
L1D4A:	db	'"I suspected as much!" the ruler says, laughing.'
L1D7A:	db	00
L1D7B:	db	'Shamino'
L1D82:	db	00
L1D83:	db	'Dupre'
L1D88:	db	00
L1D89:	db	'"I have not seen that one since I knighted him. Typical -- I'
	db	' do the man a favor and he disappears! I heard he might be i'
	db	'n Jhelom."'
L1E0B:	db	00
L1E0C:	db	'"Where hast thou been, Sir Dupre?"*'
L1E2F:	db	00
L1E30:	db	'"Oh, here and there, milord," the fighter replies.*'
L1E63:	db	00
L1E64:	db	'"I have very few friends from our homeland here in Britannia'
	db	'. Thou must make a point to visit more often! Especially sin'
	db	'ce thou art a knight!"*'
L1EF3:	db	00
L1EF4:	db	'"If thou dost wish it, milord," Dupre says, bowing.*'
