	db	'st time. I even have trouble creating food with magic! It mu'
	db	'st be something to do with the magical ether.~~"There are th'
	db	'ose who say that magic is dying, what with the trouble with '
	db	'the Moongates and the situation with Nystul. I am beginning '
	db	'to suspect that they might be right!"'
