	db	'ck'. Before he went mad, he claimed that this mineral could '
	db	'solve the problems of the Moongates. I suggest that thou sho'
	db	'uldst go to Cove and find him. Try to learn what it was he w'
	db	'as doing with this blackrock material. It could be our only '
	db	'hope."'
