		.data
L0000:	db	'Batlin's eyes narrow to red slits as he peers practically th'
	db	'rough you.'
L0046:	db	00
L0047:	db	'"Thou hast the Cube! Thou cannot use it against -me-!"'
L007D:	db	00
L007E:	db	'With that, Batlin turns with a flourish, and vanishes before'
	db	' your eyes!*'
L00C6:	db	00
L00C7:	db	'Batlin looks at you and his gaze returns to the Armageddon w'
	db	'inter storm. "Many years ago, Avatar, I went to Skara Brae, '
	db	'the ghost city. The way the world is now reminds me of that '
	db	'dead place. In Skara Brae I had a spiritual experience so pr'
	db	'ofound that I have never spoken of to another soul. I would '
	db	'like to share that experience with thee now, Avatar.'
L0227:	db	00
L0228:	db	'"There at Skara Brae I saw a man who was called The Tortured'
	db	' One. I asked this dead man, pray tell, what is the answer t'
	db	'o the question of Life and Death? He gave me no reply, and I'
	db	' asked him again. I beseeched him to impart some small parce'
	db	'l of wisdom upon me. What is the answer to the question of L'
	db	'ife and Death?! He said nothing, but in his eyes... In his e'
	db	'yes I could see, Avatar, that he could not answer me for the'
	db	're was no answer to give. No answers to the question of Life'
	db	' and Death! It was then I understood. No meanings! No virtue'
	db	's! No values!!!... I commend thee, Avatar, for reaching that'
	db	' same liberating illumination!"*'
L04A0:	db	00
L04A1:	db	'"Art thou ready to answer questions from the Book of Fellows'
	db	'hip?"'
L04E2:	db	00
L04E3:	db	'"Excellent, Avatar!"'
L04F7:	db	00
L04F8:	db	'Fighting a tremble of hesitation you take a long deep drink '
	db	'from the goblet. Batlin steps up to you. "May the news sprea'
	db	'd far and wide that our newest member is none other than the'
	db	' Avatar!"'
L05B5:	db	00
L05B6:	db	'The other Fellowship members cheer with pleasure.'
L05E7:	db	00
L05E8:	db	'"Very good, Avatar."'
L05FC:	db	00
L05FD:	db	'"Allow me to present thee with thy Fellowship medallion." Ba'
	db	'tlin gives you the medallion. "Please -- wear thy medallion '
	db	'at all times for it shall be a symbol to all who see it that'
	db	' thou dost walk with the Fellowship. Ready it to thy neck im'
	db	'mediately! Oh, and... welcome to The Fellowship, Avatar."*'
L0727:	db	00
L0728:	db	'"Thou art too encumbered to receive thy Fellowship medallion'
	db	'. Thou must lighten thy load."*'
L0783:	db	00
L0784:	db	'"My dear Avatar. Thou must realize that thou must know every'
	db	'thing there is to know about The Fellowship before I can ind'
	db	'uct thee. Please study thy Book of Fellowship and return to '
	db	'me.'
L083B:	db	00
L083C:	db	'Your mind seems unclear. I would not be surprised if thou do'
	db	'st not understand	another soul with whom thou dost speak."'
L08B2:	db	00
L08B3:	db	'"Come back when thou art ready."*'
