L0989:	db	00
L098A:	db	'Meditation Retreat'
L099C:	db	00
L099D:	db	'You see a rotund older gentleman, who is at once humble yet '
	db	'dignified. His gentle eyes exude caring for his fellow perso'
	db	'n.'
L0A17:	db	00
L0A18:	db	'The man's eyes focus on the Fellowship medallion around your'
	db	' neck.'
L0A5A:	db	00
L0A5B:	db	'"My dear friend, thou art falsely impersonating a Fellowship'
	db	' member! Remove that medallion at once!"*'
L0AC0:	db	00
L0AC1:	db	'"I shall not speak to thee unless thou dost remove that Fell'
	db	'owship medallion. Thou art falsely impersonating a Fellowshi'
	db	'p member!"*'
L0B44:	db	00
L0B45:	db	'"'
L0B46:	db	00
L0B47:	db	', my dear, dear friend! How wonderful to see thee again!" sa'
	db	'ys Batlin.'
L0B8D:	db	00
L0B8E:	db	'name'
L0B92:	db	00
L0B93:	db	'"My name, good friend, is Batlin. And indeed it is truly a p'
	db	'rivilege to meet the Avatar in the flesh."'
L0BF9:	db	00
L0BFA:	db	'name'
L0BFE:	db	00
L0BFF:	db	'job'
L0C02:	db	00
L0C03:	db	'"I was once a druid. Now I am the leader and the originator '
	db	'of The Fellowship. It is rapidly growing throughout Britanni'
	db	'a and keeps me very busy, as thou canst well imagine. Ha! Ha'
	db	'! Ha!"'
L0CBD:	db	00
L0CBE:	db	'Fellowship'
L0CC8:	db	00
L0CC9:	db	'Fellowship'
L0CD3:	db	00
L0CD4:	db	'"The Fellowship was formed twenty years ago with the full ap'
	db	'proval and support of Lord British. It is a society of spiri'
	db	'tual seekers who strive to reach the highest levels of human'
	db	' potential and to share this knowledge freely with all peopl'
	db	'e."'
L0DC7:	db	00
L0DC8:	db	'Fellowship'
L0DD2:	db	00
L0DD3:	db	'spiritual'
L0DDC:	db	00
L0DDD:	db	'spiritual'
L0DE6:	db	00
L0DE7:	db	'"The Fellowship advances the philosophy of sanguine cognitio'
	db	'n, a way to apply a positive order of thought to one's life '
	db	'through what is called the Triad of Inner Strength."'
L0E93:	db	00
L0E94:	db	'spiritual'
L0E9D:	db	00
L0E9E:	db	'Triad'
L0EA3:	db	00
L0EA4:	db	'sanguine cognition'
L0EB6:	db	00
L0EB7:	db	'sanguine cognition'
L0EC9:	db	00
L0ECA:	db	'"We strive to avoid the mistakes made by mystics and sages s'
	db	'ince the dawn of time. They apply the standards of the past,'
	db	' such as the virtues, for example, to qualify the present, a'
	db	'nd thus they do not perceive it correctly. We seek to examin'
	db	'e our present lives each on our own terms and see the world '
	db	'the way it is."'
L1005:	db	00
L1006:	db	'sanguine cognition'
L1018:	db	00
L1019:	db	'virtues'
L1020:	db	00
L1021:	db	'virtues'
L1028:	db	00
L1029:	db	'"They are perfectly adequate for those who feel that they st'
	db	'ill need them for whatever reason. But no one, not even thys'
	db	'elf, thou must admit, Avatar, can fulfill them perfectly. Th'
	db	'erefore they are a philosophy that is ultimately based upon '
	db	'failure. We have never claimed that our teachings are a subs'
	db	'titute for the virtues. However, ours is a belief that is ba'
	db	'sed upon success, not failure."'
L11B0:	db	00
L11B1:	db	'virtues'
L11B8:	db	00
L11B9:	db	'Triad'
L11BE:	db	00
L11BF:	db	'"The Triad of Inner Strength is simply three basic values th'
	db	'at, when applied in unison, enable one to be more creative, '
	db	'satisfied and successful in life."'
L1259:	db	00
L125A:	db	'Triad'
L125F:	db	00
L1260:	db	'values'
L1266:	db	00
L1267:	db	'values'
L126D:	db	00
L126E:	db	'"The three values of the Triad of Inner Strength are Strive '
	db	'For Unity, Trust Thy Brother and Worthiness Precedes Reward.'
	db	'"'
L12E7:	db	00
L12E8:	db	'values'
L12EE:	db	00
L12EF:	db	'Worthiness'
L12F9:	db	00
L12FA:	db	'Trust'
L12FF:	db	00
L1300:	db	'Unity'
L1305:	db	00
L1306:	db	'Unity'
L130B:	db	00
L130C:	db	'"When we say Strive For Unity, it is simply our way of expre'
	db	'ssing how the people of Britannia should all cooperate and w'
	db	'ork together. A worthwhile sentiment, I am certain thou woul'
	db	'dst concur."'
L13CC:	db	00
L13CD:	db	'Unity'
L13D2:	db	00
L13D3:	db	'join'
L13D7:	db	00
L13D8:	db	'Trust'
L13DD:	db	00
L13DE:	db	'"What The Fellowship means by this is that people are all th'
	db	'e same and the world is, generally speaking, a supportive, n'
	db	'urturing place. The trust we place in each other is like the'
	db	' pinions that hold our society together. Quite true, wouldst'
	db	' thou not say?"'
L14DD:	db	00
L14DE:	db	'Trust'
L14E3:	db	00
L14E4:	db	'join'
L14E8:	db	00
L14E9:	db	'Worthiness'
L14F3:	db	00
L14F4:	db	'"Allow me to explain the meaning of Worthiness Precedes Rewa'
	db	'rd. Each one of us seeks something which we desire from life'
	db	' and we must strive to be worthy of that which we seek. It w'
	db	'ould be difficult for thee to disagree I am quite sure."'
L15E0:	db	00
L15E1:	db	'Worthiness'
L15EB:	db	00
L15EC:	db	'join'
L15F0:	db	00
L15F1:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
L1606:	db	00
L1607:	db	'"Ah, my good colleagues Elizabeth and Abraham were just here'
	db	'. They left this morning for Minoc on Fellowship business. T'
	db	'hey deal with the distribution and collection of funds."'
L16B7:	db	00
L16B8:	db	'"I have not seen my colleagues since they were last here. Th'
	db	'ey are busy folk."'
L1706:	db	00
L1707:	db	'"I have not seen my colleagues since they were last here. Th'
	db	'ey are busy folk."'
L1755:	db	00
L1756:	db	'Batlin smiles and shakes his head. "Thou art not having much'
	db	' luck tracking them down, art thou? They were here, having d'
	db	'one some work in Jhelom, but now they have gone to Vesper to'
	db	' see about starting a branch there."'
L182E:	db	00
L182F:	db	'"I have not seen my colleagues since they were last here. Th'
	db	'ey are busy folk."'
L187D:	db	00
L187E:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
L1893:	db	00
L1894:	db	'join'
L1898:	db	00
L1899:	db	'"But thou art already a member, Avatar! One can only join on'
	db	'ce!"'
L18D9:	db	00
L18DA:	db	'"Thou hast not completed thy tasks. Remember that Worthiness'
	db	' Precedes Reward. Once thou hast completed the missions, tho'
	db	'u mayest join."'
L1961:	db	00
L1962:	db	'join'
L1966:	db	00
L1967:	db	'package'
L196E:	db	00
L196F:	db	'"Ah! I do hope thine hands are not too full to take the pack'
	db	'age."'
L19B0:	db	00
L19B1:	db	'"Excellent! Here it is. Thou must now be on thy way!"*'
L19E7:	db	00
L19E8:	db	'"Avatar! I am tired of this! Please make room in thine inven'
	db	'tory for the package!"*'
L1A3B:	db	00
L1A3C:	db	'delivered package'
L1A4D:	db	00
L1A4E:	db	'"Congratulations, Avatar, and our thanks to thee for success'
	db	'fully delivering our package to Elynor of Minoc. Now we have'
	db	' another task at hand before thou canst join The Fellowship.'
	db	' Because thou didst deliver the package thou hast proven thy'
	db	'self worthy of performing another mission."'
L1B69:	db	00
L1B6A:	db	'delivered package'
L1B7B:	db	00
L1B7C:	db	'mission'
L1B83:	db	00
L1B84:	db	'package delivered'
L1B95:	db	00
L1B96:	db	'"Avatar, didst thou deliver the package to Elynor of Minoc?"'
L1BD2:	db	00
L1BD3:	db	'"Didst thou open the package?"'
L1BF1:	db	00
L1BF2:	db	'"Thou knew that thou wast instructed not to open it. We put '
	db	'trust in thee to carry out our instructions to the letter an'
	db	'd that trust was broken."'
L1C83:	db	00
L1C84:	db	'mission'
L1C8B:	db	00
L1C8C:	db	'"That is not what Elynor of Minoc tells us. We put trust in '
	db	'thee to carry out our instructions to the letter and that tr'
	db	'ust was broken.'
L1D13:	db	00
L1D14:	db	'"I understand that the contents of the package were missing '
	db	'as well, and this is very serious indeed!'
L1D79:	db	00
L1D7A:	db	'"I am afraid that thou must carry out a mission for us as a '
	db	'test of trust if thou art to begin truly walking with The Fe'
	db	'llowship."'
L1DFC:	db	00
L1DFD:	db	'mission'
L1E04:	db	00
L1E05:	db	'Batlin's eyes open wide in surprise.'
L1E29:	db	00
L1E2A:	db	'"What has happened? Hast thou lost the package?"'
L1E5A:	db	00
L1E5B:	db	'"Tsk. Tsk. Tsk. That is most unfortunate. We put trust in th'
	db	'ee to deliver the package and that trust was broken. I am af'
	db	'raid that thou must carry out a mission for us as a test of '
	db	'trust if thou art to begin truly walking with The Fellowship'
	db	'."'
L1F4D:	db	00
L1F4E:	db	'mission'
L1F55:	db	00
L1F56:	db	'"Please deliver our package, Avatar. We have more business t'
	db	'o discuss once thou art finished."*'
L1FB5:	db	00
L1FB6:	db	'package delivered'
L1FC7:	db	00
L1FC8:	db	'mission'
L1FCF:	db	00
L1FD0:	db	'"Thou shalt visit the dungeon of Destard, which is in the mo'
	db	'untains just west of Trinsic. Do not worry, it is completely'
	db	' deserted. There thou shalt find a chest of Fellowship funds'
	db	' which was hidden for safekeeping just a few days ago. Thou '
	db	'wilt know the chest because it will contain not only gold bu'
	db	't two Fellowship medallions. The site is also most likely ma'
	db	'rked with a Fellowship staff. Bring these funds back to us w'
	db	'ithout losing a single coin and thou wilt have successfully '
	db	'completed thy mission. No need to bring the chest, just the '
	db	'gold. Now, thou must be on thy way!"*'
L2211:	db	00
L2212:	db	'mission'
L2219:	db	00
L221A:	db	'chest'
L221F:	db	00
L2220:	db	'"Ah yes, thou hast returned from Dungeon Destard! But wait! '
	db	'I do not see the Fellowship funds that thou wast to bring ba'
	db	'ck! What has happened?!"'
L22B0:	db	00
L22B1:	db	'ship sunk'
L22BA:	db	00
L22BB:	db	'pirates'
L22C2:	db	00
L22C3:	db	'monsters'
L22CB:	db	00
L22CC:	db	'a highwayman'
L22D8:	db	00
L22D9:	db	'chest'
L22DE:	db	00
L22DF:	db	'a highwayman'
L22EB:	db	00
L22EC:	db	'"Why, thy tale is outlandish! I refuse to believe it!" Batli'
	db	'n sniffs in irritation.'
L233F:	db	00
L2340:	db	'a highwayman'
L234C:	db	00
L234D:	db	'join'
L2351:	db	00
L2352:	db	'monsters'
L235A:	db	00
L235B:	db	'"Monsters! There are monsters lurking in dungeon Destard?! W'
	db	'ell then, I do apologize for thine inconvenience."'
L23C9:	db	00
L23CA:	db	'pirates'
L23D1:	db	00
L23D2:	db	'ship sunk'
L23DB:	db	00
L23DC:	db	'a highwayman'
L23E8:	db	00
L23E9:	db	'monsters'
L23F1:	db	00
L23F2:	db	'join'
L23F6:	db	00
L23F7:	db	'pirates'
L23FE:	db	00
L23FF:	db	'"Surely thou canst do better than that! If thou simply dost '
	db	'not wish to answer my question why dost thou not say so?"'
L2474:	db	00
L2475:	db	'pirates'
L247C:	db	00
L247D:	db	'join'
L2481:	db	00
L2482:	db	'ship sunk'
L248B:	db	00
L248C:	db	'Batlin slowly rolls his eyes. "Thou ought to have been a bar'
	db	'd, thou dost regale me with such stories!"'
L24F2:	db	00
L24F3:	db	'ship sunk'
L24FC:	db	00
L24FD:	db	'join'
L2501:	db	00
L2502:	db	'medallion'
L250B:	db	00
L250C:	db	'"Allow me to present thee with thy Fellowship medallion." Ba'
	db	'tlin gives you the medallion. "Please -- wear the medallion '
	db	'at all times. Ready it to thy neck immediately! Oh, and... w'
	db	'elcome to The Fellowship, Avatar."'
L25E2:	db	00
L25E3:	db	'medallion'
L25EC:	db	00
L25ED:	db	'"Thou cannot receive thy Fellowship medallion. Thou art too '
	db	'encumbered!"*'
L2636:	db	00
L2637:	db	'apples'
L263D:	db	00
L263E:	db	'"While thou art here, please feel free to enjoy an apple. Th'
	db	'e finest in all of Britannia, I am certain thou wilt find. T'
	db	'hey are provided to The Fellowship by the Royal Orchards."'
L26F0:	db	00
L26F1:	db	'apples'
L26F7:	db	00
L26F8:	db	'voice'
L26FD:	db	00
L26FE:	db	'"Once a person has walked with The Fellowship long enough an'
	db	'd applied the Triad of Inner Strength to his life, he has cl'
	db	'eared his mind of all conflicting, counterproductive thought'
	db	's to the point where he may actually hear his internal voice'
	db	' of reason. This voice of reason is the core of thine inner '
	db	'mind which guides thee through pure instinct, wisdom and irr'
	db	'eproachable logic. Once one starts to listen to it and follo'
	db	'w its guidance, one has achieved the height of enlightenment'
	db	'. Perhaps thou shalt hear it one day."'
L2904:	db	00
L2905:	db	'"Only active or potential Fellowship members are privy to th'
	db	'e concept of 'the voice'. I can tell thee more when thou dos'
	db	't take the Fellowship test."'
L2999:	db	00
L299A:	db	'test'
L299E:	db	00
L299F:	db	'voice'
L29A4:	db	00
L29A5:	db	'test'
L29A9:	db	00
L29AA:	db	'"Oh, art thou ready to join The Fellowship?"'
L29D6:	db	00
L29D7:	db	'"Until thou art ready to join, I cannot tell thee any more a'
	db	'bout the test."'
L2A22:	db	00
L2A23:	db	'join'
L2A27:	db	00
L2A28:	db	'test'
L2A2C:	db	00
L2A2D:	db	'Meditation Retreat'
L2A3F:	db	00
L2A40:	db	'"It is a retreat from the pressures and distractions of ever'
	db	'yday life where new members of The Fellowship may go and stu'
	db	'dy the philosophies of The Fellowship. It is located on an i'
	db	'sland east of Serpent's Hold."'
L2B12:	db	00
L2B13:	db	'Meditation Retreat'
L2B25:	db	00
L2B26:	db	'bye'
L2B29:	db	00
L2B2A:	db	'"Until we meet again, Avatar."*'
