L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'Shamino'
L0014:	db	00
L0015:	db	'This lovely actress is dressed in a mouse costume.'
L0047:	db	00
L0048:	db	'"Hello, there!" Amber says.'
L0063:	db	00
L0064:	db	'name'
L0068:	db	00
L0069:	db	'"I am Amber."'
L0076:	db	00
L0077:	db	'name'
L007B:	db	00
L007C:	db	'job'
L007F:	db	00
L0080:	db	'"I am an actress at the Royal Theatre. I am playing the role'
	db	' of Sherry the Mouse in the new play."'
L00E2:	db	00
L00E3:	db	'play'
L00E7:	db	00
L00E8:	db	'Sherry'
L00EE:	db	00
L00EF:	db	'Royal Theatre'
L00FC:	db	00
L00FD:	db	'Royal Theatre'
L010A:	db	00
L010B:	db	'"'Tis a lovely space in which to perform. I have dedicated m'
	db	'y life to acting, thou knowest."'
L0167:	db	00
L0168:	db	'Royal Theatre'
L0175:	db	00
L0176:	db	'dedicated'
L017F:	db	00
L0180:	db	'space'
L0185:	db	00
L0186:	db	'space'
L018B:	db	00
L018C:	db	'"Raymundo himself had a hand in the design of the theatre."'
L01C7:	db	00
L01C8:	db	'space'
L01CD:	db	00
L01CE:	db	'dedicated'
L01D7:	db	00
L01D8:	db	'"Actually, this will be my debut theatrical performance. I h'
	db	'ave been working as a barmaid waiting for my first chance to'
	db	' be in the theatre."'
L0264:	db	00
L0265:	db	'dedicated'
L026E:	db	00
L026F:	db	'play'
L0273:	db	00
L0274:	db	'"Between thee and me, methinks the play stinks." She winks a'
	db	't you.'
L02B6:	db	00
L02B7:	db	'play'
L02BB:	db	00
L02BC:	db	'Sherry'
L02C2:	db	00
L02C3:	db	'"Canst thou imagine such drivel? I do not believe there ever'
	db	' was a Sherry the Mouse. Who ever heard of a mouse that coul'
	db	'd talk! Especially these lines! I would rather play a queen.'
	db	' Much more fitting for me, I would say."'
L039F:	db	00
L03A0:	db	'Sherry'
L03A6:	db	00
L03A7:	db	'queen'
L03AC:	db	00
L03AD:	db	'lines'
L03B2:	db	00
L03B3:	db	'lines'
L03B8:	db	00
L03B9:	db	'"I have to memorize this preposterous children's story calle'
	db	'd 'Hubert's Hair-Raising Adventure'.'
L0419:	db	00
L041A:	db	'lines'
L041F:	db	00
L0420:	db	'queen'
L0425:	db	00
L0426:	db	'"I asked Raymundo about this and he threw a tantrum. He said'
	db	' that it would not be historically accurate. Ha! As if that '
	db	'were something of any significance!"'
L04C2:	db	00
L04C3:	db	'queen'
L04C8:	db	00
L04C9:	db	'Shamino'
L04D0:	db	00
L04D1:	db	'"Poo Poo Head!" she cries. She then rushes to him and kisses'
	db	' him full on the mouth. Shamino turns red and shuffles his f'
	db	'eet.*'
L054E:	db	00
L054F:	db	'"Not in front of the Avatar, Poo!"*'
L0572:	db	00
L0573:	db	'"To blazes with the Avatar!" She kisses him again. "The Avat'
	db	'ar is the last one who will convince thee to settle down."'
L05E9:	db	00
L05EA:	db	'"Dost thou know my beau? He is probably drowning his sorrows'
	db	' at the Blue Boar. The lazy knave! I will not let him go abo'
	db	'ut adventuring. It is time for him to settle down. Thou cans'
	db	't tell him I said so!"'
L06B4:	db	00
L06B5:	db	'Shamino'
L06BC:	db	00
L06BD:	db	'bye'
L06C0:	db	00
L06C1:	db	'"Adieu!"*'
L06CA:	db	00
L06CB:	db	'@Hubert the Lion was...@'
L06E3:	db	00
L06E4:	db	'@Why do I say that?@'
L06F8:	db	00
L06F9:	db	'@My costume is too big.@'
L0711:	db	00
L0712:	db	'@I -hate- my lines!@'
L0726:	db	00
