L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'This is a cute toddler holding a baby doll.'
L0038:	db	00
L0039:	db	'"Hi!" Kristy exclaims.'
L004F:	db	00
L0050:	db	'name'
L0054:	db	00
L0055:	db	'"Kwisty."'
L005E:	db	00
L005F:	db	'"Kristy, like Nicholas, is one of our orphans. She was found'
	db	' in an abandoned home in Paws by one of the Great Council me'
	db	'mbers."'
L00DE:	db	00
L00DF:	db	'name'
L00E3:	db	00
L00E4:	db	'job'
L00E7:	db	00
L00E8:	db	'"Tag! Playing tag!"'
L00FB:	db	00
L00FC:	db	'The toddler runs off in search of a nursery-mate.*'
L012E:	db	00
L012F:	db	'Kristy looks confused. "Sing. Horsey. Rosa. Winner."'
L0163:	db	00
L0164:	db	'winner'
L016A:	db	00
L016B:	db	'Rosa'
L016F:	db	00
L0170:	db	'horsey'
L0176:	db	00
L0177:	db	'sing'
L017B:	db	00
L017C:	db	'sing'
L0180:	db	00
L0181:	db	'Kristy is more than happy to do so. "A-B-C-D-E-F-G! H-I-K-M-'
	db	'M-M-O-P! Q-T-W-Y-X-Z!" She is proud of her song, although sh'
	db	'e didn't get it quite right.'
L0215:	db	00
L0216:	db	'sing'
L021A:	db	00
L021B:	db	'horsey'
L0221:	db	00
L0222:	db	'"I love horsey!" She rocks hard on the rocking horse.'
L0257:	db	00
L0258:	db	'horsey'
L025E:	db	00
L025F:	db	'Rosa'
L0263:	db	00
L0264:	db	'Kristy hugs her baby doll tight. "Rosa!"'
