L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a lean, young fighter with a rather dashing flair.'
L0047:	db	00
L0048:	db	'"Hello again!" Zella says.'
L0062:	db	00
L0063:	db	'name'
L0067:	db	00
L0068:	db	'"My name is Zella."'
L007B:	db	00
L007C:	db	'name'
L0080:	db	00
L0081:	db	'job'
L0084:	db	00
L0085:	db	'"I am a trainer. I specialize in hand-to-hand combat. After '
	db	'all, a fighter never knows when he might encounter an advers'
	db	'ary and suddenly realize he is unarmed. I call it 'boxing'. '
	db	'Boxing is not only a method of fighting -- it is an art."'
L0172:	db	00
L0173:	db	'train'
L0178:	db	00
L0179:	db	'combat'
L017F:	db	00
L0180:	db	'combat'
L0186:	db	00
L0187:	db	'"The field of battle contains many arenas. Almost any situat'
	db	'ion could arise. Every fighter should be knowledgeable and a'
	db	'dept at many forms of combat. I have mine own theory of figh'
	db	'ting."'
L0241:	db	00
L0242:	db	'combat'
L0248:	db	00
L0249:	db	'theory'
L024F:	db	00
L0250:	db	'arenas'
L0256:	db	00
L0257:	db	'arenas'
L025D:	db	00
L025E:	db	'"All the various arenas of combat, all the various styles on'
	db	'e may learn in fighting with various weapons, are not fighti'
	db	'ng in its purest form. To truly be a great fighter one must '
	db	'go to the source of all fighting knowledge."'
L033E:	db	00
L033F:	db	'arenas'
L0345:	db	00
L0346:	db	'theory'
L034C:	db	00
L034D:	db	'"Just as a castle is built from the foundation up, so must a'
	db	' fighter. One cannot simply begin by learning to fight with '
	db	'weapons. Weapons are merely an extension of a person's extre'
	db	'mities. A true fighter learns by using those extremities fir'
	db	'st."'
L0441:	db	00
L0442:	db	'theory'
L0448:	db	00
L0449:	db	'extremities'
L0454:	db	00
L0455:	db	'fighter'
L045C:	db	00
L045D:	db	'fighter'
L0464:	db	00
L0465:	db	'"Make no mistake. Fighters are made, not born. All the natur'
	db	'al talent in the world will avail thee naught if one does no'
	db	't have the heart and the will to win. Part of that will is t'
	db	'he courage to seek out thine own limitations and strive to b'
	db	'etter them."'
L0561:	db	00
L0562:	db	'fighter'
L0569:	db	00
L056A:	db	'extremities'
L0575:	db	00
L0576:	db	'"Thine arms. Thy legs. Thy fists. This is what makes 'boxing'
	db	''."'
L05B5:	db	00
L05B6:	db	'extremities'
L05C1:	db	00
L05C2:	db	'train'
L05C7:	db	00
L05C8:	db	'"My price for training is 45 gold. Is this all right?"'
L05FE:	db	00
L05FF:	db	'"Then mayest thou find more inexpensive training elsewhere."'
L063B:	db	00
L063C:	db	'"Be so kind as to return during normal training hours, would'
	db	'st thou?"'
L0681:	db	00
L0682:	db	'train'
L0687:	db	00
L0688:	db	'bye'
L068B:	db	00
L068C:	db	'"Good day to thee."*'
