L0000:	db	'Neno is busy performing with The Avatars and cannot speak at'
	db	' the moment.*'
L0049:	db	00
L004A:	db	'"I must get to my performance at The Blue Boar! The Avatars '
	db	'are playing tonight!"*'
L009C:	db	00
L009D:	db	'bye'
L00A0:	db	00
L00A1:	db	'job'
L00A4:	db	00
L00A5:	db	'name'
L00A9:	db	00
L00AA:	db	'You see a handsome and flamboyant musician.'
L00D5:	db	00
L00D6:	db	'"Hello," Neno says.'
L00E9:	db	00
L00EA:	db	'name'
L00EE:	db	00
L00EF:	db	'The musician nods at you. "I am Neno."'
L0115:	db	00
L0116:	db	'name'
L011A:	db	00
L011B:	db	'job'
L011E:	db	00
L011F:	db	'"I am studying to be the greatest bard that Britannia has ev'
	db	'er known. I probably already -am- the greatest bard Britanni'
	db	'a has ever known." You note that Neno is not at all modest.'
L01D2:	db	00
L01D3:	db	'studying'
L01DB:	db	00
L01DC:	db	'bard'
L01E0:	db	00
L01E1:	db	'bard'
L01E5:	db	00
L01E6:	db	'"It is a great honor to be a bard. Thou art someone who give'
	db	's pleasure to other people, while at the same time fulfillin'
	db	'g a creative urge within thyself. It is truly magical. I kno'
	db	'w this from mine experience playing with The Avatars."'
L02D0:	db	00
L02D1:	db	'bard'
L02D5:	db	00
L02D6:	db	'The Avatars'
L02E1:	db	00
L02E2:	db	'studying'
L02EA:	db	00
L02EB:	db	'"The Music Hall provides a great environment for study. Judi'
	db	'th is a wonderful teacher, and the opportunities here are of'
	db	' the highest quality. One day I shall travel the world and e'
	db	'ntertain the common folk and nobles alike."'
L03CA:	db	00
L03CB:	db	'studying'
L03D3:	db	00
L03D4:	db	'entertain'
L03DD:	db	00
L03DE:	db	'entertain'
L03E7:	db	00
L03E8:	db	'"It is my dream to be famous throughout the land. I shall to'
	db	'ur the country every year, and play in the largest pubs in e'
	db	'very town." He winks at you. "I shall be assured of wooing t'
	db	'he women, dost thou not think?"'
L04BB:	db	00
L04BC:	db	'entertain'
L04C5:	db	00
L04C6:	db	'The Avatars'
L04D1:	db	00
L04D2:	db	'"'Tis a singing group I play with. We play at The Blue Boar '
	db	'every evening. Please, come listen to us." Neno leans in to '
	db	'whisper, "But I plan to begin performing alone very soon. I '
	db	'am obviously the most talented member of the quartet."'
L05BC:	db	00
L05BD:	db	'The Avatars'
L05C8:	db	00
L05C9:	db	'bye'
L05CC:	db	00
L05CD:	db	'"Farewell! Thou must watch the postings for our performance '
	db	'dates!"*'
L0611:	db	00
