L03AA:	db	'puppet show'
L03B5:	db	00
L03B6:	db	'puppet show'
L03C1:	db	00
L03C2:	db	'"My childhood's eye spied father's toil,~"A puppet's show of'
	db	' splendor royal.~"Time's breeze has blown, My father's gone,'
	db	'~"His child has grown, Regrets anon,~"Gears and wheels move '
	db	'the moppets now, in need of no one,~"And so I keep his carni'
	db	'val song playing on and on alone."'
L04D4:	db	00
L04D5:	db	'puppet show'
L04E0:	db	00
L04E1:	db	'gears and wheels'
L04F1:	db	00
L04F2:	db	'regrets'
L04F9:	db	00
L04FA:	db	'strength test'
L0507:	db	00
L0508:	db	'"I am sorry to say~"I have called it a day.~"Come to the	gro'
	db	'unds to test thy fitness~"when I am, yea verily, open for bu'
	db	'siness."'
L0588:	db	00
L0589:	db	'"Take the hammer in thine hands and strike a blow upon the g'
	db	'round,~"If thine arms be possessed of might then thou shalt '
	db	'hear a ringing sound.~"Once thou hast struck if thou hearest'
	db	' naught then thou dost know thy strength is flagging.~"But i'
	db	'f thou dost win the strength test game thou shalt receive a '
	db	'stuffed dragon."'
L06C5:	db	00
L06C6:	db	'strength test'
L06D3:	db	00
L06D4:	db	'gears and wheels'
L06E4:	db	00
L06E5:	db	'"I fear an end to my family craft, where the show is run by '
	db	'human heart,~"But bones do age, not so machines, and we cann'
	db	'ot simply replace a part.~"I carry on as best I can, A machi'
	db	'ne to play my father's role,~"Control the marionettes unseen'
	db	', struggling to imbue them with a soul."'
L07FD:	db	00
L07FE:	db	'gears and wheels'
L080E:	db	00
L080F:	db	'regrets'
L0816:	db	00
L0817:	db	'"The faces pressed before me, fleeting moments chance of gle'
	db	'e, From the lowly mongrel beggar to the resident of throne,~'
	db	'"Each know their place and gave me chase to find the one for'
	db	' me, Woman whom my life may share, this heart that waits alo'
	db	'ne."'
