L0E5B:	db	00
L0E5C:	db	'Carrocio gives you a shocked look and drops to his knees bef'
	db	'ore you. "I beseech thee, '
L0EB2:	db	00
L0EB3:	db	', ~"Keep still thy tongue,~"My Nell has ne'er harmed anyone,'
	db	'~"It would cause grievous injury to her reputation,~"Through'
	db	' the town's wagging lips our secret to spread,~"'Twould make'
	db	' a permanent end of mine occupation,~"And kill our hope of a'
	db	' happy life dead." He looks you in the eyes, pleadingly. "In'
	db	' thee I must place mine hope and trust,~"Part, parcel and wh'
	db	'ole.~"To ne'er again speak of the spoils of my lust, ~"Thou '
	db	'must not tell a soul!"'
L106D:	db	00
L106E:	db	'He looks at you awaiting some sort of indication. Will you k'
	db	'eep his secret?'
L10B9:	db	00
L10BA:	db	'"Thou dost walk with honor,~"I know thou wilt not tell,~"Of '
	db	'dignity's stains I do not bother,~"My concerns are none save'
	db	' for Nell."'
L113D:	db	00
L113E:	db	'"Reconsider, I must insist of thee, Thou art too thin of hid'
	db	'e,~"If he knew, Nell's brother would murder me,~"And I would'
	db	' not see Nell widowed before having the chance to become a b'
	db	'ride."'
