L1209:	db	'Charles is angry'
L1219:	db	00
L121A:	db	'"I am grateful for thine honesty about thy lack of care,~"Bu'
	db	't why hast thou placed thyself in the center of our affair?~'
	db	'"For Nell's sake I could not bring myself to cause harm to h'
	db	'er brother,~"I shall convince him of mine intentions,~"I lov'
	db	'e Nell and no other.~"Leave me now for I must use this time '
	db	'to properly prepare."'
