		.data
L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a sturdy-looking farmer's wife. She gives you a hosp'
	db	'itable smile before returning to her chores.'
L0075:	db	00
L0076:	db	'"What brings us the pleasure of having thee back on this day'
	db	', '
L00B4:	db	00
L00B5:	db	'?" says Kelly.'
L00C3:	db	00
L00C4:	db	'name'
L00C8:	db	00
L00C9:	db	'"I am called Kelly, '
L00DD:	db	00
L00DE:	db	'."'
L00E0:	db	00
L00E1:	db	'name'
L00E5:	db	00
L00E6:	db	'job'
L00E9:	db	00
L00EA:	db	'"Mine husband Fred and I run the Farmer's Market."'
L011C:	db	00
L011D:	db	'buy'
L0120:	db	00
L0121:	db	'Farmer's Market'
L0130:	db	00
L0131:	db	'Fred'
L0135:	db	00
L0136:	db	'Fred'
L013A:	db	00
L013B:	db	'"My Fred is one of the most respected merchants in Britain. '
	db	'He sells the eggs and vegetables grown by Brownie and Mack, '
	db	'as well as exotic imported fruits."'
L01D6:	db	00
L01D7:	db	'Fred'
L01DB:	db	00
L01DC:	db	'Mack'
L01E0:	db	00
L01E1:	db	'Brownie'
L01E8:	db	00
L01E9:	db	'fruits and vegetables'
L01FE:	db	00
L01FF:	db	'eggs'
L0203:	db	00
L0204:	db	'Farmer's Market'
L0213:	db	00
L0214:	db	'"The Farmer's Market is where most of Britain buys its food.'
	db	' Why even the people in Paws will come here to buy eggs and '
	db	'vegetables. Fred has never raised the price of anything sinc'
	db	'e opening this market many years ago."'
L02EE:	db	00
L02EF:	db	'Farmer's Market'
L02FE:	db	00
L02FF:	db	'Paws'
L0303:	db	00
L0304:	db	'Britain'
L030B:	db	00
L030C:	db	'eggs'
L0310:	db	00
L0311:	db	'"Farmer Mack's chickens lay plenty of eggs. It is a good thi'
	db	'ng the people here have such healthy appetites!"'
L037D:	db	00
L037E:	db	'eggs'
L0382:	db	00
L0383:	db	'fruits and vegetables'
L0398:	db	00
L0399:	db	'"We sell those mostly to older people. Thou dost know, I am '
	db	'sure, how children do not like to eat their vegetables. Some'
	db	' people do not want to keep a lot of fruit in their home as '
	db	'they are afraid of attracting fruit flies."'
L0478:	db	00
L0479:	db	'fruits and vegetables'
L048E:	db	00
L048F:	db	'Brownie'
L0496:	db	00
L0497:	db	'"Brownie is a good man. I do hope he runs for the mayorship '
	db	'again. If he does thou must be sure to vote for him."'
L0508:	db	00
L0509:	db	'Brownie'
L0510:	db	00
L0511:	db	'Mack'
L0515:	db	00
L0516:	db	'"I do believe that poor old Mack has been cooped up with his'
	db	' chickens for too long. He is a good person. Do not be put o'
	db	'ff by the strange stories he doth tell. He rarely ever sleep'
	db	's as he spends most of the night staring at the sky. Of cour'
	db	'se his rooster crows at dawn and no farmer can afford to sle'
	db	'ep past the dawn. So his mind is a bit ragged."'
L0671:	db	00
L0672:	db	'Mack'
L0676:	db	00
L0677:	db	'Britain'
L067E:	db	00
L067F:	db	'"Oh, in Britain they look for quality produce. I see the peo'
	db	'ple who buy here look over every egg for cracks and every ve'
	db	'getable for any sign of spoilage."'
L0719:	db	00
L071A:	db	'Britain'
L0721:	db	00
L0722:	db	'Paws'
L0726:	db	00
L0727:	db	'"The people of Paws are always short of money. Mine heart go'
	db	'es out to them. They are always looking to buy the least exp'
	db	'ensive items for it is all they can afford."'
L07CB:	db	00
L07CC:	db	'Paws'
L07D0:	db	00
L07D1:	db	'buy'
L07D4:	db	00
L07D5:	db	'"The market is now closed. Thou must return when we are open'
	db	' for business."'
L0820:	db	00
L0821:	db	'"Wouldst thou like to buy some eggs, fruits or vegetables? W'
	db	'e have plenty of delicious fresh eggs here for thee. And our'
	db	' vegetables are sure to keep thee in good health."'
L08CB:	db	00
L08CC:	db	'"I am sure we have something here that will be to thy liking'
	db	'."'
L090A:	db	00
L090B:	db	'"Perhaps another time then."'
L0927:	db	00
L0928:	db	'buy'
L092B:	db	00
L092C:	db	'bye'
L092F:	db	00
L0930:	db	'"Good day to thee, '
L0943:	db	00
L0944:	db	'."*'
L0947:	db	00
L0948:	db	'@Come to the Farmer's Market!@'
L0966:	db	00
L0967:	db	'@The Market is open!@'
L097C:	db	00
L097D:	db	'@Vegetables! Meats!@'
L0991:	db	00
L0992:	db	'@Come one, come all!@'
L09A7:	db	00
