		.data
L0000:	db	'Gaye is watching the Fellowship meeting. She turns to you br'
	db	'usquely and puts a finger to her lips, gesturing for you to '
	db	'be silent.*'
L0083:	db	00
L0084:	db	'"I cannot imagine where Batlin is. I am worried about him...'
	db	'"'
L00C1:	db	00
L00C2:	db	'"I cannot speak now! I am on my way to the Fellowship meetin'
	db	'g at the Hall!"*'
L010E:	db	00
L010F:	db	'bye'
L0112:	db	00
L0113:	db	'job'
L0116:	db	00
L0117:	db	'name'
L011B:	db	00
L011C:	db	'Willy'
L0121:	db	00
L0122:	db	'You see a woman who oozes partially sincere friendliness.'
L015B:	db	00
L015C:	db	'"Hello again, and what may I do for thee today?" asks Gaye.'
L0197:	db	00
L0198:	db	'name'
L019C:	db	00
L019D:	db	'"My name is Gaye."'
L01AF:	db	00
L01B0:	db	'name'
L01B4:	db	00
L01B5:	db	'job'
L01B8:	db	00
L01B9:	db	'"I oversee the clothier's here in Britain when I am not purs'
	db	'uing the teachings of The Fellowship."'
L021B:	db	00
L021C:	db	'Fellowship'
L0226:	db	00
L0227:	db	'buy'
L022A:	db	00
L022B:	db	'clothiers'
L0234:	db	00
L0235:	db	'clothiers'
L023E:	db	00
L023F:	db	'"At our clothier's shop we have the finest silks and garment'
	db	's to buy that thou hast ever seen, imported from every corne'
	db	'r of Britannia to cater to all tastes."'
L02DE:	db	00
L02DF:	db	'clothiers'
L02E8:	db	00
L02E9:	db	'buy'
L02EC:	db	00
L02ED:	db	'"I am so sorry, the clothier's shop is closed. Please return'
	db	' during our regular business hours. We are open from nine un'
	db	'til six every day."'
L0378:	db	00
L0379:	db	'"Do not tell me! Raymundo sent thee to get an Avatar costume'
	db	'! They cost thirty gold coins. Dost thou want one?"'
L03E8:	db	00
L03E9:	db	'She looks you up and down. "Yes, I think we might be able to'
	db	' find something for thee."~~After several minutes of rummagi'
	db	'ng through the store, Gaye returns. "Here it is! Not many le'
	db	'ft-- we have had a run on them recently!"'
L04C6:	db	00
L04C7:	db	'"Um. Perhaps thou couldst return when thou dost have enough '
	db	'gold." She lays the costume down and smiles.'
L052F:	db	00
L0530:	db	'"Oh. Thou canst not carry this with what thou art already ca'
	db	'rrying. Mayhaps thou couldst dispose of something and return'
	db	' for the costume."'
L05BA:	db	00
L05BB:	db	'"It is, indeed, a pleasure to do business with thee, O great'
	db	' Avatar!" She grins and hands you the costume.'
L0625:	db	00
L0626:	db	'"'Tis strange! I thought for certain that thou wert the thea'
	db	'trical type!"'
L066F:	db	00
L0670:	db	'"Wouldst thou like to buy some clothing today?"'
L069F:	db	00
L06A0:	db	'"We have many nice clothes to choose from."'
L06CB:	db	00
L06CC:	db	'"Thou mayest look around for thyself. If thou dost change th'
	db	'y mind be sure to let me know."'
L0727:	db	00
L0728:	db	'buy'
L072B:	db	00
L072C:	db	'Fellowship'
L0736:	db	00
L0737:	db	'"Thou wouldst want to attend the Fellowship meeting tonight '
	db	'at nine o'clock. It is always a moving experience to hear th'
	db	'e words of Batlin, our founder."'
L07CF:	db	00
L07D0:	db	'Fellowship'
L07DA:	db	00
L07DB:	db	'philosophy'
L07E5:	db	00
L07E6:	db	'Willy'
L07EB:	db	00
L07EC:	db	'"Yes, he is a very amusing fellow. I am quite taken with him'
	db	' and I do see him against my better judgment. He does not se'
	db	'em like the type to join The Fellowship, though. Since The F'
	db	'ellowship is my whole life, I do not know if there is a plac'
	db	'e in it for him. I have not made up my mind about that yet."'
L0918:	db	00
L0919:	db	'Willy'
L091E:	db	00
L091F:	db	'bye'
L0922:	db	00
L0923:	db	'"Good day, '
L092E:	db	00
L092F:	db	'."*'
L0932:	db	00
L0933:	db	'@Clothing? Boots?@'
L0945:	db	00
L0946:	db	'@Swamp boots?@'
L0954:	db	00
L0955:	db	'@Tunic? Dress?@'
L0964:	db	00
L0965:	db	'@Fine clothes here!@'
L0979:	db	00
