		.data
L0000:	db	'Sean is deep in concentration, listening to the Fellowship m'
	db	'eeting.*'
L0044:	db	00
L0045:	db	'"I cannot imagine where Batlin is. He never misses Fellowshi'
	db	'p meeting!"'
L008C:	db	00
L008D:	db	'"I must not stop to speak now! I am late for the Fellowship '
	db	'meeting!"*'
L00D3:	db	00
L00D4:	db	'bye'
L00D7:	db	00
L00D8:	db	'job'
L00DB:	db	00
L00DC:	db	'name'
L00E0:	db	00
L00E1:	db	'You see a man whose boyish face is set with scrutinizing eye'
	db	's that look as if they have seen much.'
L0143:	db	00
L0144:	db	'"And what may I do for thee, '
L0161:	db	00
L0162:	db	'?" asks Sean.'
L016F:	db	00
L0170:	db	'name'
L0174:	db	00
L0175:	db	'"My name is Sean."'
L0187:	db	00
L0188:	db	'name'
L018C:	db	00
L018D:	db	'job'
L0190:	db	00
L0191:	db	'"When not tending to Fellowship affairs, I am a jeweller her'
	db	'e in Britain. If thou dost wish to buy something, say so!"'
L0207:	db	00
L0208:	db	'buy'
L020B:	db	00
L020C:	db	'Britain'
L0213:	db	00
L0214:	db	'jeweller'
L021C:	db	00
L021D:	db	'Fellowship'
L0227:	db	00
L0228:	db	'jeweller'
L0230:	db	00
L0231:	db	'"It is very delicate work. It requires a special touch that '
	db	'only a few have. Thou must know precisely how to handle prec'
	db	'ious materials. Only the finest of craftsmen become jeweller'
	db	's and they receive the highest compensation."'
L0312:	db	00
L0313:	db	'jeweller'
L031B:	db	00
L031C:	db	'finest craftsmen'
L032C:	db	00
L032D:	db	'precious materials'
L033F:	db	00
L0340:	db	'precious materials'
L0352:	db	00
L0353:	db	'"I constantly require new materials with which to create my '
	db	'very special jewelry. I am always in the market to buy gems.'
	db	' If thou dost ever come across any, I am the man to come to '
	db	'if thou shouldst want to sell them and make money."'
L043A:	db	00
L043B:	db	'precious materials'
L044D:	db	00
L044E:	db	'gems'
L0452:	db	00
L0453:	db	'finest craftsmen'
L0463:	db	00
L0464:	db	'"As I have told thee, only the finest of craftsmen become je'
	db	'wellers, and I am the finest of jewellers. Does that not tel'
	db	'l thee something?" Sean sniffs. "My business makes more mone'
	db	'y than the mint!" He laughs forcibly.'
L053D:	db	00
L053E:	db	'finest craftsmen'
L054E:	db	00
L054F:	db	'gems'
L0553:	db	00
L0554:	db	'"The jeweller's shop is currently closed for business. Come '
	db	'back later!"'
L059C:	db	00
L059D:	db	'"Dost thou have a gem for sale?"'
L05BD:	db	00
L05BE:	db	'"I will pay thee 30 gold coins per gem. Is that price agreea'
	db	'ble?"'
L05FF:	db	00
L0600:	db	'"Dost thou think me a fool?! This little blue bauble is wort'
	db	'hless!"'
L0643:	db	00
L0644:	db	'Sean's face tightens. "This gem is small and dark as the hea'
	db	'rt of an unholy Liche. Away with it!"'
L06A5:	db	00
L06A6:	db	'"Thou dost have no gems! Thou art a liar! I will do no busin'
	db	'ess with thee!"'
L06F1:	db	00
L06F2:	db	'"I see that thou has one gem."'
L0710:	db	00
L0711:	db	'"I see that thou hast '
L0727:	db	00
L0728:	db	' gems."'
L072F:	db	00
L0730:	db	'"Here is thy payment."'
L0746:	db	00
L0747:	db	'"Thou art carrying too much to take thy payment!"'
L0778:	db	00
L0779:	db	'"It seems we have little left to discuss then."'
L07A8:	db	00
L07A9:	db	'"If thou dost have no gems for sale then do not even waste m'
	db	'y time by mentioning it!"'
L07FE:	db	00
L07FF:	db	'gems'
L0803:	db	00
L0804:	db	'Fellowship'
L080E:	db	00
L080F:	db	'"I see thou art a member!" Sean suddenly looks at you with a'
	db	' bit more respect. "I am sure The Fellowship will do thee a '
	db	'world of good in the future." He smiles condescendingly.'
L08BF:	db	00
L08C0:	db	'"Even thou mayest join The Fellowship and I can tell thee mo'
	db	're about it."'
L0909:	db	00
L090A:	db	'"I can tell thee about The Fellowship's philosophy if thou d'
	db	'ost wish."'
L0950:	db	00
L0951:	db	'Fellowship'
L095B:	db	00
L095C:	db	'philosophy'
L0966:	db	00
L0967:	db	'philosophy'
L0971:	db	00
L0972:	db	'"Thou art really interested in hearing more?"'
L099F:	db	00
L09A0:	db	'"I thought I was wasting my breath on thee."'
L09CC:	db	00
L09CD:	db	'philosophy'
L09D7:	db	00
L09D8:	db	'Britain'
L09DF:	db	00
L09E0:	db	'"I moved mine entire business here to Britain to be near the'
	db	' main branch of The Fellowship. Thou hast no idea how much m'
	db	'y business improved after I joined The Fellowship."'
L0A8B:	db	00
L0A8C:	db	'Britain'
L0A93:	db	00
L0A94:	db	'Fellowship'
L0A9E:	db	00
L0A9F:	db	'buy'
L0AA2:	db	00
L0AA3:	db	'"Wouldst thou like to buy something?"'
L0AC8:	db	00
L0AC9:	db	'"Then please browse if thou dost like."'
L0AF0:	db	00
L0AF1:	db	'"Please come to the shop during normal business hours."'
L0B28:	db	00
L0B29:	db	'buy'
L0B2C:	db	00
L0B2D:	db	'bye'
L0B30:	db	00
L0B31:	db	'"I am sure thou must be on thy way." Sean smiles.*'
L0B63:	db	00
L0B64:	db	'@Fine jewelry!@'
L0B73:	db	00
L0B74:	db	'@Need gold trinkets?@'
L0B89:	db	00
L0B8A:	db	'@Fine gems!@'
L0B96:	db	00
L0B97:	db	'@Fine crafted jewelry!@'
L0BAE:	db	00
