L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see an impressive winged gargoyle with a stately demeano'
	db	'r.'
L004B:	db	00
L004C:	db	'"To greet thee again," Wislem says.'
L006F:	db	00
L0070:	db	'name'
L0074:	db	00
L0075:	db	'"To be known as Wislem."'
L008D:	db	00
L008E:	db	'name'
L0092:	db	00
L0093:	db	'Wislem'
L0099:	db	00
L009A:	db	'Wislem'
L00A0:	db	00
L00A1:	db	'To be the word for `wise man.'"'
L00C0:	db	00
L00C1:	db	'Wislem'
L00C7:	db	00
L00C8:	db	'job'
L00CB:	db	00
L00CC:	db	'"To be advisor to Lord British, and act as representative fo'
	db	'r my race here in Britain. To be honored to be in long line '
	db	'of advisors to the king."'
L015D:	db	00
L015E:	db	'advisor'
L0165:	db	00
L0166:	db	'advisor'
L016D:	db	00
L016E:	db	'"To make sure the gargoyle race is heard in the castle. To h'
	db	'ave been a long road to acceptance and integration into Brit'
	db	'annian society."'
L01F6:	db	00
L01F7:	db	'society'
L01FE:	db	00
L01FF:	db	'integration'
L020A:	db	00
L020B:	db	'advisor'
L0212:	db	00
L0213:	db	'integration'
L021E:	db	00
L021F:	db	'"To tell you that, not long after your last visit, the gargo'
	db	'yles settled upon Terfin, an island to the southeast. To hav'
	db	'e moved, little by little, onto the mainland."'
L02C5:	db	00
L02C6:	db	'integration'
L02D1:	db	00
L02D2:	db	'society'
L02D9:	db	00
L02DA:	db	'"To be accepted in most places. To feel sad, however, that t'
	db	'here are still towns that do not accept us. But our Lord and'
	db	' King, Draxinusom, is still alive and is doing a magnificent'
	db	' job. To know and help all gargoyles who are alive."'
L03C2:	db	00
L03C3:	db	'Inamo'
L03C8:	db	00
L03C9:	db	'society'
L03D0:	db	00
L03D1:	db	'Inamo'
L03D6:	db	00
L03D7:	db	'Wislem listens to your story about the murders in Trinsic. "'
	db	'To be sad to hear this. To suggest that you visit Lord Draxi'
	db	'nusom in Terfin and tell him about Inamo. He will know who I'
	db	'namo's parent gargoyle is. To recommend you relay this news '
	db	'as soon as possible.~~"To go soon and tell Draxinusom about '
	db	'Inamo?"'
L050A:	db	00
L050B:	db	'"To know you are reliable."'
L0526:	db	00
L0527:	db	'"To be concerned that Inamo's parent shall never know what h'
	db	'appened." He appears saddened.'
L0581:	db	00
L0582:	db	'Inamo'
L0587:	db	00
L0588:	db	'bye'
L058B:	db	00
L058C:	db	'"To bid farewell."*'
