L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a very large mouse with an air of superior intellige'
	db	'nce.~~"Avatar!" she exclaims. "I cannot believe thou art her'
	db	'e, '
L0088:	db	00
L0089:	db	'!"'
L008B:	db	00
L008C:	db	'"Hello, '
L0094:	db	00
L0095:	db	'!" Sherry the Mouse exclaims.'
L00B2:	db	00
L00B3:	db	'name'
L00B7:	db	00
L00B8:	db	'"Why, dost thou not remember Sherry, '
L00DD:	db	00
L00DE:	db	'?"'
L00E0:	db	00
L00E1:	db	'name'
L00E5:	db	00
L00E6:	db	'job'
L00E9:	db	00
L00EA:	db	'"I am trying to keep up with these children! We are playing '
	db	'tag through the castle! I must run! Talk to me later in the '
	db	'nursery!"*'
L016C:	db	00
L016D:	db	'"I mainly assist Nanna in the Royal Nursery during the day. '
	db	'I watch the children alone in the evenings while Nanna has d'
	db	'inner and goes to her Fellowship meeting. Other times I run '
	db	'around the castle looking for mouse food!"'
L024B:	db	00
L024C:	db	'mouse food'
L0256:	db	00
L0257:	db	'castle'
L025D:	db	00
L025E:	db	'Royal Nursery'
L026B:	db	00
L026C:	db	'Royal Nursery'
L0279:	db	00
L027A:	db	'"The children are so much fun. I like to read them their fav'
	db	'orite story. It happens to be Lord British's favorite childr'
	db	'en's story, too! He read it to me oh, those many years ago."'
L032E:	db	00
L032F:	db	'Royal Nursery'
L033C:	db	00
L033D:	db	'story'
L0342:	db	00
L0343:	db	'children'
L034B:	db	00
L034C:	db	'children'
L0354:	db	00
L0355:	db	'"If thou hast not had the chance yet, do look around and mee'
	db	't them. They are most wonderful and amusing."'
L03BE:	db	00
L03BF:	db	'children'
L03C7:	db	00
L03C8:	db	'castle'
L03CE:	db	00
L03CF:	db	'"It is much the same as it was when thou wert last here. The'
	db	're has been a bit of remodeling. After all, it has been 200 '
	db	'years since thou wert last here! I believe Lord British has '
	db	'a storeroom with quite a bit of equipment inside."'
L04B5:	db	00
L04B6:	db	'castle'
L04BC:	db	00
L04BD:	db	'mouse food'
L04C7:	db	00
L04C8:	db	'"Well, cheese is my favorite. If thou dost ever have cheese '
	db	'to give away, I will gladly eat it. But I will generally eat'
	db	' most anything. Dost thou have any cheese for me?"'
L0572:	db	00
L0573:	db	'"Want to give me some?"'
L058A:	db	00
L058B:	db	'"Thank thee, '
L0598:	db	00
L0599:	db	'!"'
L059B:	db	00
L059C:	db	'"I am unable to take thy cheese at the moment, '
L05CB:	db	00
L05CC:	db	'."'
L05CE:	db	00
L05CF:	db	'"Well! I thought thou wert my friend!"'
L05F5:	db	00
L05F6:	db	'"But thou hast not got any cheese!"'
L0619:	db	00
L061A:	db	'"Too bad! If thou dost find any, please keep me in mind!"'
L0653:	db	00
L0654:	db	'mouse food'
L065E:	db	00
L065F:	db	'story'
L0664:	db	00
L0665:	db	'"Dost thou want to hear the story? It is called 'Hubert's Ha'
	db	'ir-Raising Adventure'."'
L06B8:	db	00
L06B9:	db	'Sherry stands on her hind legs, takes a deep breath, and the'
	db	'n recites -- from memory -- very, very fast:'
L0721:	db	00
L0722:	db	'"Some other time, then!"'
L073A:	db	00
L073B:	db	'story'
L0740:	db	00
L0741:	db	'bye'
L0744:	db	00
L0745:	db	'"Farewell, '
L0750:	db	00
L0751:	db	'!"*'
L0754:	db	00
L0755:	db	'@Tag! Thou art it!@'
L0768:	db	00
L0769:	db	'@Cannot catch me!@'
L077B:	db	00
L077C:	db	'@Nyah nyah! Thou art it!@'
L0795:	db	00
L0796:	db	'@Catch me if thou can!@'
L07AD:	db	00
