L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'A winged gargoyle looks at you with interest and obvious int'
	db	'elligence.'
L0053:	db	00
L0054:	db	'"To welcome thee to Britain, Avatar!"'
L0079:	db	00
L007A:	db	'"To greet thee again, Avatar!" Inwisloklem smiles.'
L00AC:	db	00
L00AD:	db	'name'
L00B1:	db	00
L00B2:	db	'"To be called Inwisloklem."'
L00CD:	db	00
L00CE:	db	'name'
L00D2:	db	00
L00D3:	db	'Inwisloklem'
L00DE:	db	00
L00DF:	db	'Inwisloklem'
L00EA:	db	00
L00EB:	db	'"To mean `interpreter' in your language."'
L0114:	db	00
L0115:	db	'Inwisloklem'
L0120:	db	00
L0121:	db	'job'
L0124:	db	00
L0125:	db	'"To be, indeed, an interpreter in my homeland. To be now on '
	db	'the Great Council to serve our most noble ruler, Lord Britis'
	db	'h. To be honored as one of the two gargoyles on the Council.'
	db	'"'
L01DA:	db	00
L01DB:	db	'Great Council'
L01E8:	db	00
L01E9:	db	'gargoyles'
L01F2:	db	00
L01F3:	db	'gargoyles'
L01FC:	db	00
L01FD:	db	'"To be one of the surviving gargoyles, and to preserve our h'
	db	'eritage is my life work. To tell you our race emigrated to B'
	db	'ritannia many, many years ago. To have settled on the island'
	db	' known as Terfin."'
L02C3:	db	00
L02C4:	db	'Terfin'
L02CA:	db	00
L02CB:	db	'surviving'
L02D4:	db	00
L02D5:	db	'gargoyles'
L02DE:	db	00
L02DF:	db	'surviving'
L02E8:	db	00
L02E9:	db	'"To be so many of my people killed two hundred years ago in '
	db	'the War of the False Prophet. To be the war that you ended b'
	db	'y bringing peace between our races."'
L0385:	db	00
L0386:	db	'surviving'
L038F:	db	00
L0390:	db	'Terfin'
L0396:	db	00
L0397:	db	'"To be a lonely place. To be desolate. To be not what humans'
	db	' call `homey'. To desire to establish a new way of life for '
	db	'gargoyles in Britannia, and to eliminate the hatred and misu'
	db	'nderstanding of our race in humans. To know that ignorance b'
	db	'reeds bigotry. To be one of those who are correcting this."'
L04C2:	db	00
L04C3:	db	'those'
L04C8:	db	00
L04C9:	db	'way of life'
L04D4:	db	00
L04D5:	db	'Terfin'
L04DB:	db	00
L04DC:	db	'way of life'
L04E7:	db	00
L04E8:	db	'"To desire a world where humans and gargoyles could live tog'
	db	'ether in peace as equals in Britannian society."'
L0554:	db	00
L0555:	db	'way of life'
L0560:	db	00
L0561:	db	'those'
L0566:	db	00
L0567:	db	'"To be called The Fellowship."'
L0585:	db	00
L0586:	db	'Fellowship'
L0590:	db	00
L0591:	db	'those'
L0596:	db	00
L0597:	db	'Fellowship'
L05A1:	db	00
L05A2:	db	'"To be dedicated to promoting good will and trust in the lan'
	db	'd. To be thinking of joining the group soon!"'
L060B:	db	00
L060C:	db	'Fellowship'
L0616:	db	00
L0617:	db	'Great Council'
L0624:	db	00
L0625:	db	'"To create the laws of the land. To inform you that my colle'
	db	'ague, Miranda, can tell you more of what we are doing now. T'
	db	'o be unfortunate that most of the Council is away now."'
L06D4:	db	00
L06D5:	db	'away'
L06D9:	db	00
L06DA:	db	'Miranda'
L06E1:	db	00
L06E2:	db	'Great Council'
L06EF:	db	00
L06F0:	db	'Miranda'
L06F7:	db	00
L06F8:	db	'"To inform you that Miranda is an intelligent woman who has '
	db	'great concern for the well being of all of Britannia's citiz'
	db	'ens. To be one of Lord British's most trusted advisors."'
L07A8:	db	00
L07A9:	db	'Miranda'
L07B0:	db	00
L07B1:	db	'away'
L07B5:	db	00
L07B6:	db	'"To be on holiday at the moment. To have only Miranda and my'
	db	'self present to enact this new law."'
L0816:	db	00
L0817:	db	'law'
L081A:	db	00
L081B:	db	'away'
L081F:	db	00
L0820:	db	'law'
L0823:	db	00
L0824:	db	'"To tell you to ask Miranda about it, for she knows more tha'
	db	'n I."'
L0865:	db	00
L0866:	db	'law'
L0869:	db	00
L086A:	db	'bye'
L086D:	db	00
L086E:	db	'"To say farewell."*'
L0881:	db	00
