		.data
L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'Moongates'
L0016:	db	00
L0017:	db	'blackrock'
L0020:	db	00
L0021:	db	'This elderly mage looks older and more senile than when you '
	db	'last saw him.'
L006A:	db	00
L006B:	db	'"Who art thou?" Rudyom asks. "Oh -- I remember."'
L009B:	db	00
L009C:	db	'"Hello again, Avatar!" Rudyom says, beaming.'
L00C8:	db	00
L00C9:	db	'name'
L00CD:	db	00
L00CE:	db	'"That I know. My name is Rudyom."'
L00EF:	db	00
L00F0:	db	'name'
L00F4:	db	00
L00F5:	db	'job'
L00F8:	db	00
L00F9:	db	'"I am not sure anymore. I was a powerful mage at one time! N'
	db	'ow nothing works. Magic is afoul! I suppose I could sell the'
	db	'e some reagents and spells if thou dost want. And mind the c'
	db	'arpet -- it does not work!"'
L01C8:	db	00
L01C9:	db	'carpet'
L01CF:	db	00
L01D0:	db	'"I am a powerful mage! Magic is my milieu! I can sell thee s'
	db	'pells or reagents."'
L021F:	db	00
L0220:	db	'reagents'
L0228:	db	00
L0229:	db	'spells'
L022F:	db	00
L0230:	db	'magic'
L0235:	db	00
L0236:	db	'magic'
L023B:	db	00
L023C:	db	'"I do not understand what is wrong. My magic does not work s'
	db	'o well anymore."'
L0288:	db	00
L0289:	db	'"The ether is flowing freely! Magic is with us once again!"'
L02C4:	db	00
L02C5:	db	'magic'
L02CA:	db	00
L02CB:	db	'carpet'
L02D1:	db	00
L02D2:	db	'"The big blue carpet. 'Tis a flying carpet. It does not work'
	db	' like it should."'
L031F:	db	00
L0320:	db	'Rudyom looks around and scratches his head.'
L034B:	db	00
L034C:	db	'"Funny. It was here a while ago. Oh! I remember now. Some ad'
	db	'venturers borrowed my flying carpet a few weeks ago. When th'
	db	'ey returned they said they had lost it near Serpent's Spine.'
	db	' Somewhere in the vicinity of the Lost River. I suppose	if t'
	db	'hou didst want to go and find it, thou couldst keep it. It d'
	db	'id not work very well. Perhaps thou canst make it work. I di'
	db	'd not like the color, anyway!"'
L04D2:	db	00
L04D3:	db	'carpet'
L04D9:	db	00
L04DA:	db	'spells'
L04E0:	db	00
L04E1:	db	'"Dost thou wish to buy some spells?"'
L0505:	db	00
L0506:	db	'"Oh. Never mind, then."'
L051D:	db	00
L051E:	db	'reagents'
L0526:	db	00
L0527:	db	'"Dost thou wish to buy some reagents?"'
L054D:	db	00
L054E:	db	'"Oh. Never mind, then."'
L0565:	db	00
L0566:	db	'blackrock'
L056F:	db	00
L0570:	db	'"Do not mention that foul mineral's name to me! It hast caus'
	db	'ed me much frustration! Before my mind lost me I was conduct'
	db	'ing experiments with the infernal material. But now I cannot'
	db	' for the life of me remember what it was I was trying to do.'
	db	'"'
L0661:	db	00
L0662:	db	'experiments'
L066D:	db	00
L066E:	db	'blackrock'
L0677:	db	00
L0678:	db	'Moongates'
L0681:	db	00
L0682:	db	'"They are a nuisance, are they not? I do believe that blackr'
	db	'ock is the solution to the problem. I wish my mind had not l'
	db	'ost me, or I could continue my work..."'
L0721:	db	00
L0722:	db	'"I understand they are gone for good. Do not blame thyself, '
	db	'Avatar. The disaster will only pave the way for a new era in'
	db	' experimentation and discovery. I hope."'
L07C2:	db	00
L07C3:	db	'Moongates'
L07CC:	db	00
L07CD:	db	'experiments'
L07D8:	db	00
L07D9:	db	'"I wrote them all down in my notebook, which is somewhere ar'
	db	'ound here. Thou art welcome to look at it. But stay away fro'
	db	'm that damned transmuter -- 'tis dangerous!"'
L087D:	db	00
L087E:	db	'notebook'
L0886:	db	00
L0887:	db	'transmuter'
L0891:	db	00
L0892:	db	'experiments'
L089D:	db	00
L089E:	db	'notebook'
L08A6:	db	00
L08A7:	db	'"I used it to record mine experiments with blackrock and the'
	db	' blackrock transmuter."'
L08FA:	db	00
L08FB:	db	'notebook'
L0903:	db	00
L0904:	db	'transmuter'
L090E:	db	00
L090F:	db	'"'Tis that wand-like thing. It was supposed to magnetize and'
	db	' magically transmute blackrock, but it doth not work correct'
	db	'ly. Try pointing it at a piece of blackrock and thou wilt se'
	db	'e what I mean. But do not stand too close! Thou art welcome '
	db	'to take it if thou dost want a piece of garbage!"'
L0A30:	db	00
L0A31:	db	'transmuter'
L0A3B:	db	00
L0A3C:	db	'bye'
L0A3F:	db	00
L0A40:	db	'"Leaving so soon? Deary me. I hope I remember thee if thou d'
	db	'ost come back."*'
L0A8C:	db	00
L0A8D:	db	'"Goodbye, Avatar."*'
L0AA0:	db	00
