L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'De Maria'
L0015:	db	00
L0016:	db	'This beautiful, earthy woman in her forties gives you a frie'
	db	'ndly smile.'
L005D:	db	00
L005E:	db	'"Hello," Zinaida says.'
L0074:	db	00
L0075:	db	'name'
L0079:	db	00
L007A:	db	'"I am Zinaida," she says with a curtsey.'
L00A2:	db	00
L00A3:	db	'name'
L00A7:	db	00
L00A8:	db	'De Maria'
L00B0:	db	00
L00B1:	db	'job'
L00B4:	db	00
L00B5:	db	'"I am the owner and manager of The Emerald."'
L00E1:	db	00
L00E2:	db	'"If I can help thee with food or drink, please say so. I hav'
	db	'e never had a dissatisfied customer."'
L0143:	db	00
L0144:	db	'buy'
L0147:	db	00
L0148:	db	'food'
L014C:	db	00
L014D:	db	'drink'
L0152:	db	00
L0153:	db	'"Please come to the pub when it is open and I shall be happy'
	db	' to serve thee!"'
L019F:	db	00
L01A0:	db	'food'
L01A4:	db	00
L01A5:	db	'"The Emerald is pleased to serve thee the finest cuisine thi'
	db	's side of Britain. Thou mightest wish to try the special -- '
	db	'Silverleaf."'
L0229:	db	00
L022A:	db	'Silverleaf'
L0234:	db	00
L0235:	db	'Silverleaf'
L023F:	db	00
L0240:	db	'She winks at you. "Some say it is a powerful aphrodisiac... '
	db	'It is delicious, regardless. It comes from the root of an ex'
	db	'otic tree growing somewhere in Britannia."'
L02E2:	db	00
L02E3:	db	'Silverleaf'
L02ED:	db	00
L02EE:	db	'drink'
L02F3:	db	00
L02F4:	db	'"The Emerald serves only the best wine and ale. I cannot rec'
	db	'ommend the water, however. Thanks to Lock Lake."'
L0360:	db	00
L0361:	db	'Lock Lake'
L036A:	db	00
L036B:	db	'buy'
L036E:	db	00
L036F:	db	'De Maria'
L0377:	db	00
L0378:	db	'"He is the light of my life. A finer man does not exist." Sh'
	db	'e beams.'
L03BC:	db	00
L03BD:	db	'De Maria'
L03C5:	db	00
L03C6:	db	'Lock Lake'
L03CF:	db	00
L03D0:	db	'"The stench has made our water taste terrible. That mining c'
	db	'ompany must cease pouring their sewage into what was once a '
	db	'fine lake!"'
L0453:	db	00
L0454:	db	'Lock Lake'
L045D:	db	00
L045E:	db	'bye'
L0461:	db	00
L0462:	db	'"Come again soon!"*'
L0475:	db	00
