L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'Nastassia'
L0016:	db	00
L0017:	db	'Zinaida'
L001E:	db	00
L001F:	db	'This flamboyant bard exudes a festive aura.'
L004A:	db	00
L004B:	db	'"I have sung about thee in many a song! And here thou art in'
	db	' the flesh! I recognized thee immediately." The man bows. "W'
	db	'elcome, Avatar!"'
L00D3:	db	00
L00D4:	db	'"Greetings again, Avatar!" De Maria bows.'
L00FD:	db	00
L00FE:	db	'name'
L0102:	db	00
L0103:	db	'"I am De Maria, the Bard."'
L011D:	db	00
L011E:	db	'name'
L0122:	db	00
L0123:	db	'Zinaida'
L012A:	db	00
L012B:	db	'job'
L012E:	db	00
L012F:	db	'"I spin tales and sing songs!"'
L014D:	db	00
L014E:	db	'"I also know a good deal about the folks in Cove."'
L0180:	db	00
L0181:	db	'folks'
L0186:	db	00
L0187:	db	'song'
L018B:	db	00
L018C:	db	'tale'
L0190:	db	00
L0191:	db	'folks'
L0196:	db	00
L0197:	db	'song'
L019B:	db	00
L019C:	db	'tale'
L01A0:	db	00
L01A1:	db	'"What if I combine all three? Shall I sing a song which is a'
	db	' tale about the people of Cove?"'
L01FD:	db	00
L01FE:	db	'"Very well, then!"'
L0210:	db	00
L0211:	db	'"'Tis thy choice... and thy mistake!"'
L0236:	db	00
L0237:	db	'folks'
L023C:	db	00
L023D:	db	'song'
L0241:	db	00
L0242:	db	'tale'
L0246:	db	00
L0247:	db	'Nastassia'
L0250:	db	00
L0251:	db	'"Ah, dear Nastassia. Wouldst thou like to hear her tale?"'
L028A:	db	00
L028B:	db	'"Very well, then!"'
L029D:	db	00
L029E:	db	'Nastassia'
L02A7:	db	00
L02A8:	db	'"Oh. I thought thou wert curious. Never mind then."'
L02DB:	db	00
L02DC:	db	'Nastassia'
L02E5:	db	00
L02E6:	db	'Zinaida'
L02ED:	db	00
L02EE:	db	'"My love! My flower! Mine angel! The provider of the sweetes'
	db	't nectar my mouth has ever known! She is the light of my day'
	db	'! The notes of my songs! The flesh of my..."~~'
L0394:	db	00
L0395:	db	'"Enough, my love. I think the Avatar dost know thy meaning!"'
	db	'*'
L03D2:	db	00
L03D3:	db	'De Maria stops his reverie, sighs, and smiles at you. "Thou '
	db	'dost apprehend my meaning..."'
L042C:	db	00
L042D:	db	'Zinaida'
L0434:	db	00
L0435:	db	'bye'
L0438:	db	00
L0439:	db	'"Do take care of thyself!"*'
L0454:	db	00
