L0000:	db	'"It is time for the ceremony to begin." says Elynor.'
L0034:	db	00
L0035:	db	'bye'
L0038:	db	00
L0039:	db	'job'
L003C:	db	00
L003D:	db	'name'
L0041:	db	00
L0042:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
L0057:	db	00
L0058:	db	'Gregor'
L005E:	db	00
L005F:	db	'candelabra'
L0069:	db	00
L006A:	db	'You see a woman whose cultured manner is tinged with a sugge'
	db	'stion of arrogance.'
L00B9:	db	00
L00BA:	db	'"Art thou speaking to me, '
L00D4:	db	00
L00D5:	db	'?" Elynor asks.'
L00E4:	db	00
L00E5:	db	'name'
L00E9:	db	00
L00EA:	db	'She straightens her shoulders and looks you in the eye.~~"I '
	db	'am Elynor."'
L0131:	db	00
L0132:	db	'name'
L0136:	db	00
L0137:	db	'job'
L013A:	db	00
L013B:	db	'"I am the head counselor of the Fellowship branch here in Mi'
	db	'noc. We are a society of spiritual seekers, dedicated to ach'
	db	'ieving our highest potential, advancing worthiness, unity an'
	db	'd trust in our brothers.'
L0207:	db	00
L0208:	db	'"Perhaps thou wouldst wish to join our Fellowship?"'
L023B:	db	00
L023C:	db	'"This is indeed a great day for The Fellowship! Seek out Bat'
	db	'lin in Britain.	He is our founder. Such a great honor as the'
	db	' acceptance of the Avatar into The Fellowship should properl'
	db	'y	be reserved for him alone."'
L030D:	db	00
L030E:	db	'"I can see by the look in thine eyes that thou dost lack the'
	db	' courage to take this vital step in thy life. Perhaps one da'
	db	'y soon thou shalt be ready."~~She looks down her nose at you'
	db	'. "We shall see..."'
L03D5:	db	00
L03D6:	db	'"Ah-- but thou dost know all of this."'
L03FC:	db	00
L03FD:	db	'"I now recall a message Batlin sent to me. I have been expec'
	db	'ting thee. Thou has been sent to deliver our package. Thou m'
	db	'ayest relinquish it now."'
L048E:	db	00
L048F:	db	'deliver'
L0496:	db	00
L0497:	db	'Elynor notices your medallion. "I do not think thou shouldst'
	db	' be wearing the medallion yet. Thou hast not been properly i'
	db	'nducted into The Fellowship! I am afraid I must inform Batli'
	db	'n of thy falsehood!"'
L055F:	db	00
L0560:	db	'Fellowship'
L056A:	db	00
L056B:	db	'Minoc'
L0570:	db	00
L0571:	db	'"Thou hast picked a most inappropriate time to engage in suc'
	db	'h casual conversation. Perhaps thou wouldst be interested kn'
	db	'owing that there have been two murders discovered in this sa'
	db	'wmill!"'
L062C:	db	00
L062D:	db	'murders'
L0634:	db	00
L0635:	db	'Minoc'
L063A:	db	00
L063B:	db	'"We should strive to put this business of the murders behind'
	db	' us. Minoc will soon be known throughout Britannia as a city'
	db	' where majestic ships are built. There	is even going to be a'
	db	' statue erected in the center of town honoring our shipwrigh'
	db	't, Owen. He is a skilled and valued member of our community '
	db	'and, of course, a Fellowship member."'
L078C:	db	00
L078D:	db	'Fellowship'
L0797:	db	00
L0798:	db	'Owen'
L079C:	db	00
L079D:	db	'murders'
L07A4:	db	00
L07A5:	db	'"Ours is not a great city, such as Britain, but it is widely'
	db	' known as a center of commerce and for its mine. The slight '
	db	'embarrassment of the legacy of Owen will fade in time."'
L0854:	db	00
L0855:	db	'Owen'
L0859:	db	00
L085A:	db	'Minoc'
L085F:	db	00
L0860:	db	'murders'
L0867:	db	00
L0868:	db	'"I am saddened at the loss of life but cannot say I am surpr'
	db	'ised. Frederico and Tania were antagonistic people. The same'
	db	' may be said of most gypsies. I have nothing against them pe'
	db	'rsonally, of course."'
L0931:	db	00
L0932:	db	'gypsies'
L0939:	db	00
L093A:	db	'antagonistic'
L0946:	db	00
L0947:	db	'murders'
L094E:	db	00
L094F:	db	'Crown Jewel'
L095A:	db	00
L095B:	db	'Hook'
L095F:	db	00
L0960:	db	'deliver'
L0967:	db	00
L0968:	db	'You produce the package and hold it before Elynor. Her eyes '
	db	'shift from you to the package and then back to you.~~"Surely'
	db	' thou hast been instructed not to open	the package. Hast tho'
	db	'u opened it nonetheless?"'
L0A35:	db	00
L0A36:	db	'"Thou knowest well that thou wert instructed to deliver the '
	db	'package unopened. As a Fellowship member, thou dost understa'
	db	'nd that we must be worthy of the rewards we seek. As thou ha'
	db	'st violated Batlin's trust, any payment is forfeited. He wil'
	db	'l be informed of this indiscretion, and he will not be pleas'
	db	'ed."~~She takes the box from your	hands.'
L0B8A:	db	00
L0B8B:	db	'"Nonsense. The package is still perfectly sealed." She stare'
	db	's at you suspiciously.~~ "I know not why thou didst choose t'
	db	'o claim that it was opened, but thou must learn better to tr'
	db	'ust thy brother. As the box is still intact, thou wilt recei'
	db	've thy reward, but thine actions will be reported. Be carefu'
	db	'l, my brother."'
L0CC6:	db	00
L0CC7:	db	'She hands you 50 gold coins.'
L0CE3:	db	00
L0CE4:	db	'"Thou cannot carry thy reward! My, thy travels have indeed b'
	db	'een successful. Well, then, thou must endure a further test.'
	db	' Return the sealed box to me when thou canst tote the extra '
	db	'gold, and thou wilt be paid what thou dost deserve."'
L0DCC:	db	00
L0DCD:	db	'She inspects the inside of the box.~~ "Ah, good. The content'
	db	's, at least, are still intact. The guilty one was only a vic'
	db	'tim of his own curiosity, and not truly a thief."~~She looks'
	db	' you up and down. "It is quite possible that thou wilt still'
	db	' learn to be a worthy member of our illustrious Membership. '
	db	'We shall see."'
L0F07:	db	00
L0F08:	db	'She inspects the inside of the box.~~ "I see that the conten'
	db	'ts of the box are missing. Either thou art a thief, or, at t'
	db	'he least, not very diligent in thy duty as a messenger. One '
	db	'way or the other, '
L0FCE:	db	00
L0FCF:	db	', the box hath been robbed!"~~She looks you up and down. "Ba'
	db	'tlin will be informed of this... development."'
L1039:	db	00
L103A:	db	'Elynor takes the package from your hands.~~"Thou hast done v'
	db	'ery well. Now as promised, here is thy payment."'
L10A6:	db	00
L10A7:	db	'"Thou cannot carry thy reward! My, thy travels have indeed b'
	db	'een successful. Well, then, thou must endure a further test.'
	db	' Return the sealed box to me when thou canst tote the extra '
	db	'gold, and thou wilt be paid what thou dost deserve."'
L118F:	db	00
L1190:	db	'Elynor takes the package from you. Examining it, she immedia'
	db	'tely notices that it has been opened.~~"^'
L11F5:	db	00
L11F6:	db	'! The box is open! Certainly, one as diligent as thee could '
	db	'not have been robbed?"'
L1248:	db	00
L1249:	db	'She inspects the inside of the box.~~ "Ah, good. The content'
	db	's, at least, are still intact. The guilty one was only a vic'
	db	'tim of his own curiosity, and not truly a thief."~~She looks'
	db	' you up and down. "It is quite possible that thou wilt still'
	db	' learn to be a worthy member of our illustrious Membership. '
	db	'We shall see."~~She sniffs. "This will, of course,	be report'
	db	'ed to Batlin."'
L13BF:	db	00
L13C0:	db	'Peering inside, she is beset by a fit of anger. "It would ap'
	db	'pear thou hast been robbed. Obviously, as thou hast failed i'
	db	'n the responsibility entrusted to thee by Batlin, thou shalt'
	db	' not receive any payment."~~"Batlin will be informed of this'
	db	' indiscretion."'
L14BF:	db	00
L14C0:	db	'"Dost thou not have it with thee at this time? Thou wilt not'
	db	' be paid until thou dost deliver it unto mine own hand. I do'
	db	' hope thou hast secreted it in a safe place."'
L1565:	db	00
L1566:	db	'deliver'
L156D:	db	00
L156E:	db	'Owen'
L1572:	db	00
L1573:	db	'"He is a classic example of The Fellowship making a vast dif'
	db	'ference in a person's life. Before he joined The Fellowship,'
	db	' he was without confidence and ready to put aside his trade.'
	db	' Now he stands on the verge of being recognized as the fines'
	db	't at his craft in the world."'
L1680:	db	00
L1681:	db	'Elynor rolls her eyes. "Oh, please!" she says, sounding exas'
	db	'perated. "I do not concern myself with ones such as him thes'
	db	'e days."'
L1701:	db	00
L1702:	db	'Owen'
L1706:	db	00
L1707:	db	'antagonistic'
L1713:	db	00
L1714:	db	'"Frederico and Tania treated all members of our Fellowship a'
	db	's if we were diseased. Frederico particularly would often bu'
	db	'lly our members. Thou dost know, it is common knowledge that'
	db	' we are pacifists. He had a reputation for cruelty, even amo'
	db	'ng his own people. It is not surprising he came to a violent'
	db	' end."'
L1846:	db	00
L1847:	db	'antagonistic'
L1853:	db	00
L1854:	db	'Fellowship'
L185E:	db	00
L185F:	db	'"The Fellowship is highly regarded in Minoc. Why, even the M'
	db	'ayor himself is a member. I brought him into The Fellowship '
	db	'myself. He was the first new member of our local branch. Gre'
	db	'gor, the head of The Fellowship here, directs the Britannian'
	db	' Mining Company. Many Fellowship members pass through Minoc.'
	db	'"'
L198C:	db	00
L198D:	db	'Fellowship'
L1997:	db	00
L1998:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
L19AD:	db	00
L19AE:	db	'"Thou hast just missed them! They were here collecting funds'
	db	'. They have moved on to Paws to visit our Shelter there."'
L1A23:	db	00
L1A24:	db	'"I have not seen Elizabeth or Abraham since they were here l'
	db	'ast."'
L1A65:	db	00
L1A66:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
L1A7B:	db	00
L1A7C:	db	'Hook'
L1A80:	db	00
L1A81:	db	'The Cube vibrates. "Hook lives somewhere on Buccaneer's Den.'
	db	' I do not know where."'
L1AD3:	db	00
L1AD4:	db	'"A man with a Hook? I am certain I would remember having see'
	db	'n anyone like that, and I am positive that does not match th'
	db	'e description of any Fellowship member this branch has ever '
	db	'come in contact with."'
L1B9E:	db	00
L1B9F:	db	'Hook'
L1BA3:	db	00
L1BA4:	db	'Crown Jewel'
L1BAF:	db	00
L1BB0:	db	'The Cube vibrates. "That is Hook's ship. I have not seen it '
	db	'in some time."'
L1BFA:	db	00
L1BFB:	db	'"Many ships come and go in our busy port. I do not know of a'
	db	'ny one specific ship. Perhaps thou shouldst ask Owen."'
L1C6D:	db	00
L1C6E:	db	'Crown Jewel'
L1C79:	db	00
L1C7A:	db	'Gregor'
L1C80:	db	00
L1C81:	db	'"Thou dost dare to spy upon Gregor and I as we share our mom'
	db	'ents together?! Dost thou have no decency?! Gregor and I hav'
	db	'e a right to privacy the same as do any lovers!"'
L1D29:	db	00
L1D2A:	db	'Gregor'
L1D30:	db	00
L1D31:	db	'candelabra'
L1D3B:	db	00
L1D3C:	db	'The Cube vibrates. "The candelabra was left at the murder si'
	db	'te by mistake. Hook and Forskis are getting careless."'
L1DAE:	db	00
L1DAF:	db	'"Yes, The Fellowship commissioned Xanthia to create a candel'
	db	'abra which thou dost describe. Its design incorporates our t'
	db	'hree tenets: 'U' for Unity, 'T' for Trust, and 'W' for Worth'
	db	'iness."'
L1E6A:	db	00
L1E6B:	db	'You tell Elynor that it was found at the murder site. Elynor'
	db	' registers surprise.'
L1EBB:	db	00
L1EBC:	db	'"I cannot imagine why it was there. Someone must be trying t'
	db	'o implicate The Fellowship!"'
L1F14:	db	00
L1F15:	db	'She thinks a moment.'
L1F29:	db	00
L1F2A:	db	'"If thou didst ask it of me, I would wager that Frederico an'
	db	'd Tania were murdered by their own people, and another gypsy'
	db	' placed the candelabra at the site to implicate us. Those gy'
	db	'psies would kill their own mother if it meant gaining a bit '
	db	'of gold!"'
L2023:	db	00
L2024:	db	'candelabra'
L202E:	db	00
L202F:	db	'gypsies'
L2036:	db	00
L2037:	db	'"They have set up camp southeast of town. Near the sawmill. '
	db	'That is suspicious, dost thou not think?"'
L209C:	db	00
L209D:	db	'gypsies'
L20A4:	db	00
L20A5:	db	'bye'
L20A8:	db	00
L20A9:	db	'"I have a feeling that we shall see each other again."*'
L20E0:	db	00
