		.data
L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'Tania'
L0012:	db	00
L0013:	db	'Frederico'
L001C:	db	00
L001D:	db	'murders'
L0024:	db	00
L0025:	db	'Sasha'
L002A:	db	00
L002B:	db	'You see a young, bewitching gypsy woman with wise, soul-peer'
	db	'ing eyes.'
L0070:	db	00
L0071:	db	'"Thou vishest to speak vith me again?" Margareta asks.'
L00A7:	db	00
L00A8:	db	'"Very vell."'
L00B4:	db	00
L00B5:	db	'"Very vell."*'
L00C2:	db	00
L00C3:	db	'name'
L00C7:	db	00
L00C8:	db	'"Margareta at thy service," she speaks slowly.'
L00F6:	db	00
L00F7:	db	'name'
L00FB:	db	00
L00FC:	db	'job'
L00FF:	db	00
L0100:	db	'The gypsy woman smiles slightly. "To tell thy destiny."'
L0137:	db	00
L0138:	db	'destiny'
L013F:	db	00
L0140:	db	'murders'
L0147:	db	00
L0148:	db	'"I knew it vould happen. I varned Frederico. He vouldn't lis'
	db	'ten."'
L0189:	db	00
L018A:	db	'murders'
L0191:	db	00
L0192:	db	'Frederico'
L019B:	db	00
L019C:	db	'"He vas my brother-in-law. His death makes me very sad."'
L01D4:	db	00
L01D5:	db	'Frederico'
L01DE:	db	00
L01DF:	db	'husband'
L01E6:	db	00
L01E7:	db	'Tania'
L01EC:	db	00
L01ED:	db	'"She vas Frederico's vife, but thou dost know that already, '
	db	'no? She vas a good voman."'
L0243:	db	00
L0244:	db	'Tania'
L0249:	db	00
L024A:	db	'Sasha'
L024F:	db	00
L0250:	db	'Margareta is silent a moment.~~"He has been led astray. It i'
	db	's unfortunate that he vill realize his mistake only as a res'
	db	'ult ov the death ov his parents."'
L02E9:	db	00
L02EA:	db	'mistake'
L02F1:	db	00
L02F2:	db	'astray'
L02F8:	db	00
L02F9:	db	'Sasha'
L02FE:	db	00
L02FF:	db	'astray'
L0305:	db	00
L0306:	db	'"There are many, many others like Sasha who have been led as'
	db	'tray. For them, I see no future."'
L0363:	db	00
L0364:	db	'astray'
L036A:	db	00
L036B:	db	'mistake'
L0372:	db	00
L0373:	db	'"Thou dost know vhat I mean.'
L038F:	db	00
L0390:	db	'"Thou art a member thyself."'
L03AC:	db	00
L03AD:	db	'"The Fellowship."'
L03BE:	db	00
L03BF:	db	'Fellowship'
L03C9:	db	00
L03CA:	db	'mistake'
L03D1:	db	00
L03D2:	db	'Fellowship'
L03DC:	db	00
L03DD:	db	'Margareta sees your medallion and raises her eyes.'
L040F:	db	00
L0410:	db	'"I see thou art vearing vone ov their medallions, but thou a'
	db	'rt not truly a member, art thou? Bevare -- there are those i'
	db	'n The Fellowship that vill see through thy deception."'
L04BE:	db	00
L04BF:	db	'"Thou vilt soon be enlightened about their true nature."'
L04F7:	db	00
L04F8:	db	'"Thou shalt learn more about them in due time."'
L0527:	db	00
L0528:	db	'Fellowship'
L0532:	db	00
L0533:	db	'destiny'
L053A:	db	00
L053B:	db	'destiny'
L0542:	db	00
L0543:	db	'husband'
L054A:	db	00
L054B:	db	'"Jergi is mine husband, ov course. Now he has the veight ov '
	db	'guiding the gypsy race in these	troubled times."'
L05B7:	db	00
L05B8:	db	'husband'
L05BF:	db	00
L05C0:	db	'bye'
L05C3:	db	00
L05C4:	db	'"Fairvell. Go in peace."*'
L05DD:	db	00
