L0193:	db	00
L0194:	db	'"Yes, we have an Artist's Guild here in Minoc. I am a member'
	db	'. The other members are Xanthia and Gladstone. Thou canst pu'
	db	'rchase some of the finest crafts available anywhere in Brita'
	db	'nnia there. I, for example, make clocks."'
