L02A1:	db	00
L02A2:	db	'"Xanthia is a very talented young woman. She makes very elab'
	db	'orate and distinctive candelabras."'
L0301:	db	00
L0302:	db	'Xanthia'
L0309:	db	00
L030A:	db	'Gladstone'
L0313:	db	00
L0314:	db	'"Gladstone is a sculptor and a glassblower. He also is in ch'
	db	'arge of most of the business decisions for the Guild."'
L0386:	db	00
L0387:	db	'Gladstone'
L0390:	db	00
L0391:	db	'clocks'
L0397:	db	00
L0398:	db	'"I make all types of clocks and watches that tell the time r'
	db	'eliably to the second. I would be happy to sell thee one but'
	db	' right now I have a two year backlog to fill."'
L043E:	db	00
L043F:	db	'clocks'
L0445:	db	00
L0446:	db	'Minoc'
L044B:	db	00
L044C:	db	'"Until the monument was to be built and now these murders I '
	db	'believed this town to be a good place to live."'
L04B7:	db	00
L04B8:	db	'Minoc'
L04BD:	db	00
L04BE:	db	'murders'
L04C5:	db	00
L04C6:	db	'monument'
L04CE:	db	00
L04CF:	db	'murders'
L04D6:	db	00
L04D7:	db	'"It is horrible. Frederico and Tania were looking for their '
	db	'son, Sasha. He had run away to join the Fellowship. How coul'
	db	'd this have happened to them?" Seara slowly shakes his head.'
L058B:	db	00
L058C:	db	'murders'
L0593:	db	00
L0594:	db	'Sasha'
L0599:	db	00
L059A:	db	'Sasha'
L059F:	db	00
L05A0:	db	'"I met him a few weeks ago when he came to town looking for '
	db	'the local Fellowship branch. I once let him stay the night a'
	db	't the Guild Hall. He said his father would beat him if he kn'
	db	'ew he was thinking of joining The Fellowship and I believed '
	db	'him. Sasha's father could be a cruel man. He is basically a '
	db	'good lad, just looking for the truth like a lot of us are. U'
	db	'nfortunately, he is looking in the wrong place."'
L0738:	db	00
L0739:	db	'Sasha'
L073E:	db	00
L073F:	db	'Fellowship'
L0749:	db	00
L074A:	db	'gypsies'
L0751:	db	00
L0752:	db	'"I have not seen or heard of Sasha since we last spoke of hi'
	db	'm. I do not know if he ever joined The Fellowship."'
L07C1:	db	00
L07C2:	db	'Sasha'
L07C7:	db	00
L07C8:	db	'Fellowship'
L07D2:	db	00
L07D3:	db	'gypsies'
L07DA:	db	00
L07DB:	db	'"Their camp is just outside of town. There are not too many '
	db	'of them left. I understand that Sasha's aunt, Margareta, is '
	db	'an amazing fortune teller. For a few gold coins, she can tel'
	db	'l thee many things that may be very useful to thee."'
L08C3:	db	00
L08C4:	db	'gypsies'
L08CB:	db	00
L08CC:	db	'Fellowship'
L08D6:	db	00
L08D7:	db	'"No offense intended to thee, but I do not share thy beliefs'
	db	'. In fact I think few of the members of thy Fellowship are s'
	db	'incere in all their talk of unity, trust and worthiness. But'
	db	' Sasha is old enough to make up his mind for himself, though'
	db	' I regret not sending him home that night."'
L09F2:	db	00
L09F3:	db	'"No, I am not a member or anything like that, but I have hea'
	db	'rd the basic speech from Sasha so many times that I have it '
	db	'memorized. I never tried to dissuade him from joining The Fe'
	db	'llowship even though I have no belief in it. I think Sasha i'
	db	's old enough to start making his decisions for himself. Now '
	db	'I truly regret not sending him home the moment I saw him."'
L0B59:	db	00
L0B5A:	db	'philosophy'
L0B64:	db	00
L0B65:	db	'Fellowship'
L0B6F:	db	00
L0B70:	db	'monument'
L0B78:	db	00
L0B79:	db	'"That shipwright Owen is a self-righteous fool. His statue w'
	db	'ill be nothing more than a monument to all the hurtful bad f'
	db	'eelings he has caused in this town. I cannot believe that su'
	db	'ch a meaningless and obvious charade	could jeopardize our Gu'
	db	'ild's future."'
L0C77:	db	00
L0C78:	db	'monument'
L0C80:	db	00
L0C81:	db	'future'
L0C87:	db	00
L0C88:	db	'future'
L0C8E:	db	00
L0C8F:	db	'"Thou hadst best ask Gladstone about that."'
L0CBA:	db	00
L0CBB:	db	'future'
L0CC1:	db	00
L0CC2:	db	'bye'
L0CC5:	db	00
L0CC6:	db	'"A pleasant day to thee, '
L0CDF:	db	00
L0CE0:	db	'. Do come see us again."*'
L0CF9:	db	00
