L0028:	db	'You see a stealthy-looking woman, dressed all in green. Ther'
	db	'e is a wicked grin on her face.'
L0083:	db	00
L0084:	db	'"How good to see thee again," says Karenna.'
L00AF:	db	00
L00B0:	db	'name'
L00B4:	db	00
L00B5:	db	'"I answer to Karenna, and to nothing else."'
