L0000:	db	'The creature ignores you.*'
L001A:	db	00
L001B:	db	'The ape-like female appears nervous.'
L003F:	db	00
L0040:	db	'The female Emp appears nervous.'
L005F:	db	00
L0060:	db	'Saralek greets you. "Hello is said to you, human."'
L0092:	db	00
L0093:	db	'Trellek'
L009A:	db	00
L009B:	db	'Salamon's permission'
L00AF:	db	00
L00B0:	db	'bye'
L00B3:	db	00
L00B4:	db	'job'
L00B7:	db	00
L00B8:	db	'name'
L00BC:	db	00
L00BD:	db	'name'
L00C1:	db	00
L00C2:	db	'She shies away for a moment, and then cautiously steps forwa'
	db	'rd. "I am called Saralek."'
L0118:	db	00
L0119:	db	'name'
L011D:	db	00
L011E:	db	'Trellek'
L0125:	db	00
L0126:	db	'job'
L0129:	db	00
L012A:	db	'"`Job' is not understood. Family is what you mean?"'
L015D:	db	00
L015E:	db	'family'
L0164:	db	00
L0165:	db	'family'
L016B:	db	00
L016C:	db	'"Yes, I am part of a family. The Silverleaf tree is my home.'
	db	' I am bonded with Trellek."'
L01C3:	db	00
L01C4:	db	'family'
L01CA:	db	00
L01CB:	db	'Trellek'
L01D2:	db	00
L01D3:	db	'Silverleaf tree'
L01E2:	db	00
L01E3:	db	'Trellek'
L01EA:	db	00
L01EB:	db	'"Trellek is my husband."'
L0203:	db	00
L0204:	db	'"Trellek has been met by you?" She smiles proudly, and takes'
	db	' another step forward. "What was said by him?"'
L026E:	db	00
L026F:	db	'join party'
L0279:	db	00
L027A:	db	'Trellek'
L0281:	db	00
L0282:	db	'Silverleaf tree'
L0291:	db	00
L0292:	db	'"There are fewer and fewer Silverleaf trees. Many are cut do'
	db	'wn often. Soon, no Silverleaf trees will be around for our h'
	db	'omes."'
L0310:	db	00
L0311:	db	'cut down'
L0319:	db	00
L031A:	db	'Silverleaf tree'
L0329:	db	00
L032A:	db	'cut down'
L0332:	db	00
L0333:	db	'"The trees are cut by a human with a shiny, sharp item."'
L036B:	db	00
L036C:	db	'cut down'
L0374:	db	00
L0375:	db	'join party'
L037F:	db	00
L0380:	db	'"To join you is his desire?"'
L039C:	db	00
L039D:	db	'She thinks for a moment. "His going away is not desired by m'
	db	'e." She turns to look directly at you. "But, joining you may'
	db	' be wise action." She sighs.'
L0431:	db	00
L0432:	db	'"Permission from Salamon must be gained first. Then permissi'
	db	'on from me will be granted. Your return to me is necessary f'
	db	'or that."'
L04B3:	db	00
L04B4:	db	'Salamon'
L04BB:	db	00
L04BC:	db	'"That is good!" She seems very happy and relieved.'
L04EE:	db	00
L04EF:	db	'join party'
L04F9:	db	00
L04FA:	db	'Salamon'
L0501:	db	00
L0502:	db	'"She is a very wise Emp. Many humans have been met by her. K'
	db	'nowledge and experience are her talents."'
L0567:	db	00
L0568:	db	'Salamon'
L056F:	db	00
L0570:	db	'Salamon's permission'
L0584:	db	00
L0585:	db	'Her eyes begin to mist over.~~ "I am sorry. A lie was told b'
	db	'y me. Trellek's leaving is not desired by me. Permission wil'
	db	'l not be given."~~ Her expression changes.~~ "What is the re'
	db	'ason you asked him?"'
L064D:	db	00
L064E:	db	'never mind'
L0658:	db	00
L0659:	db	'adventure'
L0662:	db	00
L0663:	db	'wisps'
L0668:	db	00
L0669:	db	'Salamon's permission'
L067D:	db	00
L067E:	db	'adventure'
L0687:	db	00
L0688:	db	'"Adventure is not Trellek's desire."'
L06AC:	db	00
L06AD:	db	'adventure'
L06B6:	db	00
L06B7:	db	'never mind'
L06C1:	db	00
L06C2:	db	'She shrugs.'
L06CD:	db	00
L06CE:	db	'never mind'
L06D8:	db	00
L06D9:	db	'wisps'
L06DE:	db	00
L06DF:	db	'She smiles excitedly.~~"Your wish is to meet wisps?"'
L0713:	db	00
L0714:	db	'"An idea how you can be helped by Trellek is had by me. Wisp'
	db	's are contacted by Trellek's whistling. A whistle for you ca'
	db	'n be made by him, perhaps. Talking with him again should be '
	db	'your next action."'
L07DA:	db	00
L07DB:	db	'"Oh." She appears depressed again.'
