L0000:	db	'The creature ignores you.*'
L001A:	db	00
L001B:	db	'The ape-like creature in front of you approaches very cautio'
	db	'usly.  After a few minutes of staring you up and down, it co'
	db	'cks its head toward you.~~"You are human."'
L00BD:	db	00
L00BE:	db	'The Emp in front of you approaches very cautiously. After a '
	db	'few minutes of staring you up and down, he cocks his head to'
	db	'wards you.~~"You are human."'
L0152:	db	00
L0153:	db	'"You are greeted by me, human." Tavenor slowly approaches.'
L018D:	db	00
L018E:	db	'bye'
L0191:	db	00
L0192:	db	'job'
L0195:	db	00
L0196:	db	'name'
L019A:	db	00
L019B:	db	'name'
L019F:	db	00
L01A0:	db	'"Tavenor is my name."'
L01B5:	db	00
L01B6:	db	'name'
L01BA:	db	00
L01BB:	db	'job'
L01BE:	db	00
L01BF:	db	'"The meaning of `job' is not understood."'
L01E8:	db	00
L01E9:	db	'explain job'
L01F4:	db	00
L01F5:	db	'"No job is had by me. Food is gathered by me and my family."'
L0231:	db	00
L0232:	db	'food'
L0236:	db	00
L0237:	db	'explain job'
L0242:	db	00
L0243:	db	'"`Job' now understood by me. No job is had by me. Food is ga'
	db	'thered by me and my family." He watches you carefully. "Your'
	db	' job is to cut down Silverleaf trees, yes?"'
L02E6:	db	00
L02E7:	db	'"That is as I expected. You are a menace. You are asked to s'
	db	'top, please." He turns away from you.*'
L0349:	db	00
L034A:	db	'"The truth is known to me, but, belief is hard for me."'
L0381:	db	00
L0382:	db	'*'
L0383:	db	00
L0384:	db	'"The truth is spoken by the human," Trellek says to the othe'
	db	'r Emp. "He is to be trusted. His good will was felt by me."*'
L03FC:	db	00
L03FD:	db	'The Emp nods at Trellek, and then turns to you. "The truth i'
	db	's now clear to me. You are wished good luck."'
L0466:	db	00
L0467:	db	'The Emp eyes you a little longer. "Your good intentions are '
	db	'known to    me. You are asked to be the messenger. Humans wi'
	db	'll not be destroyers, please."'
L04FD:	db	00
L04FE:	db	'explain job'
L0509:	db	00
L050A:	db	'Silverleaf trees'
L051A:	db	00
L051B:	db	'food'
L051F:	db	00
L0520:	db	'food'
L0524:	db	00
L0525:	db	'"Fruit and milk are Emp foods. Especially fruits are liked b'
	db	'y me. Meats," he shakes his head,~~"are -not- liked by Emps.'
	db	'"'
L059E:	db	00
L059F:	db	'food'
L05A3:	db	00
L05A4:	db	'milk'
L05A8:	db	00
L05A9:	db	'fruits'
L05AF:	db	00
L05B0:	db	'meats'
L05B5:	db	00
L05B6:	db	'milk'
L05BA:	db	00
L05BB:	db	'"Milk is good. Milk with honey is preferred by me."'
L05EE:	db	00
L05EF:	db	'honey'
L05F4:	db	00
L05F5:	db	'milk'
L05F9:	db	00
L05FA:	db	'Silverleaf trees'
L060A:	db	00
L060B:	db	'"Silverleaf trees are Emp homes."'
L062C:	db	00
L062D:	db	'Silverleaf trees'
L063D:	db	00
L063E:	db	'meats'
L0643:	db	00
L0644:	db	'"Meats are from killed animals. Killing is bad. Destroying i'
	db	's bad."'
L0687:	db	00
L0688:	db	'meats'
L068D:	db	00
L068E:	db	'fruits'
L0694:	db	00
L0695:	db	'"Fruits are good and sweet -- like honey!"'
L06BF:	db	00
L06C0:	db	'fruits'
L06C6:	db	00
L06C7:	db	'honey'
L06CC:	db	00
L06CD:	db	'honey'
L06D2:	db	00
L06D3:	db	'"Honey is favorite food of all Emps!"'
L06F8:	db	00
L06F9:	db	'honey'
L06FE:	db	00
L06FF:	db	'bye'
L0702:	db	00
L0703:	db	'"You are told `goodbye.'"*'
