		.data
L0000:	db	'The creature ignores you.*'
L001A:	db	00
L001B:	db	'You see a wizened female ape-like creature.'
L0046:	db	00
L0047:	db	'You see a wizened female Emp.'
L0064:	db	00
L0065:	db	'"You are hailed, human."'
L007D:	db	00
L007E:	db	'Trellek'
L0085:	db	00
L0086:	db	'bye'
L0089:	db	00
L008A:	db	'job'
L008D:	db	00
L008E:	db	'name'
L0092:	db	00
L0093:	db	'name'
L0097:	db	00
L0098:	db	'"I am Salamon," she says.'
L00B1:	db	00
L00B2:	db	'name'
L00B6:	db	00
L00B7:	db	'job'
L00BA:	db	00
L00BB:	db	'"I am without job. All Emps are without jobs. Food gathering'
	db	' and shelter-building are Emp jobs."'
L011B:	db	00
L011C:	db	'She gives you a hard look.~~"There is a job for Trellek."'
L0155:	db	00
L0156:	db	'Trellek'
L015D:	db	00
L015E:	db	'shelter-building'
L016E:	db	00
L016F:	db	'food-gathering'
L017D:	db	00
L017E:	db	'shelter-building'
L018E:	db	00
L018F:	db	'"Silverleaf trees are where Emp's homes can be found."'
L01C5:	db	00
L01C6:	db	'shelter-building'
L01D6:	db	00
L01D7:	db	'food-gathering'
L01E5:	db	00
L01E6:	db	'"Only fruits, vegetables, and milk-stuffs are eaten by Emps.'
	db	' Bread is also eaten."'
L0238:	db	00
L0239:	db	'food-gathering'
L0247:	db	00
L0248:	db	'-only-?'
L024F:	db	00
L0250:	db	'bread'
L0255:	db	00
L0256:	db	'milk-stuffs'
L0261:	db	00
L0262:	db	'fruits and vegetables'
L0277:	db	00
L0278:	db	'milk-stuffs'
L0283:	db	00
L0284:	db	'"Milk and cheese and butter are milk-stuffs."'
L02B1:	db	00
L02B2:	db	'milk-stuffs'
L02BD:	db	00
L02BE:	db	'bread'
L02C3:	db	00
L02C4:	db	'"Bread is hard to make for Emps. No stoves or ovens are owne'
	db	'd by Emps. But bread is well liked."'
L0324:	db	00
L0325:	db	'bread'
L032A:	db	00
L032B:	db	'fruits and vegetables'
L0340:	db	00
L0341:	db	'"Fruits and vegetables are our favorites. Many are sweet."'
L037B:	db	00
L037C:	db	'fruits and vegetables'
L0391:	db	00
L0392:	db	'sweet'
L0397:	db	00
L0398:	db	'sweet'
L039D:	db	00
L039E:	db	'"Sweet things are desired by Emps. Honey is sweetest! More h'
	db	'oney is had by you?"'
L03EE:	db	00
L03EF:	db	'Her eyes widen and her lips part around a very large and hop'
	db	'eful smile.~~"More honey will be given by you?"'
L045A:	db	00
L045B:	db	'"You are thanked," she says, taking the honey.'
L0489:	db	00
L048A:	db	'"A mean trick was played by you," she says, frowning.'
L04BF:	db	00
L04C0:	db	'She seems surprised, but quickly recovers.~~"Your feelings a'
	db	're understood by me," she sighs.'
L051C:	db	00
L051D:	db	'She sighs, obviously disappointed.'
L053F:	db	00
L0540:	db	'sweet'
L0545:	db	00
L0546:	db	'-only-?'
L054D:	db	00
L054E:	db	'"No dead animal flesh -- what is called `meat' by humans -- '
	db	'is eaten by an Emp."'
L059E:	db	00
L059F:	db	'meat'
L05A3:	db	00
L05A4:	db	'dead animal flesh'
L05B5:	db	00
L05B6:	db	'-only-?'
L05BD:	db	00
L05BE:	db	'meat'
L05C2:	db	00
L05C3:	db	'"Meat is without a good taste," she shudders. "It is not pre'
	db	'ferred!"'
L0607:	db	00
L0608:	db	'meat'
L060C:	db	00
L060D:	db	'dead animal flesh'
L061E:	db	00
L061F:	db	'"All violence is abhorred by Emps. No killing is desired, ev'
	db	'en for what you humans call food."'
L067D:	db	00
L067E:	db	'dead animal flesh'
L068F:	db	00
L0690:	db	'Trellek'
L0697:	db	00
L0698:	db	'She takes the document from you, smiling when she sees Ben's'
	db	' signature. "Trellek is permitted to join you. You are wishe'
	db	'd luck and speed."'
L0722:	db	00
L0723:	db	'"The signed contract must be seen by me."'
L074C:	db	00
L074D:	db	'"Permission will be given to you later. There is a task that'
	db	' must be performed first.~~"There is a woodcutter who lives '
	db	'in the western part of the forest. Silverleaf trees are bein'
	db	'g cut down by him. Emp houses are in Silverleaf trees. Contr'
	db	'act must be signed by woodcutter to stop."'
L0867:	db	00
L0868:	db	'"My condition is understood by you?" Not waiting for your re'
	db	'sponse, she hands you a document.'
L08C5:	db	00
L08C6:	db	'"You are now in possession of the contract."'
L08F2:	db	00
L08F3:	db	'"There is not enough room in your equipment for the contract'
	db	'."'
L0931:	db	00
L0932:	db	'"Trellek is another Emp. He should be spoken to by you.~~"Th'
	db	'ere is much damage to the forest and the Silverleaf trees. T'
	db	'he damage is caused by your people, human. The responsibilit'
	db	'y to reverse the damage is also yours, human.~~"Trellek shou'
	db	'ld be sought by you," she says emphatically. "He should be a'
	db	'sked to join you."'
L0A70:	db	00
L0A71:	db	'Trellek'
L0A78:	db	00
L0A79:	db	'bye'
L0A7C:	db	00
L0A7D:	db	'"My hope is for your welfare, human."*'
L0AA3:	db	00
L0AA4:	db	'@You are greeted.@'
L0AB6:	db	00
L0AB7:	db	'@Nature is home to many.@'
L0AD0:	db	00
L0AD1:	db	'@A good day is hoped for you.@'
L0AEF:	db	00
L0AF0:	db	'@Nature is wise.@'
L0B01:	db	00
