L0000:	db	'The man scowls at you. "Thou wearest the symbol of that most'
	db	' foul of groups, The Fellowship. Prepare to die!"*'
L006E:	db	00
L006F:	db	'Eyeing you carefully, the man before you takes an aggressive'
	db	' stance.'
L00B3:	db	00
L00B4:	db	'"Good day, '
L00BF:	db	00
L00C0:	db	'," Thad says coolly.'
L00D4:	db	00
L00D5:	db	'bye'
L00D8:	db	00
L00D9:	db	'job'
L00DC:	db	00
L00DD:	db	'name'
L00E1:	db	00
L00E2:	db	'name'
L00E6:	db	00
L00E7:	db	'He stares at you for a moment. "Thad is my name, '
L0118:	db	00
L0119:	db	'."'
L011B:	db	00
L011C:	db	'name'
L0120:	db	00
L0121:	db	'job'
L0124:	db	00
L0125:	db	'"Job? I have not the time for a job. I am on a quest to rid '
	db	'this land of that which plagues it!"'
L0185:	db	00
L0186:	db	'plague'
L018C:	db	00
L018D:	db	'quest'
L0192:	db	00
L0193:	db	'quest'
L0198:	db	00
L0199:	db	'"I have devoted mine entire life to this, nothing will get i'
	db	'n my way, not even Batlin."'
L01F0:	db	00
L01F1:	db	'quest'
L01F6:	db	00
L01F7:	db	'Batlin'
L01FD:	db	00
L01FE:	db	'Batlin'
L0204:	db	00
L0205:	db	'"He is the leader of the cursed organization, The Fellowship'
	db	'!"'
L0243:	db	00
L0244:	db	'The Fellowship'
L0252:	db	00
L0253:	db	'Batlin'
L0259:	db	00
L025A:	db	'plague'
L0260:	db	00
L0261:	db	'"Surely thou hast heard of The Fellowship, a most foul and e'
	db	'vil organization. It has even infested the lovely forest of '
	db	'Yew!"'
L02DE:	db	00
L02DF:	db	'Yew'
L02E2:	db	00
L02E3:	db	'The Fellowship'
L02F1:	db	00
L02F2:	db	'plague'
L02F8:	db	00
L02F9:	db	'The Fellowship'
L0307:	db	00
L0308:	db	'"I know little about their practices, but I do know they liv'
	db	'e outside the bounds of moral decency. They have kidnapped m'
	db	'y beloved sister, Millie, and have cast a spell of enchantme'
	db	'nt. Now she lives as they do. I have vowed to remove this wi'
	db	'cked spell and will slay the entire organization should that'
	db	' prove necessary!~~ "Thou, also, hast taken up a similar cau'
	db	'se, I expect. Yes?"'
L0483:	db	00
L0484:	db	'"Excellent." He shakes your hand. "Thou art indeed a worthy '
	db	'warrior, '
L04C9:	db	00
L04CA:	db	'."'
L04CC:	db	00
L04CD:	db	'"No?" He seems genuinely surprised. "Then perhaps thou wilt '
	db	'consider taking up my quest in thine own manner."'
L053A:	db	00
L053B:	db	'"I expected as much. Thou art truly an honorable warrior."'
L0575:	db	00
L0576:	db	'"What manner of scoundrel art thou? Remove thyself from my p'
	db	'resence before I decide to smite thee from thy wretched life'
	db	'!"*'
L05F1:	db	00
L05F2:	db	'The Fellowship'
L0600:	db	00
L0601:	db	'Yew'
L0604:	db	00
L0605:	db	'"I know the land, but not the people. There is nothing usefu'
	db	'l I have to tell thee." He appears thoughtful for a moment. '
	db	'"Perhaps I can aid thee a bit. I do know that there are two '
	db	'hunters who sometimes frequent this area. One, a woman, carr'
	db	'ies a spear. The other is an archer. That is all I can tell '
	db	'thee."'
L0737:	db	00
L0738:	db	'Yew'
L073B:	db	00
L073C:	db	'bye'
L073F:	db	00
L0740:	db	'"May thine endeavors reach fruition, '
L0765:	db	00
L0766:	db	'."*'
L0769:	db	00
