L02CE:	db	00
L02CF:	db	'prison'
L02D5:	db	00
L02D6:	db	'"I've never actually seen it," she laughs, "but rumor has it'
	db	' that the cells are located right next to the court, for qui'
	db	'ck, easy imprisonment after the trial."'
L0375:	db	00
L0376:	db	'prison'
L037C:	db	00
L037D:	db	'scholar'
L0384:	db	00
L0385:	db	'"From Aimi I have heard that he is brilliant, and... also a '
	db	'bit overzealous to instruct those interested in increasing t'
	db	'heir knowledge."'
L040D:	db	00
L040E:	db	'Aimi'
L0412:	db	00
L0413:	db	'scholar'
L041A:	db	00
L041B:	db	'Aimi'
L041F:	db	00
L0420:	db	'"She is the monk who tends the garden at the Abbey."'
L0454:	db	00
L0455:	db	'"She is one of the monks who lives at the Abbey. At this tim'
	db	'e, she is the only other person I have actually met here in '
	db	'the forest."'
L04D9:	db	00
L04DA:	db	'Aimi'
L04DE:	db	00
L04DF:	db	'Abbey'
L04E4:	db	00
L04E5:	db	'"That is how this area -- Empath Abbey -- got its name, from'
	db	' the monks who live at the abbey of the Brotherhood of the R'
	db	'ose. They are said to make delicious wine. One of the monks '
	db	'cares for a beautiful garden in her spare time. In fact, I o'
	db	'ften buy flowers from her.~~ But," she grins, "as for the ot'
	db	'her monks, all that I	ever see them do is make wine and wand'
	db	'er the countryside."'
L0661:	db	00
L0662:	db	'Abbey'
L0667:	db	00
L0668:	db	'others'
L066E:	db	00
L066F:	db	'flowers'
L0676:	db	00
L0677:	db	'others'
L067D:	db	00
L067E:	db	'"Aimi is the only one I have met, but I know there are one o'
	db	'r two others who make wine there."'
L06DC:	db	00
L06DD:	db	'Aimi'
L06E1:	db	00
L06E2:	db	'others'
L06E8:	db	00
L06E9:	db	'flowers'
L06F0:	db	00
L06F1:	db	'"Yes, I get them for my mother."'
L0711:	db	00
L0712:	db	'mother'
