L0404:	db	'Taylor'
L040A:	db	00
L040B:	db	'"Well, I haven't actually seen him for some time. I assume h'
	db	'e is still continuing his studies."'
L046A:	db	00
L046B:	db	'Taylor'
L0471:	db	00
L0472:	db	'plants'
L0478:	db	00
L0479:	db	'"Ah, yes, '
L0483:	db	00
L0484:	db	', they are quite wondrous to see. I highly recommend to thee'
	db	' to always observe thy surroundings. Otherwise, '
L04F0:	db	00
L04F1:	db	', thou wilt miss much in life: flowers, trees, birds... land'
	db	'marks!"'
