L033B:	db	'Garok suddenly hits himself on the side of the head.~~ "Get '
	db	'out! Damn thee! Out of there! No one invited thee into mine '
	db	'head! Away with thee!"~~Garok hits himself again, shakes his'
	db	' head like a wet dog and makes a blubbering sound with his l'
	db	'ips.~~Garok looks at you and smiles. "That's better. Now, wh'
	db	'at was it... oh yes, I remember. Thou dost not believe I am '
	db	'a mage? Well, I am. I live in the mountains. But now I am lo'
	db	'st in this wretched dungeon."'
