L0798:	db	'lost'
L079C:	db	00
L079D:	db	'"My crystal ball told me that the source of my problems was '
	db	'in a dungeon, but it did not say which one. This was the fir'
	db	'st dungeon I had ever explored. I have not found anything th'
	db	'at might help me, and I cannot find my way out!"'
L0881:	db	00
L0882:	db	'"I came down here to find the source of my problems. My crys'
	db	'tal ball told me that it was in a dungeon, but did not say w'
	db	'hich one. This is my first dungeon expedition, and now I am '
	db	'lost."'
