	db	'me for the past three years! I neglected to report a certain'
	db	' amount of income for reagent distribution, and somehow they'
	db	' found me out. By the way, if thou shouldst ever care to vis'
	db	'it me in the mountains, I can sell thee reagents at reduced '
	db	'prices!"'
L0E68:	db	00
L0E69:	db	'Tax Council'
L0E74:	db	00
L0E75:	db	'Brother Wayne'
L0E82:	db	00
L0E83:	db	'"Yes, I remember him! He is lost, too! Dost thou know if he '
	db	'found his way out? Give him my best when thou dost speak to '
	db	'him."'
