L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a troll, sulking in his cell. As he breathes, you ca'
	db	'n see his ribs protrude out from under his hide.'
L0079:	db	00
L007A:	db	'"What you want?" growls Gharl.'
L0098:	db	00
L0099:	db	'name'
L009D:	db	00
L009E:	db	'"I Gharl."'
L00A8:	db	00
L00A9:	db	'name'
L00AD:	db	00
L00AE:	db	'job'
L00B1:	db	00
L00B2:	db	'He shakes his head. "No job. Hunt. Eat. Sleep. Now," he gest'
	db	'ures around the cell, "no hunt, no eat, just sleep."'
L0122:	db	00
L0123:	db	'sleep'
L0128:	db	00
L0129:	db	'eat'
L012C:	db	00
L012D:	db	'hunt'
L0131:	db	00
L0132:	db	'hunt'
L0136:	db	00
L0137:	db	'"I good hunter. Catch many things."'
L015A:	db	00
L015B:	db	'hunt'
L015F:	db	00
L0160:	db	'sleep'
L0165:	db	00
L0166:	db	'"I still do that," he says, shrugging. "But not as good as w'
	db	'hen home."'
L01AC:	db	00
L01AD:	db	'sleep'
L01B2:	db	00
L01B3:	db	'home'
L01B7:	db	00
L01B8:	db	'home'
L01BC:	db	00
L01BD:	db	'He stares at you oddly and says, "With other trolls, fleshfa'
	db	'ce! Under bridges."'
L020C:	db	00
L020D:	db	'home'
L0211:	db	00
L0212:	db	'eat'
L0215:	db	00
L0216:	db	'"No eat." He shakes his head. "Not feed. Hate jailer!" he gr'
	db	'owls.'
L0257:	db	00
L0258:	db	'eat'
L025B:	db	00
L025C:	db	'offer food'
L0266:	db	00
L0267:	db	'offer food'
L0271:	db	00
L0272:	db	'"You give me food?" His face displays a mixture of surprise '
	db	'and hope. "You give me food, I tell you secret. Yes?"'
L02E3:	db	00
L02E4:	db	'He quickly devours the food.~~"I thank. You want secret?"'
L031D:	db	00
L031E:	db	'secret'
L0324:	db	00
L0325:	db	'"You taunt me. I not like you."*'
L0345:	db	00
L0346:	db	'"Go away."*'
L0351:	db	00
L0352:	db	'offer food'
L035C:	db	00
L035D:	db	'secret'
L0363:	db	00
L0364:	db	'"Trolls have powerful ally. He warn us in head when trouble '
	db	'around corner."'
L03AF:	db	00
L03B0:	db	'secret'
L03B6:	db	00
L03B7:	db	'bye'
L03BA:	db	00
L03BB:	db	'He grunts and turns away.*'
L03D5:	db	00
