L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a horse. "What else did you expect to see?"'
L0040:	db	00
L0041:	db	'"What now, '
L004C:	db	00
L004D:	db	'?" asks Smith.'
L005B:	db	00
L005C:	db	'name'
L0060:	db	00
L0061:	db	'"Yes, I have a name."'
L0076:	db	00
L0077:	db	'name'
L007B:	db	00
L007C:	db	'"Scoundrel! When thou art asked thy name, thou shouldst resp'
	db	'ond politely and accurately! The Avatar has just asked thee '
	db	'for -thy- name."'
L0104:	db	00
L0105:	db	'"My name? You can call	me what you want, but I will only res'
	db	'pond to Smith."'
L0150:	db	00
