L01C9:	db	00
L01CA:	db	'job'
L01CD:	db	00
L01CE:	db	'"Job? -Job-? I'm a horse, what kind of job could I have?" He'
	db	' looks off in the distance. "I can see it now: Smith -- Bake'
	db	'r extraordinaire.~~"Actually, I have gotten quite good at in'
	db	'terior decorating. See how I arranged my abode? You like it,'
	db	' don't you?"'
L02CA:	db	00
L02CB:	db	'"Good. I will let you continue talking to me then! Which do '
	db	'you prefer, my living room or my bedroom?"'
L0331:	db	00
L0332:	db	'bedroom'
L0339:	db	00
L033A:	db	'living room'
L0345:	db	00
L0346:	db	'"That's funny, I feel the same way about you!"*'
L0375:	db	00
L0376:	db	'bedroom'
L037D:	db	00
L037E:	db	'living room'
L0389:	db	00
L038A:	db	'"You always did have bad taste!"'
