L03D4:	db	00
L03D5:	db	'"Yep, that's what I told you to call me. Oh, I get it! You '
L0410:	db	00
L0411:	db	' something from me, don't you?'
L042F:	db	00
L0430:	db	'"I thought as much. You've always been a selfish one. What d'
	db	'o you want? Now, let's see... Money? Advice?	Happiness? No, '
	db	'you usually want a clue of some sort, don't you. Of course, '
	db	'you may have become altruistic over the past 200 years....~~'
	db	'"I know! You want to save Britannia!"'
