L0707:	db	00
L0708:	db	'"Now we're getting to the nitty-gritty. O.K., I'll give you '
	db	'a clue, but what's in it for me? Let me guess. Money? Love? '
	db	'No, knowing you it's probably nothing. With any luck, you'll'
	db	' go away and leave me alone."'
