		.data
L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'The woman you see in front of you has a concerned expression'
	db	' on her face, as if her thoughts were far away.'
L0078:	db	00
L0079:	db	'"Hail, '
L0080:	db	00
L0081:	db	'. Might I assist thee?" asks Penni.'
L00A4:	db	00
L00A5:	db	'Addom'
L00AA:	db	00
L00AB:	db	'name'
L00AF:	db	00
L00B0:	db	'"My name is Penni, '
L00C3:	db	00
L00C4:	db	'."'
L00C6:	db	00
L00C7:	db	'name'
L00CB:	db	00
L00CC:	db	'Addom'
L00D1:	db	00
L00D2:	db	'job'
L00D5:	db	00
L00D6:	db	'"I have no occupation, '
L00ED:	db	00
L00EE:	db	'. At least not one I would call work. I do, however, teach s'
	db	'kills in close quarter combat.~~She thinks for a moment. "I '
	db	'suppose a better way to answer thy question would have been '
	db	'to say `Yes, I do have a job.' I'm a trainer. But," she smil'
	db	'es, "I enjoy it too much to call it work."'
L0208:	db	00
L0209:	db	'train'
L020E:	db	00
L020F:	db	'enjoy'
L0214:	db	00
L0215:	db	'Bradman'
L021C:	db	00
L021D:	db	'enjoy'
L0222:	db	00
L0223:	db	'"I have loved close-quarter fighting since I was old enough '
	db	'to grasp my first spear. That's why I moved to Yew."'
L0293:	db	00
L0294:	db	'enjoy'
L0299:	db	00
L029A:	db	'Yew'
L029D:	db	00
L029E:	db	'spear'
L02A3:	db	00
L02A4:	db	'spear'
L02A9:	db	00
L02AA:	db	'"It is my choice in arms. The spear combines the best of bot'
	db	'h range and power. It is the perfect hunting weapon."'
L031B:	db	00
L031C:	db	'spear'
L0321:	db	00
L0322:	db	'Yew'
L0325:	db	00
L0326:	db	'"I moved here to hunt, of course. The forest is full of game'
	db	'. I would not think of living anywhere else!"'
L038F:	db	00
L0390:	db	'Yew'
L0393:	db	00
L0394:	db	'train'
L0399:	db	00
L039A:	db	'"Art thou interested in training? My price is 35 gold for ea'
	db	'ch training session."'
L03EB:	db	00
L03EC:	db	'"Perhaps next time."'
L0400:	db	00
L0401:	db	'"I am sorry, '
L040E:	db	00
L040F:	db	', but I am not training at this moment. Perhaps if thou wert'
	db	' to return between 9 in the morning and 6 in the evening, I '
	db	'will be able to help thee."'
L04A2:	db	00
L04A3:	db	'Bradman'
L04AA:	db	00
L04AB:	db	'"Yes," she nods her head, grinning, "I know Bradman. We go h'
	db	'unting together. Of course, he rarely catches anything with '
	db	'that toothpick shooter of his."'
L0542:	db	00
L0543:	db	'"I resent that, my friend. Bows and crossbows can be wielded'
	db	' with deadly effect."'
L0594:	db	00
L0595:	db	'She smiles, nodding to Iolo. "Perhaps thou art correct, frie'
	db	'nd archer, but I prefer more physical challenges."'
L0603:	db	00
L0604:	db	'"Although I consider him a true friend and an honorable comp'
	db	'anion, I wonder about his physical prowess."'
L066C:	db	00
L066D:	db	'Bradman'
L0674:	db	00
L0675:	db	'Addom'
L067A:	db	00
L067B:	db	'"Addom is mine husband. But how did...?" She appears confuse'
	db	'd, but suddenly directs her gaze at you. "Hast thou seen him'
	db	'?"'
L06F5:	db	00
L06F6:	db	'"Is he in good health?"'
L070D:	db	00
L070E:	db	'"Thank goodness!" she sighs in relief.'
L0734:	db	00
L0735:	db	'"I knew he should not have left this time! I hate it when he'
	db	' leaves!" She chokes back her tears.*'
L0796:	db	00
L0797:	db	'"I do hate it so when he travels so far away for such a long'
	db	' time. I can only hope he returns to mine arms quickly!" She'
	db	' peers off in the distance, as if searching for Addom.'
L0845:	db	00
L0846:	db	'Addom'
L084B:	db	00
L084C:	db	'bye'
L084F:	db	00
L0850:	db	'"Good journeying, '
L0862:	db	00
L0863:	db	'."*'
L0866:	db	00
