L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'The beady-eyed man sneers at you.'
L002E:	db	00
L002F:	db	'"What dost thou want now?" Goth spits.'
L0055:	db	00
L0056:	db	'buy keys'
L005E:	db	00
L005F:	db	'name'
L0063:	db	00
L0064:	db	'"Goth. Not that it is any of thy business!"'
L008F:	db	00
L0090:	db	'name'
L0094:	db	00
L0095:	db	'job'
L0098:	db	00
L0099:	db	'"What does it look like I do?" he says, holding up a ring of'
	db	' keys. "Gardening?"'
L00E8:	db	00
L00E9:	db	'gardening'
L00F2:	db	00
L00F3:	db	'keys'
L00F7:	db	00
L00F8:	db	'gardening'
L0101:	db	00
L0102:	db	'"What? Art thou daft?" He shakes his head. "Well, at least t'
	db	'hou art in the right area for gardening."'
L0167:	db	00
L0168:	db	'area'
L016C:	db	00
L016D:	db	'gardening'
L0176:	db	00
L0177:	db	'area'
L017B:	db	00
L017C:	db	'"Empath Abbey, dolt!"'
L0191:	db	00
L0192:	db	'Empath Abbey'
L019E:	db	00
L019F:	db	'area'
L01A3:	db	00
L01A4:	db	'Empath Abbey'
L01B0:	db	00
L01B1:	db	'"As a matter of fact,  know quite a bit about the people who'
	db	' live here. And I just might even tell thee. What is it wort'
	db	'h to thee in gold?"'
L023C:	db	00
L023D:	db	'5'
L023E:	db	00
L023F:	db	'4'
L0240:	db	00
L0241:	db	'3'
L0242:	db	00
L0243:	db	'2'
L0244:	db	00
L0245:	db	'nothing'
L024C:	db	00
L024D:	db	'Empath Abbey'
L0259:	db	00
L025A:	db	'nothing'
L0261:	db	00
L0262:	db	'"Fine by me!"'
L026F:	db	00
L0270:	db	'4'
L0271:	db	00
L0272:	db	'3'
L0273:	db	00
L0274:	db	'2'
L0275:	db	00
L0276:	db	'He glowers at you. "Thou must do better than that, fool!"'
L02AF:	db	00
L02B0:	db	'5'
L02B1:	db	00
L02B2:	db	'"I will tell thee what I know: Sir Jeff is in charge of the '
	db	'High Court. 'E's a real mean bastard, so I would stay away f'
	db	'rom 'im. The monks nearby make excellent wine, and Aimi doth'
	db	' warm a man's... heart. And whatever thou dost, do not waste'
	db	' time talking to the undertaker -- 'e's daft in the head."'
L03DC:	db	00
L03DD:	db	'"Thou dost not have enough gold, toad."'
