L0408:	db	00
L0409:	db	'3'
L040A:	db	00
L040B:	db	'2'
L040C:	db	00
L040D:	db	'keys'
L0411:	db	00
L0412:	db	'"These? They are for the prisoner's cells, witless knave!"'
L044C:	db	00
L044D:	db	'buy keys'
L0455:	db	00
L0456:	db	'prisoners'
L045F:	db	00
L0460:	db	'keys'
L0464:	db	00
L0465:	db	'prisoners'
L046E:	db	00
L046F:	db	'"I will tell thee for 5 gold. Interested?"'
L0499:	db	00
L049A:	db	'"One of them is named D'Rel. E's a pirate, from Buccaneer's '
	db	'Den."'
L04DB:	db	00
L04DC:	db	'another prisoner'
L04EC:	db	00
L04ED:	db	'"Thou dost not have enough money, stonehead."'
L051A:	db	00
L051B:	db	'"Pinchpenny!"*'
L0529:	db	00
L052A:	db	'prisoners'
L0533:	db	00
L0534:	db	'another prisoner'
L0544:	db	00
L0545:	db	'"Another, eh. Hast thou 5 more gold for me?"'
L0571:	db	00
L0572:	db	'"The other one is a troll. 'E don't talk much, but	'e's the '
	db	'first troll prisoner I have ever seen."'
L05D5:	db	00
L05D6:	db	'another prisoner'
L05E6:	db	00
L05E7:	db	'"Thou canst not fool me, brainless dolt. Thou dost not have '
	db	'enough gold!"'
L0630:	db	00
L0631:	db	'"Fine, slug!"*'
L063F:	db	00
L0640:	db	'another prisoner'
L0650:	db	00
L0651:	db	'buy keys'
L0659:	db	00
L065A:	db	'"Thou dost want these, eh?" he asks, holding up keys. "'Twil'
	db	'l cost thee... 20 gold. Still want them?"'
L06BF:	db	00
L06C0:	db	'"Done!"'
L06C7:	db	00
L06C8:	db	'buy keys'
L06D0:	db	00
L06D1:	db	'He smiles cruelly. "I am afraid thou dost not have enough go'
	db	'ld."'
L0711:	db	00
L0712:	db	'"Fine. Rot for all I care!*'
L072D:	db	00
L072E:	db	'buy keys'
L0736:	db	00
L0737:	db	'bye'
L073A:	db	00
L073B:	db	'"Indeed, knave. Get thee gone!"*'
L075B:	db	00
