L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'return flag'
L0018:	db	00
L0019:	db	'"I see that coward Sprellic has given thee the flag so that '
	db	'it may be returned to us. Thou hadst better hand it over."'
L008F:	db	00
L0090:	db	'She takes the banner from you.'
L00AE:	db	00
L00AF:	db	'"This matter is now settled. But tell that worm Sprellic fro'
	db	'm me that he had better keep his hands off of other people's'
	db	' property in the future."*'
L0141:	db	00
L0142:	db	'"It has come to our attention that thou hast been given our '
	db	'honor flag. Apparently Sprellic gave it to thee to return to'
	db	' us. If thou dost wish to keep it then our quarrel is now wi'
	db	'th thee."*'
L0200:	db	00
L0201:	db	'"Thou mayest fight for Sprellic, but I fight for honor!"*'
L023A:	db	00
L023B:	db	'Standing before you is a statuesque fighting woman with eyes'
	db	' that radiate a familiarity with danger.'
L029F:	db	00
L02A0:	db	'"It seems we meet again," says Syria.'
L02C5:	db	00
L02C6:	db	'name'
L02CA:	db	00
L02CB:	db	'"I am Syria, a fighter from the south."'
L02F2:	db	00
L02F3:	db	'name'
L02F7:	db	00
L02F8:	db	'job'
L02FB:	db	00
L02FC:	db	'"Currently I am resting from my last voyage as a mercenary. '
	db	'I am	studying in Jhelom with the fighting trainer De Snel	at'
	db	' the Library of Scars."'
L038B:	db	00
L038C:	db	'Library of Scars'
L039C:	db	00
L039D:	db	'De Snel'
L03A4:	db	00
L03A5:	db	'Jhelom'
L03AB:	db	00
L03AC:	db	'Jhelom'
L03B2:	db	00
L03B3:	db	'"This is a city of fighters and duels. If thou dost not like'
	db	' it the way it is, then leave. Duels are fought here for man'
	db	'y reasons. I have mine own reasons for fighting them."'
L0461:	db	00
L0462:	db	'duels'
L0467:	db	00
L0468:	db	'Jhelom'
L046E:	db	00
L046F:	db	'duels'
L0474:	db	00
L0475:	db	'"There is no question that Sprellic is the one who took the '
	db	'honor flag of our school. If he does not wish to fight the d'
	db	'uels then he has only to return it."'
L0511:	db	00
L0512:	db	'return'
L0518:	db	00
L0519:	db	'Sprellic'
L0521:	db	00
L0522:	db	'"A pity we could not teach that little fool a lesson. Still,'
	db	' we have regained our honor and that is enough. For now."'
L0597:	db	00
L0598:	db	'Sprellic'
L05A0:	db	00
L05A1:	db	'duels'
L05A6:	db	00
L05A7:	db	'return'
L05AD:	db	00
L05AE:	db	'"Since Sprellic has not done this, it proves that he is sinc'
	db	'ere in the grievous insult that he has made against us."*'
L0623:	db	00
L0624:	db	'"And I shall grievously insult him-- through his heart!"*'
L065D:	db	00
L065E:	db	'return'
L0664:	db	00
L0665:	db	'Sprellic'
L066D:	db	00
L066E:	db	'"I was on guard when Sprellic took our club's honor flag. I '
	db	'saw him take it but I lost him in the shadows of the night. '
	db	'My punishment was ten lashes for allowing the thief to escap'
	db	'e. I mean to repay him for that."'
L0743:	db	00
L0744:	db	'"A pity we could not teach that little fool a lesson. Perhap'
	db	's we have anyway. For his sake, he had better have learned i'
	db	't well."'
L07C4:	db	00
L07C5:	db	'Sprellic'
L07CD:	db	00
L07CE:	db	'Library of Scars'
L07DE:	db	00
L07DF:	db	'"The Library of Scars is the greatest guild of fighters in B'
	db	'ritannia."*'
L0826:	db	00
L0827:	db	'"Here! Here!"*'
L0835:	db	00
L0836:	db	'Library of Scars'
L0846:	db	00
L0847:	db	'De Snel'
L084E:	db	00
L084F:	db	'"Master De Snel teaches a style of pure fighting which takes'
	db	' thee beyond all previous disciplines that thou mayest have '
	db	'learned. He is a great man."'
L08E3:	db	00
L08E4:	db	'De Snel'
L08EB:	db	00
L08EC:	db	'return flag'
L08F7:	db	00
L08F8:	db	'"I understand that coward Sprellic has given thee the flag s'
	db	'o that it may be returned to us. Thou hadst better hand it o'
	db	'ver."'
L0975:	db	00
L0976:	db	'She takes the banner from you.'
L0994:	db	00
L0995:	db	'"This matter is now settled. But tell that worm Sprellic fro'
	db	'm me that he had better keep his hands off of other people's'
	db	' property in the future."'
L0A26:	db	00
L0A27:	db	'"It has come to our attention that thou hast been given our '
	db	'honor flag. Apparently Sprellic gave it to thee to return to'
	db	' us. If thou dost wish to keep it then our quarrel is now wi'
	db	'th thee."'
L0AE4:	db	00
L0AE5:	db	'"Meet us at the dueling area at next noon!"*'
L0B11:	db	00
L0B12:	db	'"Prepare to die!"*'
L0B24:	db	00
L0B25:	db	'return flag'
L0B30:	db	00
L0B31:	db	'bye'
L0B34:	db	00
L0B35:	db	'"We do not appreciate people who interfere in our private ma'
	db	'tters. We shall be watching thee."*'
