L0000:	db	'You attempt to speak to the undead creature, but it does not'
	db	', or cannot, respond.*'
L0052:	db	00
L0053:	db	'The Liche practically glows, power coursing visibly through '
	db	'its undead veins.'
L00A0:	db	00
L00A1:	db	'You step forward to confront this vile-looking creature and '
	db	'he slowly turns to face you. As his intense gaze locks onto '
	db	'your form, you almost wish you hadn't been so bold.~~ "'
L0150:	db	00
L0151:	db	'." A sardonic expression comes to his undead features. "How '
	db	'may I help thee?" You get the distinct impression that help '
	db	'is the last thing you'll get from the Liche.'
L01F5:	db	00
L01F6:	db	'Shamino steps near you and speaks in a whispered tone.~~"Do '
	db	'not trust this one, '
L0246:	db	00
L0247:	db	'. Methinks he'll cause naught but evil."'
L026F:	db	00
L0270:	db	'Iolo steps near you and speaks in a whispered tone.~~"Do not'
	db	' trust this one, '
L02BD:	db	00
L02BE:	db	'. Methinks he'll cause naught but evil."'
L02E6:	db	00
L02E7:	db	'"Uh, '
L02EC:	db	00
L02ED:	db	'? I am ready to go now," he says to you, cowering from the u'
	db	'ndead creature.*'
L0339:	db	00
L033A:	db	'The Liche performs something akin to a smile and speaks with'
	db	' a sarcastic flair.~~"Ah, the wondrous Avatar has returned. '
	db	'What have I done to deserve such an honor?" The word "honor"'
	db	' sours on this creature's tongue.'
L040F:	db	00
