L0422:	db	'The Liche's dry features take on a haughty appearance. "Thou'
	db	' mayest call me Lord Horance. It would only be prudent, as I'
	db	' shall one day rule all of Britannia.~~ "Surprised, Avatar? '
	db	'Come now. Surely thou dost not think that Lord British will '
	db	'stand in my way. I know how to deal with his ilk."'
