L0570:	db	00
L0571:	db	'"Ah, it is good to hear such an obeisance from the Avatar. P'
	db	'erhaps thou wilt have a place in my New Order." The Liche lo'
	db	'oks at you with an expression somewhere between malice and h'
	db	'umor.'
