L0000:	db	'You see a ghostly man cowering in the corner. Holding up an '
	db	'ankh in a protective fashion, he looks around the room frant'
	db	'ically, but takes no notice of you.*'
L009C:	db	00
L009D:	db	'leave'
L00A2:	db	00
L00A3:	db	'He looks into the well, at the swirling pool of trapped soul'
	db	's and his newfound resolve seems to diminish. "Perhaps this '
	db	'was not such a good idea. Art thou sure that I must go throu'
	db	'gh with this?"~~You nod. His resolve firms once again.~~"Yes'
	db	', thou art quite right. No time for speeches. No time for a '
	db	'wavering will. No time for..." He sees that you're not buyin'
	db	'g his attempt to stall.~~"Well then, this is it." He moves t'
	db	'oward the well. "I suppose I didn't make a very good Mayor i'
	db	'n life." Forsythe's jowls droop.~~"Well, at least in death, '
	db	'I'll make a name for myself and do the job right." With that'
	db	', he's gone.~~The souls of the well rush out of their confin'
	db	'ement, leaving the blackened remains of the powerful artifac'
	db	't.*'
L0376:	db	00
L0377:	db	'"Thou must merely lead me to the well, and I shall do my dut'
	db	'y." He seems quite resigned to his fate.*'
