		.funcnumber	0496H	;* Penumbra.
		.data
L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'blackrock'
L0016:	db	00
L0017:	db	'ring'
L001B:	db	00
L001C:	db	'The mage, having been asleep for 200 years, looks just as sh'
	db	'e did upon your last visit to Britannia.~~"Avatar! I cannot '
	db	'believe 'tis thee! Thou didst come and wake me! I knew thee '
	db	'would!"'
L00D7:	db	00
L00D8:	db	'Suddenly, Penumbra grabs her head in pain. "Oh!" she cries. '
	db	'"Mine head! The pain! What is happening? What didst thou do '
	db	'to me?" She closes her eyes and concentrates. "There is a di'
	db	'sturbance in the ether! I can feel my magical powers fading!'
	db	' Help me, '
L01D2:	db	00
L01D3:	db	'! Help me!!"'
L01DF:	db	00
L01E0:	db	'ether'
L01E5:	db	00
L01E6:	db	'Penumbra is in so much pain she can barely speak. "Yes, '
L021E:	db	00
L021F:	db	'?"'
L0221:	db	00
L0222:	db	'"Oh! I feel so much better! The pain is ebbing. Now we may c'
	db	'onverse much more easily."'
L0278:	db	00
L0279:	db	'"Yes, '
L027F:	db	00
L0280:	db	'?"'
L0282:	db	00
L0283:	db	'ether'
L0288:	db	00
L0289:	db	'name'
L028D:	db	00
L028E:	db	'"I am Penumbra. Surely thou dost remember me?"'
L02BC:	db	00
L02BD:	db	'name'
L02C1:	db	00
L02C2:	db	'job'
L02C5:	db	00
L02C6:	db	'Penumbra is in pain. "I cannot think straight whilst the eth'
	db	'er is disturbed. I can do nothing until it is flowing smooth'
	db	'ly again!"'
L0348:	db	00
L0349:	db	'"I am a practicing mage. Once I get my business going again,'
	db	' I should be able to sell spells and reagents. After all, I '
	db	'have been asleep for 200 years!"'
L03E1:	db	00
L03E2:	db	'ether'
L03E7:	db	00
L03E8:	db	'"The ether controls all the magic in the world. When there i'
	db	's a disturbance in the ether, no mage can cast successful sp'
	db	'ells. A mage might even lose his mind after a long period of'
	db	' time! Thou must find a way to protect me from the warped et'
	db	'hereal waves!"'
L04E6:	db	00
L04E7:	db	'protect'
L04EE:	db	00
L04EF:	db	'"I feel much better. The damaged ethereal waves are not stri'
	db	'king my mind. But now we must destroy what is causing this p'
	db	'roblem!"'
L056F:	db	00
L0570:	db	'Penumbra thinks a moment. "I feel that the damaged ethereal '
	db	'waves are coming from a source very near here. I suspect the'
	db	're is something in a dungeon on these islands that is creati'
	db	'ng the havoc. Try Dungeon Deceit. I have a strong sense that'
	db	' thy goal is there.'
L0673:	db	00
