L0389:	db	'"Surely thou dost recognize thine old companion, Mariah?"*'
L03C3:	db	00
L03C4:	db	'"Yes, dost thou not recognize me?" She pauses, glaring at yo'
	db	'u. "But who art thou, and where are my pastries?"'
