L04AC:	db	'She smiles. "I have a very important job, I do. My, are not '
	db	'those shelves lovely? So neat and orderly." She looks back a'
	db	't you.~~"Be careful! The ink wells are full, and the quills '
	db	'so sharp." She giggles.'
