L0794:	db	'"Yes," she agrees, "I do indeed sell. I even spell. In fact,'
	db	' I even sell spells! But, if thou desirest reagents, thou ar'
	db	't out of luck, for I only sell those during one of the seven'
	db	' weekdays. Wouldst thou like to know which day?~~"What a lov'
	db	'ely set of books thou must have! I have just the item for th'
	db	'ee to match thy shelves -- a potion. If thou wilt buy a spel'
	db	'l or reagent from me, I will sell thee a potion for only its'
	db	' normal price!"'
