L0738:	db	00
L0739:	db	'no one'
L073F:	db	00
L0740:	db	'scholars'
L0748:	db	00
L0749:	db	'"Ah, the learned scholars. I can tell thee about Brion, Nels'
	db	'on, Zelda, and Jillian."'
L079D:	db	00
L079E:	db	'Jillian'
L07A5:	db	00
L07A6:	db	'Zelda'
L07AB:	db	00
L07AC:	db	'Nelson'
L07B2:	db	00
L07B3:	db	'Brion'
L07B8:	db	00
L07B9:	db	'no one'
L07BF:	db	00
L07C0:	db	'leaders'
L07C7:	db	00
L07C8:	db	'"Dost thou want to know about the one in charge or his clerk'
	db	'?"'
L0806:	db	00
L0807:	db	'clerk'
L080C:	db	00
L080D:	db	'charge'
L0813:	db	00
L0814:	db	'no one'
L081A:	db	00
L081B:	db	'mage'
L081F:	db	00
L0820:	db	'"Ah, yes, Mariah is very nice."'
L083F:	db	00
L0840:	db	'"She can sell thee many spells."'
L0860:	db	00
L0861:	db	'"But I am more interested in discussing Zelda."'
L0890:	db	00
L0891:	db	'mage'
L0895:	db	00
L0896:	db	'shop keeper'
L08A1:	db	00
L08A2:	db	'"She is a tailor. Lovely woman, that Carlyn. She minds the b'
	db	'ar when I go to the Fellowship meetings at night."'
L0910:	db	00
L0911:	db	'"But I would rather discuss Zelda."'
L0934:	db	00
L0935:	db	'shop keeper'
L0940:	db	00
L0941:	db	'Jillian'
L0948:	db	00
L0949:	db	'"Wonderful scholar. Very nice woman. Married to Effrem."'
L0981:	db	00
L0982:	db	'Effrem'
L0988:	db	00
L0989:	db	'"But I am more interested in discussing Zelda."'
L09B8:	db	00
L09B9:	db	'Jillian'
L09C0:	db	00
L09C1:	db	'Effrem'
L09C7:	db	00
L09C8:	db	'"Friendly fellow -- I like him."'
L09E8:	db	00
L09E9:	db	'"He stays home to care for their son."'
L0A0F:	db	00
L0A10:	db	'"But I am more interested in discussing Brion."'
L0A3F:	db	00
L0A40:	db	'Effrem'
L0A46:	db	00
L0A47:	db	'trainer'
L0A4E:	db	00
L0A4F:	db	'"Chad is a friendly fellow -- I like him."'
L0A79:	db	00
L0A7A:	db	'"But I would rather discuss Brion."'
L0A9D:	db	00
L0A9E:	db	'trainer'
L0AA5:	db	00
L0AA6:	db	'farmers'
L0AAD:	db	00
L0AAE:	db	'"Tolemac and Cubolt are brothers. With Morz's help, they run'
	db	' a farm."'
L0AF3:	db	00
L0AF4:	db	'"But I would prefer to talk about Brion."'
L0B1D:	db	00
L0B1E:	db	'farmers'
L0B25:	db	00
L0B26:	db	'healer'
L0B2C:	db	00
L0B2D:	db	'"Friendly fellow -- I like him. His name is Elad."'
L0B5F:	db	00
L0B60:	db	'"Sadly, his true desire is to leave Moonglow in search of ad'
	db	'venture. But he will not leave, for he feels too much obliga'
	db	'tion for his patients." Phearcy shrugs.~"Perhaps not without'
	db	' reason."'
L0C1D:	db	00
L0C1E:	db	'"But Brion is more interesting to me."'
L0C44:	db	00
L0C45:	db	'healer'
L0C4B:	db	00
L0C4C:	db	'Nelson'
L0C52:	db	00
L0C53:	db	'"He is Brion's twin brother."'
L0C70:	db	00
L0C71:	db	'"Speaking of that, I would like to discuss Brion."'
L0CA3:	db	00
L0CA4:	db	'Nelson'
L0CAA:	db	00
L0CAB:	db	'charge'
L0CB1:	db	00
L0CB2:	db	'"Rankin is in charge of the entire local branch. If thou has'
	db	't any questions about The Fellowship, he can answer them."'
L0D28:	db	00
L0D29:	db	'charge'
L0D2F:	db	00
L0D30:	db	'clerk'
L0D35:	db	00
L0D36:	db	'"If thou hast any questions about The Fellowship, Balayna ca'
	db	'n answer them."'
L0D81:	db	00
