L0D94:	db	'"Well, as thou dost know, Brion is the head of Observatory, '
	db	'and Zelda, the advisor at the Lyceaum, is in love with him."'
L0E0C:	db	00
L0E0D:	db	'"Ah, so thou dost wonder, too. All I know is that every time'
	db	' someone mentions Brion's name to Zelda, her serious express'
	db	'ion changes to a smile.~~"I have a deal for thee. Find out w'
	db	'hat their story is, and I will give thee and thy friends a f'
	db	'ree meal and drink. Thou canst find Brion at the observatory'
	db	' and Zelda at the Lyceaum."'
