L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a handsome,hardened, muscular man who, surprisingly,'
	db	' bears a friendly smile on his face.'
L006D:	db	00
L006E:	db	'"Please, '
L0077:	db	00
L0078:	db	'. Join me for some company."'
L0094:	db	00
L0095:	db	'crystal'
L009C:	db	00
L009D:	db	'name'
L00A1:	db	00
L00A2:	db	'"I am called Addom, '
L00B6:	db	00
L00B7:	db	'.'
L00B8:	db	00
L00B9:	db	'name'
L00BD:	db	00
L00BE:	db	'job'
L00C1:	db	00
L00C2:	db	'"I travel the world in search of rare and unique items to se'
	db	'll to museums. I am not a resident of Moonglow."'
L012E:	db	00
L012F:	db	'items'
L0134:	db	00
L0135:	db	'travel'
L013B:	db	00
L013C:	db	'Moonglow'
L0144:	db	00
L0145:	db	'crystal'
L014C:	db	00
L014D:	db	'travel'
L0153:	db	00
L0154:	db	'"I have been all over Britannia, '
L0175:	db	00
L0176:	db	'. Nothing about the land frightens me any longer."~~ He grin'
	db	's. "The same is not true of some of the residents."'
L01E5:	db	00
L01E6:	db	'residents'
L01EF:	db	00
L01F0:	db	'travel'
L01F6:	db	00
L01F7:	db	'residents'
L0200:	db	00
L0201:	db	'"'Twas a joke, '
L0210:	db	00
L0211:	db	'."'
L0213:	db	00
L0214:	db	'residents'
L021D:	db	00
L021E:	db	'items'
L0223:	db	00
L0224:	db	'"I have found many odd artifacts. Many of the things thou ha'
	db	'st seen in The Music Hall and the Lycaeum have been brought '
	db	'to them by me."'
L02AB:	db	00
L02AC:	db	'"In fact, '
L02B6:	db	00
L02B7:	db	', I have this unique crystal I found on the mainland near Jh'
	db	'elom that I am hoping will fetch a fair price from Nelson."~'
	db	'~He pulls out a small clear crystal and shows it to you.~~Th'
	db	'e facets gleam in the light.'
L0387:	db	00
L0388:	db	'Nelson'
L038E:	db	00
L038F:	db	'items'
L0394:	db	00
L0395:	db	'Nelson'
L039B:	db	00
L039C:	db	'"He is in charge of the Lycaeum. He loves trinkets and rarit'
	db	'ies."'
L03DD:	db	00
L03DE:	db	'Nelson'
L03E4:	db	00
L03E5:	db	'Moonglow'
L03ED:	db	00
L03EE:	db	'"I am afraid, '
L03FC:	db	00
L03FD:	db	', that I know nothing about this fair city. I reside in Yew '
	db	'with my wife, Penni, who is the trainer there.~~"Actually, '
L0474:	db	00
L0475:	db	', I have met two people here, other than Nelson."'
L04A6:	db	00
L04A7:	db	'Moonglow'
L04AF:	db	00
L04B0:	db	'Penni'
L04B5:	db	00
L04B6:	db	'people'
L04BC:	db	00
L04BD:	db	'people'
L04C3:	db	00
L04C4:	db	'I have come to know the bartender and the healer."'
L04F6:	db	00
L04F7:	db	'people'
L04FD:	db	00
L04FE:	db	'healer'
L0504:	db	00
L0505:	db	'bartender'
L050E:	db	00
L050F:	db	'bartender'
L0518:	db	00
L0519:	db	'"Phearcy is quite friendly. But he does love to gossip. He h'
	db	'as offered me a deal whereby I might earn free meals if I ca'
	db	'n discover why Nelson's assistant reacts differently to some'
	db	' man, or something like that. I am not going to bother, but '
	db	'pray, do not tell Phearcy that!"'
L0629:	db	00
L062A:	db	'Nelson'
L0630:	db	00
L0631:	db	'bartender'
L063A:	db	00
L063B:	db	'healer'
L0641:	db	00
L0642:	db	'"Elad is very generous. In fact, he is letting me sleep in o'
	db	'ne of his spare beds while I am in town. His only charge," h'
	db	'e laughs, "is the stories I tell him about mine adventures.~'
	db	'~"Not a bad trade if I say so myself," he shrugs.'
L0727:	db	00
L0728:	db	'healer'
L072E:	db	00
L072F:	db	'Penni'
L0734:	db	00
L0735:	db	'"She teaches close-quarter combat. Everything I needed to kn'
	db	'ow to survive on my journeys I learned from her."'
L07A2:	db	00
L07A3:	db	'Penni'
L07A8:	db	00
L07A9:	db	'crystal'
L07B0:	db	00
L07B1:	db	'"Dost thou mean this?" He pulls a small, clear, multi-facete'
	db	'd gem from a pouch beneath his cloak. "I just found this rec'
	db	'ently. I was hoping to sell it to the Lycaeum, but, alas, th'
	db	'ey have no use for it. Dost thou want it, perhaps?" he asks,'
	db	' hopefully. "I will sell it to thee for 20 gold."'
L08D2:	db	00
L08D3:	db	'"I thank thee."'
L08E2:	db	00
L08E3:	db	'"I am truly sorry, '
L08F6:	db	00
L08F7:	db	', but thou dost not have enough room."'
L091D:	db	00
L091E:	db	'"I am truly sorry, '
L0931:	db	00
L0932:	db	', but thou dost not have enough gold."'
L0958:	db	00
L0959:	db	'"Very well," he sighs, disappointed.'
L097D:	db	00
L097E:	db	'crystal'
L0985:	db	00
L0986:	db	'bye'
L0989:	db	00
