L0765:	db	'bellicose'
L076E:	db	00
L076F:	db	'"And," he pauses, peering very closely at your face, "I neve'
	db	'r noticed how large thy nose is. 'Tis amazing thou canst fin'
	db	'd enough air to breathe."'
L0800:	db	00
L0801:	db	'nose'
L0805:	db	00
L0806:	db	'teeth'
L080B:	db	00
L080C:	db	'bellicose'
L0815:	db	00
L0816:	db	'"Yes, bellicose, warlike, angry. If thou dost not know that,'
	db	' I believe thou needest to improve thy vocabulary. Thou art '
	db	'too unschooled."'
L089E:	db	00
L089F:	db	'bellicose'
L08A8:	db	00
L08A9:	db	'unschooled'
L08B3:	db	00
L08B4:	db	'unschooled'
L08BE:	db	00
L08BF:	db	'"Trust me, '
L08CA:	db	00
L08CB:	db	', thou art too ignorant to argue with me."'
L08F5:	db	00
L08F6:	db	'"Oh, this is too much!"*'
L090E:	db	00
L090F:	db	'unschooled'
L0919:	db	00
L091A:	db	'nose'
L091E:	db	00
L091F:	db	'"Truly quite large, and not in the least bit attractive."'
L0958:	db	00
L0959:	db	'nose'
L095D:	db	00
L095E:	db	'bye'
L0961:	db	00
L0962:	db	'"Thou hast the manners of a pig. 'Tis not polite to break co'
	db	'nversation so abruptly."*'
L09B7:	db	00
