		.data
L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'thief'
L0012:	db	00
L0013:	db	'venom found'
L001E:	db	00
L001F:	db	'venom found'
L002A:	db	00
L002B:	db	'A stern-looking woman stares back at you without humor.'
L0062:	db	00
L0063:	db	'"Greetings to thee, '
L0077:	db	00
L0078:	db	'," you hear Brita say.'
L008E:	db	00
L008F:	db	'name'
L0093:	db	00
L0094:	db	'"I am Brita."'
L00A1:	db	00
L00A2:	db	'name'
L00A6:	db	00
L00A7:	db	'job'
L00AA:	db	00
L00AB:	db	'"I help mine husband Feridwyn run The Fellowship's shelter i'
	db	'n Paws."'
L00EF:	db	00
L00F0:	db	'Paws'
L00F4:	db	00
L00F5:	db	'shelter'
L00FC:	db	00
L00FD:	db	'Fellowship'
L0107:	db	00
L0108:	db	'Feridwyn'
L0110:	db	00
L0111:	db	'Feridwyn'
L0119:	db	00
L011A:	db	'"Mine husband is a good man who devotes himself selflessly t'
	db	'o helping the poor of this town, something they do not appre'
	db	'ciate. He is a good man and a dutiful Fellowship member."'
L01CB:	db	00
L01CC:	db	'"Mine husband is the most honorable man I have ever met in m'
	db	'y life."'
L0210:	db	00
L0211:	db	'"Do not put stock in the proud boasts of wives, good Avatar.'
	db	' I am a simple man who only does what he can."*'
L027C:	db	00
L027D:	db	'Feridwyn'
L0285:	db	00
L0286:	db	'Fellowship'
L0290:	db	00
L0291:	db	'"Thou shouldst speak to mine husband of The Fellowship. I am'
	db	' certain thou wilt be most impressed by what he shall have t'
	db	'o tell thee."'
L0316:	db	00
L0317:	db	'"Seeing that thou hast joined The Fellowship only confirms w'
	db	'hat I already know. That The Fellowship is the path by which'
	db	' we shall lead Britannia to a wonderful new future. News tha'
	db	't thou hast joined us is spreading far and wide!"'
L03FC:	db	00
L03FD:	db	'Fellowship'
L0407:	db	00
L0408:	db	'shelter'
L040F:	db	00
L0410:	db	'"Running the shelter is hard work for mine husband and me, b'
	db	'ut it is worth the effort to ease the suffering of those les'
	db	's fortunate than we."'
L049D:	db	00
L049E:	db	'shelter'
L04A5:	db	00
L04A6:	db	'Paws'
L04AA:	db	00
L04AB:	db	'"We hear about everything that goes on in Paws. If I do not '
	db	'know about it then mine husband does. Is there anyone in par'
	db	'ticular thou dost wish to know about?"'
L0549:	db	00
L054A:	db	'"I know about these people:"'
L0566:	db	00
L0567:	db	'Polly'
L056C:	db	00
L056D:	db	'Camille'
L0574:	db	00
L0575:	db	'Alina'
L057A:	db	00
L057B:	db	'"It is good to determine an impression of others on one's ow'
	db	'n."'
L05BA:	db	00
L05BB:	db	'Paws'
L05BF:	db	00
L05C0:	db	'Alina'
L05C5:	db	00
L05C6:	db	'"Alina lives in the shelter with her baby, poor thing. Her h'
	db	'usband is a common thief who even now sits in prison. But we'
	db	' shall help her get her life straightened out once we persua'
	db	'de her to join The Fellowship. She is not smart enough, thou'
	db	' knowest, to see the advantages for herself. She must be car'
	db	'efully instructed."'
L0705:	db	00
L0706:	db	'Alina'
L070B:	db	00
L070C:	db	'Camille'
L0713:	db	00
L0714:	db	'"Camille is a farm widow. She tends to live in the past, fol'
	db	'lowing the old virtues and questioning the ways of The Fello'
	db	'wship. These country folk are so superstitious, thou knowest'
	db	'. It is a fault of their low intellect. She does not even no'
	db	'tice what a hooligan her boy, Tobias, is growing up to be! N'
	db	'ot at all like our son, Garritt."'
L0861:	db	00
L0862:	db	'Garritt'
L0869:	db	00
L086A:	db	'Tobias'
L0870:	db	00
L0871:	db	'Camille'
L0878:	db	00
L0879:	db	'Tobias'
L087F:	db	00
L0880:	db	'"A simply wretched little urchin. Always sulking. But then, '
	db	'one must realize that he has no father to discipline him pro'
	db	'perly."'
L08FF:	db	00
L0900:	db	'Tobias'
L0906:	db	00
L0907:	db	'venom found'
L0912:	db	00
L0913:	db	'"Thou dost say that vial of venom was found in Garritt's bel'
	db	'ongings? I do not believe it! Art thou saying my son is a li'
	db	'ar and a thief? I wilt not believe it! Good day to thee!"*'
L09C5:	db	00
L09C6:	db	'"So Garritt admits he stole the venom vial. I cannot believe'
	db	' it! I do not know what to say."'
L0A22:	db	00
L0A23:	db	'Garritt'
L0A2A:	db	00
L0A2B:	db	'venom found'
L0A36:	db	00
L0A37:	db	'Garritt'
L0A3E:	db	00
L0A3F:	db	'Brita beams. "Garritt is a wonderful son. He is being raised'
	db	' to follow the values of The Fellowship. His worthiness has '
	db	'been rewarded."'
L0AC6:	db	00
L0AC7:	db	'rewarded'
L0ACF:	db	00
L0AD0:	db	'Brita frowns even more than before. "If thou dost ask me, 't'
	db	'was all a plot to get my little boy in trouble. If thou had '
	db	'not come to town, this entire incident would not have happen'
	db	'ed!"'
L0B88:	db	00
L0B89:	db	'Garritt'
L0B90:	db	00
L0B91:	db	'rewarded'
L0B99:	db	00
L0B9A:	db	'"Garritt is so talented at the whistle panpipes! It is truly'
	db	' a gift!"'
L0BDF:	db	00
L0BE0:	db	'rewarded'
L0BE8:	db	00
L0BE9:	db	'Polly'
L0BEE:	db	00
L0BEF:	db	'"Polly runs the local tavern to be near people. She is a lon'
	db	'ely soul and feels that there is simply no one who wishes fo'
	db	'r her heart. It makes me so sad to think of her. She could f'
	db	'ind all the companionship she could want if she would join T'
	db	'he Fellowship."'
L0CEE:	db	00
L0CEF:	db	'Polly'
L0CF4:	db	00
L0CF5:	db	'thief'
L0CFA:	db	00
L0CFB:	db	'"One of our members, a local merchant named Morfin, had a sh'
	db	'ipment of silver serpent venom stolen from him. Not that I c'
	db	'are about the venom itself, but is it not shocking?"'
L0DA7:	db	00
L0DA8:	db	'thief'
L0DAD:	db	00
L0DAE:	db	'serpent venom'
L0DBB:	db	00
L0DBC:	db	'serpent venom'
L0DC9:	db	00
L0DCA:	db	'"I have never seen any myself. I have no idea what it does t'
	db	'o someone, but it cannot possibly be good!"'
L0E31:	db	00
L0E32:	db	'serpent venom'
L0E3F:	db	00
L0E40:	db	'bye'
L0E43:	db	00
L0E44:	db	'"Mayest thou walk with The Fellowship, Avatar."*'
L0E74:	db	00
