L0057:	db	'You see a man whose eyes slowly shift back and forth as a cr'
	db	'ooked smile curls his lips. He walks up to you, looks you up'
	db	' and down. "Oh, there must be a travelling show in town!" he'
	db	' says sniggering. "That is a very nice clown costume! Who ar'
	db	't thou?"*'
L0150:	db	00
L0151:	db	'"Very well, '
L015D:	db	00
L015E:	db	'. What dost thou want?"'
L0175:	db	00
L0176:	db	'"Rude dog!"*'
L0182:	db	00
L0183:	db	'"Thou art a vile fool, desperate for others to like thee. I '
	db	'would pity thee, were it not that I loathe thee even more!"*'
L01FB:	db	00
L01FC:	db	'"Greetings, '
L0208:	db	00
L0209:	db	'," says Morfin.'
L0218:	db	00
L0219:	db	'name'
L021D:	db	00
L021E:	db	'"My name is Morfin."'
L0232:	db	00
L0233:	db	'name'
L0237:	db	00
L0238:	db	'job'
L023B:	db	00
L023C:	db	'"I am a merchant who operates one of the most thriving busin'
	db	'esses in Paws, which includes the slaughterhouse."'
L02AA:	db	00
L02AB:	db	'slaughterhouse'
L02B9:	db	00
L02BA:	db	'Paws'
L02BE:	db	00
L02BF:	db	'merchant'
L02C7:	db	00
L02C8:	db	'merchant'
L02D0:	db	00
L02D1:	db	'"Oh, I sell a little of this and that, here and there. Where'
	db	'ver there is a demand, I try to supply it."'
L0338:	db	00
L0339:	db	'supply'
L033F:	db	00
L0340:	db	'demand'
L0346:	db	00
L0347:	db	'merchant'
L034F:	db	00
L0350:	db	'demand'
L0356:	db	00
L0357:	db	'"There is quite a demand for the venom of the silver serpent'
	db	' in certain areas, for instance."'
L03B4:	db	00
L03B5:	db	'demand'
L03BB:	db	00
L03BC:	db	'supply'
L03C2:	db	00
L03C3:	db	'"I keep a small stock of silver serpent venom from time to t'
	db	'ime which I sell to the apothecary in Britannia for a modest'
	db	' profit. The government is trying to control sales of it unt'
	db	'il they can determine how dangerous the effects are."'
L04AC:	db	00
L04AD:	db	'supply'
L04B3:	db	00
L04B4:	db	'effects'
L04BB:	db	00
L04BC:	db	'apothecary'
L04C6:	db	00
L04C7:	db	'apothecary'
L04D1:	db	00
L04D2:	db	'"His name is Kessler."'
L04E8:	db	00
L04E9:	db	'apothecary'
L04F3:	db	00
L04F4:	db	'Paws'
L04F8:	db	00
L04F9:	db	'"I do suppose my ventures are profitable enough for me to af'
	db	'ford to move to Britain, but things are so much less expensi'
	db	've here. Of course, the theft has me a bit wary.~~"If thou d'
	db	'ost wish to know more about the people here, speak to the co'
	db	'uple who run the Fellowship shelter, Feridwyn and Brita."'
L0622:	db	00
L0623:	db	'Paws'
L0627:	db	00
L0628:	db	'theft'
L062D:	db	00
L062E:	db	'slaughterhouse'
L063C:	db	00
L063D:	db	'"I take it thou hast noticed the smell. If so I do apologize'
	db	'." He shrugs his shoulders, grinning, and holds his palms up'
	db	'ward.~~"I think of it as the smell of success. Thou mayest p'
	db	'urchase some meat if thou so wishest."'
