L08AB:	db	00
L08AC:	db	'"Thou hast not the gold for this, '
L08CE:	db	00
L08CF:	db	'. Perhaps something else."'
L08E9:	db	00
L08EA:	db	'"Perhaps next time, '
L08FE:	db	00
L08FF:	db	'."'
L0901:	db	00
L0902:	db	'mutton'
L0908:	db	00
L0909:	db	'beef'
L090D:	db	00
L090E:	db	'"'Twill cost thee 2 gold each. Still interested?"'
L093F:	db	00
L0940:	db	'"How many dost thou want?"'
L095A:	db	00
L095B:	db	'"Here it is."'
L0968:	db	00
L0969:	db	'"Thou hast not the room for this meat."'
L0990:	db	00
L0991:	db	'"Thou hast not the gold for this, '
L09B3:	db	00
L09B4:	db	'. Perhaps something else."'
L09CE:	db	00
L09CF:	db	'"Perhaps next time, '
L09E3:	db	00
L09E4:	db	'."'
L09E6:	db	00
L09E7:	db	'beef'
L09EB:	db	00
L09EC:	db	'ham'
L09EF:	db	00
L09F0:	db	'"'Twill cost thee 4 gold each. Still interested?"'
L0A21:	db	00
L0A22:	db	'"How many dost thou want?"'
L0A3C:	db	00
L0A3D:	db	'"Here it is."'
L0A4A:	db	00
L0A4B:	db	'"Thou hast not the room for this meat."'
L0A72:	db	00
L0A73:	db	'"Thou hast not the gold for this, '
L0A95:	db	00
L0A96:	db	'. Perhaps something else."'
L0AB0:	db	00
L0AB1:	db	'"Perhaps next time, '
L0AC5:	db	00
L0AC6:	db	'."'
L0AC8:	db	00
L0AC9:	db	'ham'
L0ACC:	db	00
L0ACD:	db	'venom'
L0AD2:	db	00
L0AD3:	db	'"A terrible crime, causing me no small amount of monetary di'
	db	'stress. It has caused the surrounding community to worry abo'
	db	'ut their possessions as well."'
L0B69:	db	00
L0B6A:	db	'"I would be thine humble servant shouldst thou help investig'
	db	'ate the matter. Wilt thou?"'
L0BC1:	db	00
L0BC2:	db	'"Then I shall cooperate fully, '
L0BE1:	db	00
L0BE2:	db	'." He bows.'
L0BED:	db	00
L0BEE:	db	'"I do hope the culprit will be revealed through other method'
	db	's then."'
L0C32:	db	00
L0C33:	db	'"I thank thee for solving the mystery of who was behind it."'
L0C6F:	db	00
L0C70:	db	'venom'
L0C75:	db	00
L0C76:	db	'theft'
L0C7B:	db	00
L0C7C:	db	'"Thou art a stranger in Paws. Beware the thief who roams thi'
	db	's town! The culprit has stolen a quantity of my valuable sil'
	db	'ver serpent venom!"'
L0D07:	db	00
L0D08:	db	'theft'
L0D0D:	db	00
L0D0E:	db	'venom'
L0D13:	db	00
L0D14:	db	'apology'
L0D1B:	db	00
L0D1C:	db	'"I do apologize for my rudeness earlier, '
L0D45:	db	00
L0D46:	db	'. I have since realized that thou art an honest person. Plea'
	db	'se forgive mine insults." He bows, dripping insincerity.'
L0DBA:	db	00
L0DBB:	db	'apology'
L0DC2:	db	00
L0DC3:	db	'ledger'
L0DC9:	db	00
L0DCA:	db	'You tell Morfin that you have seen his ledger. "Wait, '
L0E00:	db	00
L0E01:	db	'! I admit I do sell Silver Serpent Venom to other places bes'
	db	'ides the Apothecary. But what I am doing is not -precisely- '
	db	'against the law!"'
L0E8A:	db	00
L0E8B:	db	'law'
L0E8E:	db	00
L0E8F:	db	'sell'
L0E93:	db	00
L0E94:	db	'ledger'
L0E9A:	db	00
L0E9B:	db	'sell'
L0E9F:	db	00
L0EA0:	db	'"My supply comes from some old friends in Buccaneer's Den. W'
	db	'here they get it, who can say?"'
L0EFB:	db	00
L0EFC:	db	'sell'
L0F00:	db	00
L0F01:	db	'law'
L0F04:	db	00
L0F05:	db	'"I have a notarized contract with the Britannian Mining Comp'
	db	'any. They use it to keep their gargoyles working longer hour'
	db	's. It seems gargoyles have a greater resistance to the effec'
	db	'ts of Silver Serpent Venom. Poor devils." He grins malicious'
	db	'ly at his own joke.'
L1008:	db	00
L1009:	db	'law'
L100C:	db	00
L100D:	db	'effects'
L1014:	db	00
L1015:	db	'effects'
L101C:	db	00
L101D:	db	'"They are widely known. Silver serpent venom is a reagent th'
	db	'at, when ingested in small doses, temporarily enhances one's'
	db	' physical strength, stamina and quickness along with bringin'
	db	'g a feeling of euphoria.~~"After the effects	wear off, the s'
	db	'ubject feels quite drained. This tends to make them want to '
	db	'take it again.~~"Prolonged use in such a fashion will bring '
	db	'about a condition that deteriorates the skin, eventually cau'
	db	'sing it to rot away.~~"Finally, too great a dose, or too gre'
	db	'at an accumulation of doses, is fatal, as the venom is a dea'
	db	'dly poison.~~"It may very well have some healing properties '
	db	'when used in other ways we have yet to discover, but any use'
	db	'r of the venom should not do so without caution."'
L12E2:	db	00
L12E3:	db	'effects'
L12EA:	db	00
L12EB:	db	'user'
L12EF:	db	00
L12F0:	db	'Tobias stole venom'
L1302:	db	00
L1303:	db	'user'
L1307:	db	00
L1308:	db	'"I am not so sure Tobias was the one who stole the venom. I '
	db	'have not seen any of the signs of venom use in Tobias and I '
	db	'am quite familiar with its symptoms. But, now that I think a'
	db	'bout it, I have noticed that Garritt has appeared very tired'
	db	' lately. He seems hyperactive one moment and unhealthy the n'
	db	'ext."'
L1439:	db	00
L143A:	db	'Garritt'
L1441:	db	00
L1442:	db	'Tobias stole venom'
L1454:	db	00
L1455:	db	'"I do not believe I have noticed anyone in town who is showi'
	db	'ng the symptoms of venom use. From now on I shall keep watch'
	db	', so thou shouldst ask again later."'
L14F1:	db	00
L14F2:	db	'user'
L14F6:	db	00
L14F7:	db	'Garritt'
L14FE:	db	00
L14FF:	db	'"Perhaps thou shouldst make a search of Garritt's belongings'
	db	'! Which reminds me-- I saw him earlier playing near the slau'
	db	'ghterhouse. He dropped this key. Perhaps it opens something.'
	db	'.. significant."'
L15C3:	db	00
L15C4:	db	'"Here it is."'
L15D1:	db	00
L15D2:	db	'"I shall give it to thee when thine hands are not so full."'
L160D:	db	00
L160E:	db	'Garritt'
L1615:	db	00
L1616:	db	'return venom'
L1622:	db	00
L1623:	db	'"I thank thee for ferreting out the thief and returning my s'
	db	'nake venom."'
L166B:	db	00
L166C:	db	'"So Garritt was the culprit, eh? I am not surprised now that'
	db	' I think about it. I must keep closer tabs on my venom from '
	db	'now on."'
L16EC:	db	00
L16ED:	db	'"Of course, I do wish for thee to return my venom to me if t'
	db	'hou hast recovered it."'
L1740:	db	00
L1741:	db	'return venom'
L174D:	db	00
L174E:	db	'bye'
L1751:	db	00
L1752:	db	'"Good day to thee."*'
