L0000:	db	'The gargoyle turns to you, frowning. He moves his massive ha'
	db	'nd to his mouth and use one finger to cross his lips. The Fe'
	db	'llowship meeting is in progress.*'
L0099:	db	00
L009A:	db	'The gargoyle, obviously in a hurry, ignores you.*'
L00CB:	db	00
L00CC:	db	'bye'
L00CF:	db	00
L00D0:	db	'Fellowship'
L00DA:	db	00
L00DB:	db	'job'
L00DE:	db	00
L00DF:	db	'name'
L00E3:	db	00
L00E4:	db	'The gargoyle gives you a menacing glare. Judging by his size'
	db	', he would make a formidable foe.'
L0141:	db	00
L0142:	db	'"To ask what you need?" says Runeb.'
L0165:	db	00
L0166:	db	'altar destruction'
L0177:	db	00
L0178:	db	'frame Quan'
L0182:	db	00
L0183:	db	'name'
L0187:	db	00
L0188:	db	'"To be Runeb."'
L0196:	db	00
L0197:	db	'Runeb'
L019C:	db	00
L019D:	db	'name'
L01A1:	db	00
L01A2:	db	'altar destruction'
L01B3:	db	00
L01B4:	db	'frame Quan'
L01BE:	db	00
L01BF:	db	'job'
L01C2:	db	00
L01C3:	db	'"To be Fellowship clerk."'
L01DC:	db	00
L01DD:	db	'Runeb'
L01E2:	db	00
L01E3:	db	'"To mean `busy one,'" he says sarcastically.'
L020F:	db	00
L0210:	db	'Runeb'
L0215:	db	00
L0216:	db	'Fellowship'
L0220:	db	00
L0221:	db	'"To have a branch here. To meet at usual time each night."'
L025B:	db	00
L025C:	db	'"To have more important things to do now. To ask me later, h'
	db	'uman."'
L029E:	db	00
L029F:	db	'Fellowship'
L02A9:	db	00
L02AA:	db	'frame Quan'
L02B4:	db	00
L02B5:	db	'altar destruction'
L02C6:	db	00
L02C7:	db	'"To be sorry you know that. To need now to kill Sarpling." H'
	db	'e grins at you.~~"To need now to kill you!"*'
L032F:	db	00
L0330:	db	'bye'
L0333:	db	00
L0334:	db	'He waits for you to leave before he returns to what he was d'
	db	'oing.*'
L0376:	db	00
