L0000:	db	'Avatar'
L0006:	db	00
L0007:	db	'bye'
L000A:	db	00
L000B:	db	'job'
L000E:	db	00
L000F:	db	'name'
L0013:	db	00
L0014:	db	'You see a man who, despite being blind, quickly acknowledges'
	db	' you.~~"I am Jordan. Sir Jordan. And thou art?"'
L007F:	db	00
L0080:	db	'"My pleasure, '
L008E:	db	00
L008F:	db	'." He shakes your hand.'
L00A6:	db	00
L00A7:	db	'He laughs. "Yes, but of course thou art."'
L00D0:	db	00
L00D1:	db	'"'Tis true, Sir Jordan. He is the Avatar."*'
L00FC:	db	00
L00FD:	db	'Jordan smiles. "I see. And who wouldst thou be? Shamino?"*'
L0137:	db	00
L0138:	db	'"No." He points to Shamino. "He is. I am Iolo!"*'
L0168:	db	00
L0169:	db	'"No. I am Iolo, not Shamino!"*'
L0187:	db	00
L0188:	db	'"Of course!" He says, patronizingly. "How could I not recogn'
	db	'ize the great Iolo."'
L01D8:	db	00
L01D9:	db	'"Greetings, '
L01E5:	db	00
L01E6:	db	'."'
L01E8:	db	00
L01E9:	db	'statue'
L01EF:	db	00
L01F0:	db	'bye'
L01F3:	db	00
L01F4:	db	'job'
L01F7:	db	00
L01F8:	db	'name'
L01FC:	db	00
L01FD:	db	'name'
L0201:	db	00
L0202:	db	'"As I told thee, my name is Sir Jordan."'
L022A:	db	00
L022B:	db	'name'
L022F:	db	00
L0230:	db	'job'
L0233:	db	00
L0234:	db	'"I sell bows and crossbows here at Iolo's South."'
L0265:	db	00
L0266:	db	'sell'
L026A:	db	00
L026B:	db	'Iolo's South'
L0277:	db	00
L0278:	db	'Iolo's South'
L0284:	db	00
L0285:	db	'"The original branch is in Britain. But I do fine business h'
	db	'ere in the Hold."'
L02D2:	db	00
L02D3:	db	'Iolo's South'
L02DF:	db	00
L02E0:	db	'Hold'
L02E4:	db	00
L02E5:	db	'original branch'
L02F4:	db	00
L02F5:	db	'Hold'
L02F9:	db	00
L02FA:	db	'"Serpent's Hold, '
L030B:	db	00
L030C:	db	'. I have sold many quality bows to the knights here."'
L0341:	db	00
L0342:	db	'Hold'
L0346:	db	00
L0347:	db	'knights'
L034E:	db	00
L034F:	db	'original branch'
L035E:	db	00
L035F:	db	'"The great archer himself, Iolo, started that branch more th'
	db	'an two hundred years ago."'
L03B5:	db	00
L03B6:	db	'*'
L03B7:	db	00
L03B8:	db	'"I, er, thank thee for thy compliment."*'
L03E0:	db	00
L03E1:	db	'"'Twould mean more wert thou Iolo!"*'
L0405:	db	00
L0406:	db	'"Listen, here, rogue, I truly -am-..."*'
L042D:	db	00
L042E:	db	'"Yes, yes, I know. Thou really -art- Iolo... And I am Lord B'
	db	'ritish!"*'
L0473:	db	00
L0474:	db	'original branch'
L0483:	db	00
L0484:	db	'knights'
L048B:	db	00
L048C:	db	'"There are many who live within the walls of the Hold. Sir D'
	db	'enton, the bartender at the Hallowed Dock, knows them all."'
L0503:	db	00
L0504:	db	'knights'
L050B:	db	00
L050C:	db	'sell'
L0510:	db	00
L0511:	db	'"Weapons or missiles?"'
L0527:	db	00
L0528:	db	'missiles'
L0530:	db	00
L0531:	db	'weapons'
L0538:	db	00
L0539:	db	'"I am sorry, '
L0546:	db	00
L0547:	db	', but I can only sell things during my shop hours -- from 6 '
	db	'in the morning 'til 6 at night."'
L05A3:	db	00
L05A4:	db	'sell'
L05A8:	db	00
L05A9:	db	'weapons'
L05B0:	db	00
L05B1:	db	'missiles'
L05B9:	db	00
L05BA:	db	'statue'
L05C0:	db	00
L05C1:	db	'He looks defensive. "I had nothing to do with that.~~ "But, '
	db	'I will tell thee that, on the night of the incident, I heard'
	db	' the sounds of scuffling in the commons. And, later on in th'
	db	'e evening, I heard a woman cry out, as if in surprise!"'
L06AC:	db	00
L06AD:	db	'woman'
L06B2:	db	00
L06B3:	db	'statue'
L06B9:	db	00
L06BA:	db	'woman'
L06BF:	db	00
L06C0:	db	'"I am not positive, '
L06D4:	db	00
L06D5:	db	', but I believe the voice was that of Lady Jehanne." He nods'
	db	' his head knowingly. "Someone has lost their sense of unity.'
	db	'"'
L074E:	db	00
L074F:	db	'woman'
L0754:	db	00
L0755:	db	'bye'
L0758:	db	00
L0759:	db	'"I hope to see thee again, '
L0774:	db	00
L0775:	db	'."*'
L0778:	db	00
