		.data
L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'A strong, powerful man looks at you and nods acknowledgment.'
L0049:	db	00
L004A:	db	'"What can I do for thee?" asks Zaksam.'
L0070:	db	00
L0071:	db	'name'
L0075:	db	00
L0076:	db	'"I am Zaksam," he states proudly.'
L0097:	db	00
L0098:	db	'name'
L009C:	db	00
L009D:	db	'job'
L00A0:	db	00
L00A1:	db	'"I teach others to be strong fighters. I am a trainer here i'
	db	'n Vesper."'
L00E7:	db	00
L00E8:	db	'train'
L00ED:	db	00
L00EE:	db	'Vesper'
L00F4:	db	00
L00F5:	db	'Vesper'
L00FB:	db	00
L00FC:	db	'"I have taught here for many years. I like the town, but I a'
	db	'm not too fond of some of the residents."'
L0161:	db	00
L0162:	db	'residents'
L016B:	db	00
L016C:	db	'town'
L0170:	db	00
L0171:	db	'Vesper'
L0177:	db	00
L0178:	db	'town'
L017C:	db	00
L017D:	db	'"The land to the northeast is a bit dry, but the oasis and n'
	db	'earby shores give us plenty of water for drinking and bathin'
	db	'g."'
L01F8:	db	00
L01F9:	db	'town'
L01FD:	db	00
L01FE:	db	'residents'
L0207:	db	00
L0208:	db	'"Most of us are respectable, but there are a few that I wond'
	db	'er about. Blorn and the mayor, for example.'
L026F:	db	00
L0270:	db	'Blorn'
L0275:	db	00
L0276:	db	'mayor'
L027B:	db	00
L027C:	db	'residents'
L0285:	db	00
L0286:	db	'mayor'
L028B:	db	00
L028C:	db	'"'Tis not that I do not trust him. I just wonder about his a'
	db	'bility to run the town. His name is Auston. Talk to him and '
	db	'see for thyself what thou thinkest. Better yet, talk to his '
	db	'clerk, Liana."'
L034E:	db	00
L034F:	db	'mayor'
L0354:	db	00
L0355:	db	'Blorn'
L035A:	db	00
L035B:	db	'"That one I do not like a bit. I do not trust him. He remind'
	db	's me of those gargoyles."'
L03B0:	db	00
L03B1:	db	'gargoyles'
L03BA:	db	00
L03BB:	db	'Blorn'
L03C0:	db	00
L03C1:	db	'gargoyles'
L03CA:	db	00
L03CB:	db	'"What is there to say, but do not let them get too close or '
	db	'they will rob thee. Any day now they may try to use violence'
	db	' to take over the town. The mayor himself has asked that I f'
	db	'ight if necessary. Though I have no fear of death, that is a'
	db	' battle I do not look forward to."'
L04DD:	db	00
L04DE:	db	'gargoyles'
L04E7:	db	00
L04E8:	db	'violence'
L04F0:	db	00
L04F1:	db	'rob'
L04F4:	db	00
L04F5:	db	'rob'
L04F8:	db	00
L04F9:	db	'"I have already heard that some of my fellow residents have '
	db	'had things stolen by those wretched creatures."'
L0564:	db	00
L0565:	db	'rob'
L0568:	db	00
L0569:	db	'violence'
L0571:	db	00
L0572:	db	'"As thou must surely know, all gargoyles are prone to sensel'
	db	'ess fits of violence. 'Twould be quite natural to expect the'
	db	'm to use it for their own selfish gain."'
L0612:	db	00
L0613:	db	'violence'
L061B:	db	00
L061C:	db	'train'
L0621:	db	00
L0622:	db	'"I can train thee for 40 gold. Is this all right?"'
L0654:	db	00
L0655:	db	'"Perhaps next time, '
L0669:	db	00
L066A:	db	'."'
L066C:	db	00
L066D:	db	'"I can train thee when I am at my training hall, '
L069E:	db	00
L069F:	db	'. Please feel free to see me when it is open."'
L06CD:	db	00
L06CE:	db	'bye'
L06D1:	db	00
L06D2:	db	'"May thy strength be thy guide."*'
L06F3:	db	00
L06F4:	db	'@Zzzzz . . .@'
L0701:	db	00
L0702:	db	'@Increase thy skill here!@'
L071C:	db	00
L071D:	db	'@Increase thy strength here!@'
L073A:	db	00
L073B:	db	'@Fight better, be stronger!@'
L0757:	db	00
L0758:	db	'@Defend thyself against gargoyles!@'
L077B:	db	00
L077C:	db	'@Mmmmm, excellent wine!@'
