		.funcnumber	04D2H
		.data
L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a short woman with a distracted look on her face.'
L0046:	db	00
L0047:	db	'"What is thy concern?"'
L005D:	db	00
L005E:	db	'name'
L0062:	db	00
L0063:	db	'Breaking from her work, the woman turns to look at you long '
	db	'enough to respond, "My name is Liana."'
L00C5:	db	00
L00C6:	db	'name'
L00CA:	db	00
L00CB:	db	'job'
L00CE:	db	00
L00CF:	db	'"I am the Mayor's clerk. I am responsible for keeping track '
	db	'of official records and documents in Vesper."'
L0138:	db	00
L0139:	db	'mayor'
L013E:	db	00
L013F:	db	'Vesper'
L0145:	db	00
L0146:	db	'Vesper'
L014C:	db	00
L014D:	db	'"I like the town, but 'tis so far from Britain that it attra'
	db	'cts some truly... unusual people."'
L01AB:	db	00
L01AC:	db	'unusual'
L01B3:	db	00
L01B4:	db	'people'
L01BA:	db	00
L01BB:	db	'Vesper'
L01C1:	db	00
L01C2:	db	'mayor'
L01C7:	db	00
L01C8:	db	'"I respect Auston in an unofficial capacity. But," she adds,'
	db	' raising her eyebrows, "as a mayor, he is far too spineless.'
	db	' He is afraid of taking sides on any issue. I do not think h'
	db	'e should have volunteered for the election."'
L02A8:	db	00
L02A9:	db	'mayor'
L02AE:	db	00
L02AF:	db	'unusual'
L02B6:	db	00
L02B7:	db	'"Well, there are a couple of strange ones: Mara and Yongi. A'
	db	'nd there is Blorn -- he is a mean one, and... well... of cou'
	db	'rse, there is Eldroth. And," she says with a shudder, "the g'
	db	'argoyles."'
L0375:	db	00
L0376:	db	'gargoyles'
L037F:	db	00
L0380:	db	'Eldroth'
L0387:	db	00
L0388:	db	'Blorn'
L038D:	db	00
L038E:	db	'Yongi'
L0393:	db	00
L0394:	db	'Mara'
L0398:	db	00
L0399:	db	'unusual'
L03A0:	db	00
L03A1:	db	'Mara'
L03A5:	db	00
L03A6:	db	'"I feel bad about the things I said now that she is gone. To'
	db	'o bad she was killed in that bar fight."'
L040A:	db	00
L040B:	db	'"Mara? She needs to learn how to act like a woman. Her manly'
	db	' attitude doth not fool anyone."'
L0467:	db	00
L0468:	db	'Mara'
L046C:	db	00
L046D:	db	'Yongi'
L0472:	db	00
L0473:	db	'"Yongi is nothing more than a drunk. The only reason he open'
	db	'ed a tavern was to have an excuse to purchase large amounts '
	db	'of alcohol at wholesale prices. And do not	ask him about the'
	db	' gargoyles unless thou dost want him to talk thine ear off. '
	db	'He hates them almost as much as Blorn does!"'
L058F:	db	00
L0590:	db	'Yongi'
L0595:	db	00
L0596:	db	'Eldroth'
L059D:	db	00
L059E:	db	'"He is nice, I suppose, but he is also a doddering old fool.'
	db	' I do not think he hath had a brain for more than a decade."'
L0616:	db	00
L0617:	db	'Eldroth'
L061E:	db	00
L061F:	db	'Blorn'
L0624:	db	00
L0625:	db	'"There is a troublemaker and thief if I have ever seen one. '
	db	'He needs to think about leaving town -- quickly, if he knows'
	db	' what is best for him. There is one thing I like about him, '
	db	'though -- he hates the gargoyles more than anyone!"'
L070C:	db	00
L070D:	db	'gargoyles'
L0716:	db	00
L0717:	db	'Blorn'
L071C:	db	00
L071D:	db	'gargoyles'
L0726:	db	00
L0727:	db	'"Now there is a disgusting creature for thee. I think they w'
	db	'ere better named back when we called them daemons!"'
L0796:	db	00
L0797:	db	'"In fact..." She hands you a piece of paper.'
L07C3:	db	00
L07C4:	db	'gargoyles'
L07CD:	db	00
L07CE:	db	'people'
L07D4:	db	00
L07D5:	db	'"Well, there are Cador, Yvella, and Zaksam -- those are the	'
	db	'normal ones."'
L081E:	db	00
L081F:	db	'Zaksam'
L0825:	db	00
L0826:	db	'Yvella'
L082C:	db	00
L082D:	db	'Cador'
L0832:	db	00
L0833:	db	'people'
L0839:	db	00
L083A:	db	'Zaksam'
L0840:	db	00
L0841:	db	'"He is the trainer. Quite a good fighter from what I hear."'
L087C:	db	00
L087D:	db	'Zaksam'
L0883:	db	00
L0884:	db	'Cador'
L0889:	db	00
L088A:	db	'"'Tis too bad he is dead. I have heard many compliment his a'
	db	'bilities as a leader at the mines."'
L08E9:	db	00
L08EA:	db	'dead'
L08EE:	db	00
L08EF:	db	'"Cador is the head of the Britannian Mining Company branch h'
	db	'ere in Vesper."'
L093A:	db	00
L093B:	db	'Cador'
L0940:	db	00
L0941:	db	'dead'
L0945:	db	00
L0946:	db	'"He was killed in a brutal slaughter in Yongi's tavern. No o'
	db	'ne really knows what happened, but I suppose that is how man'
	db	'y people meet their death when drinking." She shrugs.'
L09F3:	db	00
L09F4:	db	'dead'
L09F8:	db	00
L09F9:	db	'Yvella'
L09FF:	db	00
L0A00:	db	'"She is Cador's wife."'
L0A16:	db	00
L0A17:	db	'Yvella'
L0A1D:	db	00
L0A1E:	db	'bye'
L0A21:	db	00
L0A22:	db	'She nods at you as she returns to her business.*'
L0A52:	db	00
