L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'girl'
L0011:	db	00
L0012:	db	'You see a very large, strong wingless gargoyle.'
L0041:	db	00
L0042:	db	'"To wish you good day, human," says For-Lem.'
L006E:	db	00
L006F:	db	'name'
L0073:	db	00
L0074:	db	'"To answer to For-Lem."'
L008B:	db	00
L008C:	db	'name'
L0090:	db	00
L0091:	db	'For-Lem'
L0098:	db	00
L0099:	db	'For-Lem'
L00A0:	db	00
L00A1:	db	'"To mean `strong one.'"'
L00B8:	db	00
L00B9:	db	'For-Lem'
L00C0:	db	00
L00C1:	db	'job'
L00C4:	db	00
L00C5:	db	'"To do odd jobs for others. Also, to record gargoyle legends'
	db	' in written form."'
L0113:	db	00
L0114:	db	'legends'
L011B:	db	00
L011C:	db	'others'
L0122:	db	00
L0123:	db	'others'
L0129:	db	00
L012A:	db	'"To be friends with Lap-Lem, and know he is a good miner. Al'
	db	'so to know Ansikart, who reminds us of Singularity in these '
	db	'troubled times."'
L01B2:	db	00
L01B3:	db	'troubled times'
L01C1:	db	00
L01C2:	db	'others'
L01C8:	db	00
L01C9:	db	'troubled times'
L01D7:	db	00
L01D8:	db	'"To be angry with the humans. To be treated poorly and with '
	db	'contempt. To know not why," he shrugs.'
L023A:	db	00
L023B:	db	'troubled times'
L0249:	db	00
L024A:	db	'legends'
L0251:	db	00
L0252:	db	'"To have many interesting stories about our race. To be writ'
	db	'ing them down for future generations."'
L02B4:	db	00
L02B5:	db	'legends'
L02BC:	db	00
L02BD:	db	'generations'
L02C8:	db	00
L02C9:	db	'stories'
L02D0:	db	00
L02D1:	db	'stories'
L02D8:	db	00
L02D9:	db	'"To have had many exciting myths from before the Avatar's en'
	db	'counters with our race. To share the concept of a hero with '
	db	'the humans, but to have had different heroes from our own hi'
	db	'story."'
L0394:	db	00
L0395:	db	'stories'
L039C:	db	00
L039D:	db	'generations'
L03A8:	db	00
L03A9:	db	'"To be afraid for the future of gargoyle youths. To tell you'
	db	' they know little about their heritage. To feel it important'
	db	' to educate them and the offspring who follow them in our wa'
	db	'ys and history."'
L046D:	db	00
L046E:	db	'generations'
L0479:	db	00
L047A:	db	'girl'
L047E:	db	00
L047F:	db	'A look of concern quickly appears on his face.~~ "To talk ab'
	db	'out the human girl, Catherine? To mean no harm to her." He h'
	db	'olds out his hands.~~ "To read gargoyle mythology to her dur'
	db	'ing the day only. To have been asked by her!" His eyes widen'
	db	'.~~ "To ask you not to tell her parents, for they will punis'
	db	'h her." He looks hopeful. "To tell not, agreed?"'
L05DB:	db	00
L05DC:	db	'"To be making the right decision." He appears relieved. "To '
	db	'thank you, human." He smiles.'
L0635:	db	00
L0636:	db	'"To be making a mistake." He appears disappointed. "To have '
	db	'the girl punished now because of me." He shakes his head.~~"'
	db	'To feel responsible. To be very sad."'
L06D3:	db	00
L06D4:	db	'girl'
L06D8:	db	00
L06D9:	db	'bye'
L06DC:	db	00
L06DD:	db	'"To tell you goodbye, human."*'
L06FB:	db	00
