L0000:	db	'the Avatar'
L000A:	db	00
L000B:	db	'The gargoyle's anger is so great that he resists the spell.*'
L0047:	db	00
L0048:	db	'bye'
L004B:	db	00
L004C:	db	'job'
L004F:	db	00
L0050:	db	'name'
L0054:	db	00
L0055:	db	'The gargoyle is obviously displeased with the intrusion of y'
	db	'our presence.'
L009E:	db	00
L009F:	db	'name'
L00A3:	db	00
L00A4:	db	'"To have no desire to tell you. To demand to know who you ar'
	db	'e!"'
L00E3:	db	00
L00E4:	db	'name'
L00E8:	db	00
L00E9:	db	'human'
L00EE:	db	00
L00EF:	db	'humans'
L00F5:	db	00
L00F6:	db	'The gargoyle growls as he turns to look at you. He stands, '
L0131:	db	00
L0132:	db	'setting a hand on the shoulder of the gargoyle next to him.*'
L016E:	db	00
L016F:	db	'The other gargoyle also stands. Anger flashes across his fac'
	db	'e as he points a finger at you.~~ "To be the cause for our u'
	db	'nhappiness, '
L01F3:	db	00
L01F4:	db	'!"*'
L01F7:	db	00
L01F8:	db	'"To be the reason for our poverty. To die, '
L0223:	db	00
L0224:	db	', to die!"*'
L022F:	db	00
L0230:	db	'"To tell you to go away!"*'
L024A:	db	00
L024B:	db	'job'
L024E:	db	00
L024F:	db	'"To have none!" He glares fiercly at you."'
L0279:	db	00
L027A:	db	'job'
L027D:	db	00
L027E:	db	'bye'
L0281:	db	00
L0282:	db	'He grunts his dismissal.*'
L029B:	db	00
L029C:	db	'The gargoyle stops only long enough to give you a menacing s'
	db	'tare.*'
L02DE:	db	00
