L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'The gargoyle standing before you has a sour expression on hi'
	db	's face.'
L0050:	db	00
L0051:	db	'"To offer you greetings, human," says Aurvidlem.'
L0081:	db	00
L0082:	db	'name'
L0086:	db	00
L0087:	db	'"To be called Aurvidlem. To recognize you to be the Avatar."'
L00C3:	db	00
L00C4:	db	'name'
L00C8:	db	00
L00C9:	db	'job'
L00CC:	db	00
L00CD:	db	'"To provide provisions for others in Vesper."'
L00FA:	db	00
L00FB:	db	'Vesper'
L0101:	db	00
L0102:	db	'others'
L0108:	db	00
L0109:	db	'buy provisions'
L0117:	db	00
L0118:	db	'Vesper'
L011E:	db	00
L011F:	db	'"To be a town filled with prejudice and hatred. To know the '
	db	'humans expect us to begin a violent confrontation.~~"To beli'
	db	'eve the humans deserve it," he shrugs, "but to hope my breth'
	db	'ren display more control than that."'
L01F7:	db	00
L01F8:	db	'Vesper'
L01FE:	db	00
L01FF:	db	'buy provisions'
L020D:	db	00
L020E:	db	'"To be not selling at this time. To come back tomorrow to bu'
	db	'y provisions."'
L0258:	db	00
L0259:	db	'buy provisions'
L0267:	db	00
L0268:	db	'others'
L026E:	db	00
L026F:	db	'"To have only a few gargoyles living in town. To know mainly'
	db	' Wis-Sur, and," he gives a slight grunt, "Ansikart. Also to '
	db	'know of some wingless ones."'
L0303:	db	00
L0304:	db	'Ansikart'
L030C:	db	00
L030D:	db	'"To have only a few gargoyles living in town. To know mainly'
	db	' Wis-Sur and Ansikart, and to know of some wingless ones."'
L0383:	db	00
L0384:	db	'others'
L038A:	db	00
L038B:	db	'Ansikart'
L0393:	db	00
L0394:	db	'His eyes shift quickly from left to right before finally set'
	db	'tling on you.~~"To know since change in Wis-Sur, Ansikart ga'
	db	'ined too much respect. To be sure that I have studied more a'
	db	'nd would be a wiser and better leader here. To be dissatisfi'
	db	'ed with Ansikart as choice."'
L04A0:	db	00
L04A1:	db	'change'
L04A7:	db	00
L04A8:	db	'Ansikart'
L04B0:	db	00
L04B1:	db	'change'
L04B7:	db	00
L04B8:	db	'"To be unsure when change happened, but has affected Wis-Sur'
	db	' greatly. To now see him avoid others and shut himself away.'
	db	' To be concerned for Wis-Sur."'
L054E:	db	00
L054F:	db	'change'
L0555:	db	00
L0556:	db	'bye'
L0559:	db	00
L055A:	db	'"To bid you goodbye."*'
L0570:	db	00
