		.data
L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'Fellowship'
L000E:	db	00
L000F:	db	'job'
L0012:	db	00
L0013:	db	'name'
L0017:	db	00
L0018:	db	'"'Twas very kind of thee to release me from my cell. I shall'
	db	' now return to my former life. Good day!"*'
L007E:	db	00
L007F:	db	'The man in the prison greets you with a rather large smile.'
L00BA:	db	00
L00BB:	db	'"Why, hello, '
L00C8:	db	00
L00C9:	db	'. In what way could I help thee this fine day?"'
L00F8:	db	00
L00F9:	db	'name'
L00FD:	db	00
L00FE:	db	'"I am Sullivan, '
L010E:	db	00
L010F:	db	'," he says pleasantly. "Who wouldst thou be?"*'
L013D:	db	00
L013E:	db	'the Avatar'
L0148:	db	00
L0149:	db	'"Pleased to meet thee, '
L0160:	db	00
L0161:	db	'." He moves his hand to shake yours but is prevented by the '
	db	'bars.~~"Ah, well, sorry, '
L01B6:	db	00
L01B7:	db	'. Consider thyself well shaken."'
L01D7:	db	00
L01D8:	db	'"Of course, '
L01E4:	db	00
L01E5:	db	'. I understand." He smiles.'
L0200:	db	00
L0201:	db	'"Oh, I see. Oops..." He shrugs.'
L0220:	db	00
L0221:	db	'Oops'
L0225:	db	00
L0226:	db	'job'
L0229:	db	00
L022A:	db	'"Well, in all honesty, '
L0241:	db	00
L0242:	db	', I have no job. Although, for a time, I was a thieving scou'
	db	'ndrel."'
L0285:	db	00
L0286:	db	'scoundrel'
L028F:	db	00
L0290:	db	'Fellowship'
L029A:	db	00
L029B:	db	'"'Tis truly a fantastic group of people, '
L02C4:	db	00
L02C5:	db	'. We spread guidance and prosperity to the people who reside'
	db	' in our fair land. Of course, at the moment, my fellow membe'
	db	'rs are a bit... displeased with me."'
L0361:	db	00
L0362:	db	'*'
L0363:	db	00
L0364:	db	'"That's a bit of an understatement!"*'
L0389:	db	00
L038A:	db	'Fellowship'
L0394:	db	00
L0395:	db	'displeased'
L039F:	db	00
L03A0:	db	'prosperity'
L03AA:	db	00
L03AB:	db	'guidance'
L03B3:	db	00
L03B4:	db	'guidance'
L03BC:	db	00
L03BD:	db	'"The Fellowship teaches people to follow their leaders like '
	db	'sheep. Canst thou think of better guidance?"'
L0425:	db	00
L0426:	db	'guidance'
L042E:	db	00
L042F:	db	'prosperity'
L0439:	db	00
L043A:	db	'"When a member behaves properly and follows directions and s'
	db	'o forth, he -- or she -- can hear the `inner voice' that tea'
	db	'ches one how to win at the games. 'Tis the very reason I joi'
	db	'ned!" he grins broadly.~~"However, I have yet to hear the vo'
	db	'ice."'
L052F:	db	00
L0530:	db	'prosperity'
L053A:	db	00
L053B:	db	'displeased'
L0545:	db	00
L0546:	db	'"Well, apparently I hadn't striven hard enough to be deservi'
	db	'ng of the loan I... acquired from the money box upstairs."'
L05BC:	db	00
L05BD:	db	'displeased'
L05C7:	db	00
L05C8:	db	'loan'
L05CC:	db	00
L05CD:	db	'deserving'
L05D6:	db	00
L05D7:	db	'deserving'
L05E0:	db	00
L05E1:	db	'As best he can, he leans toward you. For perhaps the first t'
	db	'ime in his entire life, he turns somber. "Actually, deserve '
	db	'is a relative term. I have finally realized -- being on the '
	db	'racks for many hours during the day leaves time for quite a '
	db	'number of realizations -- the true nature of The Fellowship.'
	db	' Batlin and Abraham and Danag, they all are in error.~~When '
	db	'the Guardian makes his appearance here in Britannia, I have '
	db	'no doubt he will simply eliminate everyone, including The Fe'
	db	'llowship leaders." His smile returns.~~"That is why I decide'
	db	'd to get everything out of The Fellowship and Britannia now,'
	db	' before we are all killed."'
L0854:	db	00
L0855:	db	'deserving'
L085E:	db	00
L085F:	db	'racks'
L0864:	db	00
L0865:	db	'loan'
L0869:	db	00
L086A:	db	'"Well... I was going to return the money eventually. I just '
	db	'needed it to win more in the games."'
L08CA:	db	00
L08CB:	db	'loan'
L08CF:	db	00
L08D0:	db	'Oops'
L08D4:	db	00
L08D5:	db	'"What the fool means is that he used to don a costume and pr'
	db	'etend to be thee in an attempt to woo goods from the proprie'
	db	'tors."*'
L0954:	db	00
L0955:	db	'"Quite true, Avatar. The ruse worked far too well. 'Twas a t'
	db	'rue shame, to be honest. I should not have gotten away with '
	db	'it, and, indeed, am being properly castigated for it now."'
L0A07:	db	00
L0A08:	db	'"Oh, just that I have been impersonating thee for some time '
	db	'now to take items from shopkeepers without paying for them. '
	db	'Well, -had- been actually. Now I am being properly castigate'
	db	'd for it."'
L0AC6:	db	00
L0AC7:	db	'*'
L0AC8:	db	00
L0AC9:	db	'"I thank thee."*'
L0AD9:	db	00
L0ADA:	db	'"Thou art welcome." He nods.*'
L0AF7:	db	00
L0AF8:	db	'Oops'
L0AFC:	db	00
L0AFD:	db	'scoundrel'
L0B06:	db	00
L0B07:	db	'"Well, until I was caught, I would go from shop to shop all '
	db	'across Britannia, posing as `the Avatar.' The owners were al'
	db	'l too happy to supply me with numerous gifts. Thou truly has'
	db	't a good life, '
L0BCA:	db	00
L0BCB:	db	'."'
L0BCD:	db	00
L0BCE:	db	'*'
L0BCF:	db	00
L0BD0:	db	'"Ask him about his taxes, '
L0BEA:	db	00
L0BEB:	db	'."*'
L0BEE:	db	00
L0BEF:	db	'taxes'
L0BF4:	db	00
L0BF5:	db	'gifts'
L0BFA:	db	00
L0BFB:	db	'scoundrel'
L0C04:	db	00
L0C05:	db	'gifts'
L0C0A:	db	00
L0C0B:	db	'"Oh, just anything I asked for -- weapons, armour, provision'
	db	's, spells. Of course, I had no real use for the spells, but '
	db	'it was nice to acquire them for free, regardless."'
L0CB5:	db	00
L0CB6:	db	'gifts'
L0CBB:	db	00
L0CBC:	db	'taxes'
L0CC1:	db	00
L0CC2:	db	'He smiles.~~"The Britannian Tax Council created a tax to rai'
	db	'se money for the government. I did not feel like paying them'
	db	'," he shrugs, "so I didn't. And, of course," he says, grinni'
	db	'ng, "now they often put me on that fine rack."~~He stretches'
	db	' his neck and peers at the wooden slab.~~"Very fine workmans'
	db	'hip." He nods. "Indeed, that is by far the best rack I have '
	db	'ever seen!"'
L0E35:	db	00
L0E36:	db	'taxes'
L0E3B:	db	00
L0E3C:	db	'racks'
L0E41:	db	00
L0E42:	db	'racks'
L0E47:	db	00
L0E48:	db	'"Is not that the finest rack thou hast ever seen? Exquisite '
	db	'workmanship, beautiful detail."'
L0EA3:	db	00
L0EA4:	db	'racks'
L0EA9:	db	00
L0EAA:	db	'bye'
L0EAD:	db	00
L0EAE:	db	'"Pleasant days, '
L0EBE:	db	00
L0EBF:	db	'. See thee soon on the surface world!"*'
L0EE6:	db	00
