L0918:	db	'massage'
L091F:	db	00
L0920:	db	'Roberto helps you with your clothing and leads you to a comf'
	db	'ortable table. You lie face down and the man expertly kneads'
	db	' and rubs your aching muscles, slowly sending you over the e'
	db	'dge into a state of total relaxation. After a while, Roberto'
	db	' helps you up and you dress.'
L0A2C:	db	00
L0A2D:	db	'massage'
L0A34:	db	00
L0A35:	db	'talk'
L0A39:	db	00
L0A3A:	db	'Roberto smiles. "That is all right. What shall we talk about'
	db	'? Adventuring? Secret passages and dungeons?"~~ Roberto lean'
	db	's closer and whispers, "Didst thou know that there are secre'
	db	't passages connecting the buildings on Buccaneer's Den? 'Tis'
	db	' true! I am fairly sure the entrance is through the House of'
	db	' Games, and I am quite sure there is a way into The Baths."~'
	db	'~You and Roberto speak of a number of other subjects until y'
	db	'ou realize that you are spending far too much time in the sp'
	db	'a. There is a quest to fulfill!'
L0C39:	db	00
L0C3A:	db	'talk'
L0C3E:	db	00
L0C3F:	db	'bye'
L0C42:	db	00
L0C43:	db	'"I hope to see thee again, '
