L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a man whose sinewy body is like steel. The glint in '
	db	'his eye tells you that he is no fool.'
L006E:	db	00
L006F:	db	'"What dost thou want with Lucky?" the pirate asks.'
L00A1:	db	00
L00A2:	db	'name'
L00A6:	db	00
L00A7:	db	'"I am Lucky... in all things."'
L00C5:	db	00
L00C6:	db	'name'
L00CA:	db	00
L00CB:	db	'job'
L00CE:	db	00
L00CF:	db	'"I make my living off the world! It gives... and I take!" Th'
	db	'e pirate laughs boisterously. "I am a worldly gentleman, fri'
	db	'ends -- that is my 'job'! Oh, and I train initiates for a bi'
	db	't of pocket change."'
L0197:	db	00
L0198:	db	'train'
L019D:	db	00
L019E:	db	'world'
L01A3:	db	00
L01A4:	db	'world'
L01A9:	db	00
L01AA:	db	'"The ways of the world, is what I mean. I am a man of the ro'
	db	'ad; I am a seasoned traveller. I travel through the world as'
	db	' a hundred different men."'
L023C:	db	00
L023D:	db	'different'
L0246:	db	00
L0247:	db	'traveller'
L0250:	db	00
L0251:	db	'world'
L0256:	db	00
L0257:	db	'traveller'
L0260:	db	00
L0261:	db	'"In truth there are few places where I have not been and lit'
	db	'tle that I have not done."'
L02B7:	db	00
L02B8:	db	'traveller'
L02C1:	db	00
L02C2:	db	'different'
L02CB:	db	00
L02CC:	db	'"Thou canst be a different person just by assumption. 'Tis a'
	db	'n attitude. I am an expert in the art of charismatic communi'
	db	'cation for the purposes of deception. It gives one many skil'
	db	'ls. For example, I can walk into any shop and make a purchas'
	db	'e. But I will walk away with much more than I bought, for I '
	db	'know how to fool the shopkeeper. Little things like that."'
L0432:	db	00
L0433:	db	'different'
L043C:	db	00
L043D:	db	'train'
L0442:	db	00
L0443:	db	'"I charge 35 gold for a training session. Doth this meet wit'
	db	'h thine approval?"'
L0491:	db	00
L0492:	db	'Lucky shrugs. "Thou wilt not find another trainer on the isl'
	db	'and!"'
L04D3:	db	00
L04D4:	db	'train'
L04D9:	db	00
L04DA:	db	'"I shall be happy to show thee my ways of the world during n'
	db	'ormal business hours at my residence -- afternoons and eveni'
	db	'ngs."'
L0557:	db	00
L0558:	db	'train'
L055D:	db	00
L055E:	db	'bye'
L0561:	db	00
L0562:	db	'"Be careful, my friend."*'
