L0000:	db	'bye'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
L0007:	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'Crown Jewel'
L0018:	db	00
L0019:	db	'You see a fat, cheerful-looking merchant.'
L0042:	db	00
L0043:	db	'"Hello, hello my friend! Thou dost look like thou needest to'
	db	' spend money!"*'
L008E:	db	00
L008F:	db	'"This place looks quite well-off."*'
L00B2:	db	00
L00B3:	db	'"The entire island is very opulent. It is not the same islan'
	db	'd we once knew."*'
L0100:	db	00
L0101:	db	'"Hello! How art thou, my friend?"'
L0122:	db	00
L0123:	db	'"How may I help thee?" Budo asks.'
L0144:	db	00
L0145:	db	'name'
L0149:	db	00
L014A:	db	'"Budo the Fourth at thy service! 'Tis a fine day today, is i'
	db	't not?"'
L018D:	db	00
L018E:	db	'name'
L0192:	db	00
L0193:	db	'job'
L0196:	db	00
L0197:	db	'thou hast come to the right place!@'
L01BA:	db	00
L01BB:	db	00
L01BC:	db	00
L01BD:	db	'ship deed'
L01C6:	db	00
L01C7:	db	'provisions'
L01D1:	db	00
L01D2:	db	'armour'
L01D8:	db	00
L01D9:	db	'weapons'
L01E0:	db	00
L01E1:	db	'thou shouldst come to my shoppe when '
L0206:	db	00
L0207:	db	'it is open! I would be so pleased to '
L022C:	db	00
L022D:	db	'help thee then.@'
L023D:	db	00
L023E:	db	'"I am a provisioner, like my father before me, and like his '
	db	'father before him, and like his father before him. Budo's is'
	db	' an island tradition! Just as The Fellowship will be someday'
	db	'!~~"If thou art interested in weapons, armour, provisions, o'
	db	'r a ship deed, '
L033D:	db	00
L033E:	db	00
L033F:	db	00
L0340:	db	00
L0341:	db	'Fellowship'
L034B:	db	00
L034C:	db	'armour'
L0352:	db	00
L0353:	db	'"Budo's carries nothing but the finest quality armour in all'
	db	' Britannia. I have all the best types of equipment available'
	db	'."'
L03CD:	db	00
L03CE:	db	'weapons'
L03D5:	db	00
L03D6:	db	'"Budo's offers thee excellent weaponry with superb craftsman'
	db	'ship. Thou wilt not find a better buy for thy money anywhere'
	db	' else!"'
L0455:	db	00
L0456:	db	'provisions'
L0460:	db	00
L0461:	db	'"Budo's also carries a variety of useful things for thy conv'
	db	'enience."'
L04A6:	db	00
L04A7:	db	'ship deed'
L04B0:	db	00
L04B1:	db	'"But I have already sold thee the deed to 'The Lusty Wench'!'
	db	' She was the only ship I had at this particular time! I am s'
	db	'orry!"'
L052F:	db	00
L0530:	db	'"I can sell thee the deed to my ship 'The Lusty Wench.' She '
	db	'is beautiful, my friend. She is guaranteed to last and is th'
	db	'e sleekest vessel on the seas! She goes for 800 gold. Want h'
	db	'er?"'
L05E8:	db	00
L05E9:	db	'"A wise move. A magnificent ship for thee!" He takes your go'
	db	'ld.'
L0628:	db	00
L0629:	db	'"Thou art carrying too much, my friend! Unload thyself of so'
	db	'me of thy belongings and I will sell thee the deed to this b'
	db	'eautiful ship."'
L06B0:	db	00
L06B1:	db	'"But thou dost not have enough gold! Perhaps thou shouldst v'
	db	'isit the House of Games and increase the bulges in thy pocke'
	db	'ts!"'
L072D:	db	00
L072E:	db	'"But thou wilt never see a ship like this one anywhere in th'
	db	'e world! Too bad!"'
L077C:	db	00
L077D:	db	'ship deed'
L0786:	db	00
L0787:	db	'Fellowship'
L0791:	db	00
L0792:	db	'"The Fellowship has helped me to become a very rich man! Alt'
	db	'hough the business is an inherited enterprise, I owe everyth'
	db	'ing to The Fellowship!"'
L0821:	db	00
L0822:	db	'Fellowship'
L082C:	db	00
L082D:	db	'everything'
L0837:	db	00
L0838:	db	'inherited'
L0841:	db	00
L0842:	db	'rich man'
L084A:	db	00
L084B:	db	'rich man'
L0853:	db	00
L0854:	db	'"My great-grandfather started this business many, many years'
	db	' ago. He was moderately successful, thanks to the Thieves' G'
	db	'uild. But that era has passed."'
L08EB:	db	00
L08EC:	db	'Thieves' Guild'
L08FA:	db	00
L08FB:	db	'rich man'
L0903:	db	00
L0904:	db	'inherited'
L090D:	db	00
L090E:	db	'"My great-grandfather passed the shoppe on to his son, and s'
	db	'o forth, down to me. We are born merchants! That is why I kn'
	db	'ow why thou hast come to Budo's! Thou wantest to become a pa'
	db	'rt of the great Budo Legacy! Thou dost need to buy something'
	db	'!"'
L0A00:	db	00
L0A01:	db	'inherited'
L0A0A:	db	00
L0A0B:	db	'everything'
L0A15:	db	00
L0A16:	db	'"There was a period shortly after my father died, just as I '
	db	'had inherited the shoppe, when business was poor. There was '
	db	'a danger that I would not be able to keep the shoppe open. B'
	db	'ut The Fellowship convinced me that I should join them. I pr'
	db	'oved my worthiness and The Fellowship helped me financially.'
	db	'"'
L0B43:	db	00
L0B44:	db	'everything'
L0B4E:	db	00
L0B4F:	db	'worthiness'
L0B59:	db	00
L0B5A:	db	'worthiness'
L0B64:	db	00
L0B65:	db	'"I do not mind telling thee. The Fellowship shares in one ha'
	db	'lf of my profit."'
L0BB2:	db	00
L0BB3:	db	'worthiness'
L0BBD:	db	00
L0BBE:	db	'Thieves' Guild'
L0BCC:	db	00
L0BCD:	db	'"It is no more. They dwindled away during my grandfather's t'
	db	'ime. By the time The Fellowship arrived, when I was a boy, t'
	db	'here was no trace of them except in family mementos. Even th'
	db	'e pirates are different."'
L0C9A:	db	00
L0C9B:	db	'Thieves' Guild'
L0CA9:	db	00
L0CAA:	db	'Crown Jewel'
L0CB5:	db	00
L0CB6:	db	'The cube vibrates a moment.~~"That ship sails here frequentl'
	db	'y. I know it makes regular runs to the mainland, stops here,'
	db	' then moves on to the Isle of the Avatar the next morning. T'
	db	'hen it repeats the trip, going the other direction."'
L0D9E:	db	00
L0D9F:	db	'"It stops here regularly. Don't know much more about it. The'
	db	' crew is very secretive." Budo looks away, obviously not wan'
	db	'ting to talk about the ship.'
L0E33:	db	00
L0E34:	db	'Crown Jewel'
L0E3F:	db	00
L0E40:	db	'bye'
L0E43:	db	00
L0E44:	db	'"I hope I can help thee again some time, my friend!"*'
L0E79:	db	00
L0E7A:	db	'@Weapons? Armour?@'
L0E8C:	db	00
L0E8D:	db	'@Provisions here!@'
L0E9F:	db	00
