L004E:	db	00
L004F:	db	'name'
L0053:	db	00
L0054:	db	'"I am Paul. My colleagues' names are Meryl and Dustin."'
L008B:	db	00
L008C:	db	'name'
L0090:	db	00
L0091:	db	'job'
L0094:	db	00
L0095:	db	'"We perform a Passion Play about The Fellowship. It costs on'
	db	'ly 2 gold per person to see. If thou dost want us to perform'
	db	' it, please say so."'
L0121:	db	00
L0122:	db	'perform'
L0129:	db	00
L012A:	db	'Fellowship'
L0134:	db	00
L0135:	db	'Passion Play'
L0141:	db	00
L0142:	db	'Passion Play'
L014E:	db	00
L014F:	db	'"A Passion Play is a morality tale performed on stage."'
L0186:	db	00
L0187:	db	'Passion Play'
L0193:	db	00
L0194:	db	'Fellowship'
L019E:	db	00
L019F:	db	'"It would be much simpler to view the play."'
L01CB:	db	00
L01CC:	db	'Fellowship'
L01D6:	db	00
L01D7:	db	'perform'
L01DE:	db	00
L01DF:	db	'"I am sorry to say we are on our break. Please return to the'
	db	' stage area during normal hours."'
L023C:	db	00
L023D:	db	'"Wouldst thou like to see our Passion Play?"'
L0269:	db	00
L026A:	db	'Paul takes your gold. "We thank thee. If thou wouldst make t'
	db	'hyself comfortable, we shall begin."'
L02CA:	db	00
L02CB:	db	'"Oh dear. I am afraid thou dost not have enough gold to pay '
	db	'for the performance. Some other time, I hope."*'
L0336:	db	00
L0337:	db	'"I am sorry. It seems my fellow thespians are not available.'
	db	' The Passion Play has temporarily	closed."*'
L039E:	db	00
L039F:	db	'"Some other time, then, I hope."*'
