	db	'mmmmmmmmmmm!"'
L06BE:	db	00
L06BF:	db	'honey'
L06C4:	db	00
L06C5:	db	'mice'
L06C9:	db	00
L06CA:	db	'The man rubs his belly and makes smacking noises with his mo'
	db	'uth.~~"Mmmmmmmmmmmmmmm!"'
L071E:	db	00
L071F:	db	'mice'
L0723:	db	00
L0724:	db	'friendly'
L072C:	db	00
L072D:	db	'"Sure. They know Mama and me. We are their friends."'
L0761:	db	00
L0762:	db	'The man nods. "They know Mama and me. We are bees' friends. '
	db	'Bees let us have honey when bees sleep. Bees no like giving '
	db	'honey if bees awake."'
L07EF:	db	00
L07F0:	db	'friendly'
L07F8:	db	00
L07F9:	db	'Mama and thee'
L0806:	db	00
L0807:	db	'Mama and thee'
L0814:	db	00
L0815:	db	'"I told thee. We have been here a long time."'
L0842:	db	00
L0843:	db	'"Mama and me live in cave since babies."'
L086B:	db	00
L086C:	db	'"Avatar! They must have been abandoned in here! Why, they mu'
	db	'st be brother and sister!"'
L08C2:	db	00
L08C3:	db	'babies'
L08C9:	db	00
L08CA:	db	'Mama and thee'
L08D7:	db	00
L08D8:	db	'babies'
