L08DF:	db	'The man nods. "We babies then."'
L08FE:	db	00
L08FF:	db	'babies'
L0905:	db	00
L0906:	db	'Art thou from Yew?'
L0918:	db	00
L0919:	db	'Art thou from Yew?'
L092B:	db	00
L092C:	db	'The man's eyes widen, realizes you are serious, then rolls h'
	db	'is eyes to the floor.~~"Damn! All right. Thou didst catch me'
	db	'. Thou art right. Mama and I are from Yew," the man speaks i'
	db	'n a perfect voice booming with intelligence. He then laughs '
	db	'heartily. "We had thee going, though, did we not!"'
L0A4E:	db	00
L0A4F:	db	'Art thou from Yew?'
L0A61:	db	00
L0A62:	db	'Yew'
L0A65:	db	00
L0A66:	db	'Yew'
L0A69:	db	00
L0A6A:	db	'"That's right. My real name is Murray. Mama is really Myrtle'
	db	'. I was a fully licensed apothecary in the town until the Br'
	db	'itannian Tax Council came after me. They wanted the shirt of'
	db	'f my back, so I gave it to them!'
L0B3E:	db	00
L0B3F:	db	'"Since then, Myrtle and I prefer to live down here with the '
	db	'bees. Life is so... carefree down here. We have chosen to li'
	db	've with nature. Now, if thou dost not mind, I shall isolate '
	db	'myself from thee and bid thee farewell."*'
L0C1C:	db	00
L0C1D:	db	'bye'
L0C20:	db	00
L0C21:	db	'Papa smiles and waves.*'
