L0014:	db	'The friendly-looking monk signals you over to him.'
L0046:	db	00
L0047:	db	'"Hello, '
L004F:	db	00
L0050:	db	'."'
L0052:	db	00
L0053:	db	'give potion'
L005E:	db	00
L005F:	db	'name'
L0063:	db	00
L0064:	db	'He smiles. "My name is Kreg, '
L0081:	db	00
L0082:	db	'."'
L0084:	db	00
L0085:	db	'Thief!'
L008B:	db	00
L008C:	db	'name'
L0090:	db	00
L0091:	db	'job'
L0094:	db	00
L0095:	db	'"I am a monk here at the Abbey. I am working on an alchemica'
	db	'l mixture."'
L00DC:	db	00
L00DD:	db	'Abbey'
L00E2:	db	00
L00E3:	db	'mixture'
L00EA:	db	00
L00EB:	db	'Thief!'
L00F1:	db	00
L00F2:	db	'"Ah! Found me out, didst thou? 'Tis too bad... for thee!"*'
L012C:	db	00
L012D:	db	'Abbey'
L0132:	db	00
L0133:	db	'"Sadly, I am so involved with my studies that I have no time'
	db	' to visit the surrounding area or learn any new faces."'
L01A6:	db	00
L01A7:	db	'Abbey'
L01AC:	db	00
L01AD:	db	'mixture'
L01B4:	db	00
L01B5:	db	'"Well, '
L01BC:	db	00
L01BD:	db	', we here at the Abbey will soon be taking a vow of silence.'
	db	' However, it will take some time for all of us to become acc'
	db	'ustomed to the sound of silence. Therefore, I am creating a '
	db	'potion that enables the imbiber to become temporarily silent'
	db	'. The concept is very similar to a potion of invisibility."'
L02E8:	db	00
L02E9:	db	'invisibility'
L02F5:	db	00
L02F6:	db	'vow'
L02F9:	db	00
L02FA:	db	'mixture'
L0301:	db	00
L0302:	db	'vow'
L0305:	db	00
L0306:	db	'"Well," he looks embarrassed, "after reading a book on how w'
	db	'e compare to our predecessors, we learned that most people e'
	db	'xpect us to take a vow of silence.~~ "So," he shrugs, "we ha'
	db	've chosen to do so, once I can make that potion. I realize t'
	db	'hat it sounds foolish, but I truly believe it will help us p'
	db	'roduce more wine."'
L0444:	db	00
L0445:	db	'vow'
L0448:	db	00
L0449:	db	'wine'
L044D:	db	00
L044E:	db	'predecessors'
L045A:	db	00
L045B:	db	'predecessors'
L0467:	db	00
L0468:	db	'"Surely thou knowest of what I speak? Meditation, silence, a'
	db	'esthetics, ascetics, and so forth."'
L04C7:	db	00
L04C8:	db	'predecessors'
L04D4:	db	00
L04D5:	db	'wine'
L04D9:	db	00
L04DA:	db	'"The monks' wine is renowned throughout all of Britannia, or'
	db	' so I thought." A puzzled look fills his face.~~"Ah, well, t'
	db	'hat is no matter. Regardless, I sincerely recommend to thee '
	db	'to try some of our exquisite drink."'
L05B2:	db	00
L05B3:	db	'wine'
L05B7:	db	00
L05B8:	db	'invisibility'
L05C4:	db	00
L05C5:	db	'"As a matter of fact, my research has reached an impasse, fo'
	db	'r I cannot determine the nature of some critical reagents. W'
	db	'hat I need is a potion of invisibility to analyze. Then I co'
	db	'uld progress from there." He looks at you, hopefully. "Would'
	db	'st thou be willing to obtain a potion for my studies? It is '
	db	'likely that thou couldst find one easily at the mage, Nicode'
	db	'mus'."'
L0733:	db	00
L0734:	db	'He sighs, obviously relieved. "Thank thee, '
L075F:	db	00
L0760:	db	'."'
L0762:	db	00
L0763:	db	'"Art thou sure? I will give thee information in return."'
L079B:	db	00
L079C:	db	'information'
L07A7:	db	00
L07A8:	db	'invisibility'
L07B4:	db	00
L07B5:	db	'information'
L07C0:	db	00
L07C1:	db	'"I will tell thee about Lord British, The Fellowship, or Buc'
	db	'caneer's Den if thou bringest me the potion of invisibility.'
	db	'"'
L083A:	db	00
L083B:	db	'information'
L0846:	db	00
L0847:	db	'give potion'
L0852:	db	00
L0853:	db	'He takes the potion from you and quickly drinks it. "Thank t'
	db	'hee, '
L0894:	db	00
L0895:	db	', for helping in mine escape!" As he fades from view, his la'
	db	'ughter fills your ears.*'
L08E9:	db	00
L08EA:	db	'"Thou dost not have a potion to give," he says sadly. "My re'
	db	'search will again have to wait."'
L0946:	db	00
L0947:	db	'give potion'
L0952:	db	00
L0953:	db	'bye'
L0956:	db	00
L0957:	db	'He nods farewell to you.*'
