L0220:	db	00
L0221:	db	'"What dost thou want to know about her, '
L0249:	db	00
L024A:	db	'?"'
L024C:	db	00
L024D:	db	'liqueur'
L0254:	db	00
L0255:	db	'"She has left for Britain on important business," he smiles.'
	db	' "I do not expect her return any time soon."'
L02BD:	db	00
L02BE:	db	'"Oh? Thou hast not seen her lately, either? I wonder what sh'
	db	'e has been up to." He gives a slight smile.'
L0325:	db	00
L0326:	db	'The Cube vibrates. "Actually, I know exactly where she is."'
L0361:	db	00
L0362:	db	'where'
L0367:	db	00
L0368:	db	'"She is right there," he says, pointing to Balayna.'
L039B:	db	00
L039C:	db	'"I have not seen her in some time, '
L03BF:	db	00
L03C0:	db	'. Perhaps thou mayest find her in her house."'
L03ED:	db	00
L03EE:	db	'Balayna'
L03F5:	db	00
L03F6:	db	'where'
L03FB:	db	00
L03FC:	db	'"She has conveniently stopped breathing!" Rankin laughs.'
L0434:	db	00
L0435:	db	'where'
L043A:	db	00
L043B:	db	'liqueur'
L0442:	db	00
L0443:	db	'"Yes, I told thee the merchant brought it from Britain. Dids'
	db	't thou give it to her?'
L0495:	db	00
L0496:	db	'"What then," he asks, "is the problem?"'
L04BD:	db	00
L04BE:	db	'no problem'
L04C8:	db	00
L04C9:	db	'she died'
L04D1:	db	00
L04D2:	db	'"Ah, well. Then I hope thou wilt have the chance later." He '
	db	'stares at you oddly for a moment, and then smiles again.'
