L066A:	db	'"The liqueur? Why, art thou implying that the merchant had c'
	db	'ause to kill her? That is absurd!" He appears thoughtful.~ "'
	db	'Or perhaps not. Mayhaps we will look into that, what sayest '
	db	'thou?"'
L0724:	db	00
L0725:	db	'"Excellent. Let me know if thou dost find any information. M'
	db	'eanwhile, I will make arrangements for her funeral." He shak'
	db	'es his head sadly.'
