L09B9:	db	'"He grins, obviously embarrassed. "I am sorry. Though the br'
	db	'anch opened here several years ago, it is the newest branch '
	db	'on Britannia. I still consider myself a new branch head here'
	db	'."'
L0A6F:	db	00
L0A70:	db	'new'
L0A73:	db	00
L0A74:	db	'Moonglow'
L0A7C:	db	00
L0A7D:	db	'"Ah, yes, Moonglow. It is a pleasant town. It is possible to'
	db	' find all sorts of people here."'
L0AD9:	db	00
L0ADA:	db	'people'
L0AE0:	db	00
L0AE1:	db	'Moonglow'
L0AE9:	db	00
L0AEA:	db	'people'
L0AF0:	db	00
L0AF1:	db	'"I am sorry, but I prefer not to gossip."'
L0B1A:	db	00
L0B1B:	db	'people'
L0B21:	db	00
L0B22:	db	'Fellowship'
L0B2C:	db	00
L0B2D:	db	'"As is customary, our meetings are at 9 p.m. Please feel fre'
	db	'e to join us."'
L0B77:	db	00
L0B78:	db	'"Thou shouldst really return thy medallion to the person fro'
	db	'm whom it came. Only Fellowship members are permitted to wea'
	db	'r them."'
L0BF8:	db	00
L0BF9:	db	'"If thou hast a free moment, I would be quite happy to discu'
	db	'ss our philosophy with thee."'
