L0C74:	db	'philosophy'
L0C7E:	db	00
L0C7F:	db	'voice'
L0C84:	db	00
L0C85:	db	'"Relax, friend, thou wilt hear when the time is right."'
L0CBC:	db	00
L0CBD:	db	'"There is an inner voice that exists within each and every o'
	db	'ne of us. This voice is our companion and guide.~~"The deepe'
	db	'r one's involvement with The Fellowship, the more often one '
	db	'is able to hear one's inner voice."'
L0D94:	db	00
L0D95:	db	'voice'
L0D9A:	db	00
L0D9B:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
L0DB0:	db	00
L0DB1:	db	'"What dear people! They were just here in order to give me m'
	db	'y training session. I was just appointed branch leader. This'
	db	' is a new branch, thou knowest. Anyway, Elizabeth and Abraha'
	db	'm left to travel all the way to the gargoyle island, Terfin.'
	db	'"'
L0EA2:	db	00
L0EA3:	db	'"I have not seen them since they gave me my training session'
	db	', many days ago."'
L0EF0:	db	00
L0EF1:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
L0F06:	db	00
L0F07:	db	'Balayna's accusation'
L0F1B:	db	00
L0F1C:	db	'"Shhh! Talk to me about it later," he whispers, gesturing su'
	db	'btly towards Balayna, "when she is not around."'
L0F87:	db	00
L0F88:	db	'He begins to look amused.~~"I would not let it worry thee to'
	db	'o much, '
L0FCC:	db	00
L0FCD:	db	'. I am afraid Balayna is a bit too ambitious. I would expect'
	db	' she overheard one of my conversion speeches and misundersto'
	db	'od my words. I will have to discuss this with her when I hav'
	db	'e more time so I may allay her fears." His eyes widen, as if'
	db	' he is remembering something.~~"I had forgotten, she request'
	db	'ed a small vial of liqueur from an itinerant merchant who wo'
	db	'uld be passing through Britain. He brought it here a few day'
	db	's ago and I have not had a chance to give it to her. Wouldst'
	db	' thou be willing to deliver it to her for me, '
L11DB:	db	00
L11DC:	db	'?"'
L11DE:	db	00
L11DF:	db	'"Excellent, my friend."'
L11F6:	db	00
L11F7:	db	'"I thank thee." He gives you the vial of liquor.'
L1227:	db	00
L1228:	db	'"Ah, well, thou art carrying too much. I will simply have to'
	db	' save it for when I have time to talk with her. Thank thee a'
	db	'nyway."'
L12A7:	db	00
L12A8:	db	'"Very well. I will have to save it for when I have time to t'
	db	'alk with her. Thank thee anyway."'
L1305:	db	00
