L0008:	db	'name'
L000C:	db	00
L000D:	db	'The wide-eyed expression of this youth seems indicative of h'
	db	'is naivete.'
L0054:	db	00
L0055:	db	'"Why, hello there, '
L0068:	db	00
L0069:	db	'," says Cosmo.'
L0077:	db	00
L0078:	db	'name'
L007C:	db	00
L007D:	db	'"I am Cosmo, '
L008A:	db	00
L008B:	db	', betrothed of Ophelia."'
L00A3:	db	00
L00A4:	db	'name'
L00A8:	db	00
L00A9:	db	'Ophelia'
L00B0:	db	00
L00B1:	db	'betrothed'
L00BA:	db	00
L00BB:	db	'job'
L00BE:	db	00
L00BF:	db	'"I am, uh, searching for something, '
L00E3:	db	00
L00E4:	db	'."'
L00E6:	db	00
L00E7:	db	'searching'
L00F0:	db	00
L00F1:	db	'betrothed'
L00FA:	db	00
L00FB:	db	'"Aye, '
L0101:	db	00
L0102:	db	', we are to be wed as soon I return to her silky arms."'
L0139:	db	00
L013A:	db	'*'
L013B:	db	00
L013C:	db	'"Oh, please!" He rolls his eyes.*'
L015D:	db	00
L015E:	db	'betrothed'
L0167:	db	00
L0168:	db	'searching'
L0171:	db	00
L0172:	db	'"Well, '
L0179:	db	00
L017A:	db	', 'tis a bit of a personal matter."'
L019D:	db	00
L019E:	db	'*'
L019F:	db	00
L01A0:	db	'"What he is searching for, '
L01BB:	db	00
L01BC:	db	', is his virginity!"*'
L01D1:	db	00
L01D2:	db	'"That is not true!" He blushes.~~"I am looking for a way to '
	db	'-prove-... my virginity!"*'
L0228:	db	00
L0229:	db	'proof'
L022E:	db	00
L022F:	db	'personal'
L0237:	db	00
L0238:	db	'searching'
L0241:	db	00
L0242:	db	'personal'
L024A:	db	00
L024B:	db	'"I would... rather... not discuss it, '
L0271:	db	00
L0272:	db	'," he stammers.'
L0281:	db	00
L0282:	db	'personal'
L028A:	db	00
L028B:	db	'Ophelia'
L0292:	db	00
L0293:	db	'"She is the most beautiful woman in all Britannia. I still f'
	db	'ind it hard to believe she has agreed to marry me, a lowly w'
	db	'arrior. I will travel to the ends of the world for her, if t'
	db	'hat be necessary, to keep her heart!"'
L036C:	db	00
L036D:	db	'Ophelia'
L0374:	db	00
L0375:	db	'proof'
L037A:	db	00
L037B:	db	'He looks down at his feet. "Milady Ophelia is concerned that'
	db	' I might not be... pure. I have waited mine entire life for '
	db	'someone like her. Can she not see that I held myself for mar'
	db	'riage?"'
L0436:	db	00
L0437:	db	'pure'
L043B:	db	00
L043C:	db	'held'
L0440:	db	00
L0441:	db	'proof'
L0446:	db	00
L0447:	db	'held'
L044B:	db	00
L044C:	db	'"Surely thou dost see the value in that, '
L0475:	db	00
L0476:	db	'. No woman would want me if I had not refrained from... well'
	db	'... thou dost understand."'
L04CC:	db	00
L04CD:	db	'held'
L04D1:	db	00
L04D2:	db	'pure'
L04D6:	db	00
L04D7:	db	'"I must prove to the lovely Ophelia that I am still a virgin'
	db	'. To do this I need to demonstrate that a unicorn will allow'
	db	' me to touch it. My friends and I are here to find such a cr'
	db	'eature, for recent legend purports that one lives in this du'
	db	'ngeon."'
L05CE:	db	00
L05CF:	db	'the unicorn said no'
L05E2:	db	00
L05E3:	db	'pure'
L05E7:	db	00
L05E8:	db	'the unicorn said no'
L05FB:	db	00
L05FC:	db	'"Thou hast seen the unicorn?" He frowns for a moment, but th'
	db	'at quickly melts away.~~"Nevertheless, I shall endeavor to s'
	db	'eek it out. Nothing shall keep me from my beloved Ophelia."'
L06AF:	db	00
L06B0:	db	'the unicorn said no'
L06C3:	db	00
L06C4:	db	'bye'
L06C7:	db	00
L06C8:	db	'"Good day,'
L06D2:	db	00
L06D3:	db	'. If thou dost see the unicorn, tell it to wait for me."*'
