		.funcnumber	04FEH
		.data
L0000:	db	'You see a creature the size and shape of a horse. From its h'
	db	'ead protrudes a single straight horn. It looks at you with e'
	db	'yes that shine with intelligence.'
L0099:	db	00
L009A:	db	'"I greet thee once again, Avatar," says Lasher, the unicorn.'
L00D6:	db	00
L00D7:	db	'bye'
L00DA:	db	00
L00DB:	db	'job'
L00DE:	db	00
L00DF:	db	'name'
L00E3:	db	00
L00E4:	db	'name'
L00E8:	db	00
L00E9:	db	'The creature speaks. "My name is Lasher."'
L0112:	db	00
L0113:	db	'name'
L0117:	db	00
L0118:	db	'job'
L011B:	db	00
L011C:	db	'Lasher looks at you and blinks. "Come now, Avatar! I do not '
	db	'live by the rules that govern the society of Mankind. There '
	db	'is what I am, which is a unicorn. Then there is my purpose, '
	db	'which is another thing altogether."'
L01F3:	db	00
L01F4:	db	'purpose'
L01FB:	db	00
L01FC:	db	'unicorn'
L0203:	db	00
L0204:	db	'unicorn'
L020B:	db	00
L020C:	db	'Lasher stares at you, stupefied. "Tell me, dost thou know wh'
	db	'at a unicorn is?"'
L0259:	db	00
L025A:	db	'Lasher stares blankly at you. His mouth hangs open. "Very we'
	db	'll. Then I shall tell thee what a unicorn is.'
L02C3:	db	00
L02C4:	db	'Lasher shakes his head sadly. "No, thou merely thinks thou d'
	db	'ost know what a unicorn is, but I shall tell thee the truth.'
L033C:	db	00
L033D:	db	'"A unicorn is one of a family of nature spirits that were on'
	db	'ce called upon to aid a very powerful wizard many, many year'
	db	's ago."'
L03BC:	db	00
L03BD:	db	'unicorn'
L03C4:	db	00
L03C5:	db	'wizard'
L03CB:	db	00
L03CC:	db	'purpose'
L03D3:	db	00
L03D4:	db	'"Oh, do not be coy with me, Avatar. Thou dost know very well'
	db	' the purpose of a unicorn. ~~We are foolproof virgin detecto'
	db	'rs!"'
L0450:	db	00
L0451:	db	'purpose'
L0458:	db	00
L0459:	db	'virgin detector'
L0468:	db	00
L0469:	db	'wizard'
L046F:	db	00
L0470:	db	'"I do not remember the wizard's name, for much time has pass'
	db	'ed since then, but suffice it to say that he was a royal bas'
	db	'tard. Anyway, for one reason or another, the chieftain of ou'
	db	'r clan, who at that time was a horse's ass named Sharp-Hoof,'
	db	' decided that rather than heed this wizard's rightful and pr'
	db	'operly performed ritual of calling, he was going to take the'
	db	' herd and chase after this bevy of really fine fillies."'
L0610:	db	00
L0611:	db	'wizard'
L0617:	db	00
L0618:	db	'Sharp-Hoof'
L0622:	db	00
L0623:	db	'Sharp-Hoof'
L062D:	db	00
L062E:	db	'"Where was I? Oh, yes, Sharp-Hoof! The next morning, after w'
	db	'e had had our way with these fillies, this wizard called us '
	db	'again. This time Sharp-Hoof realized that we had best answer'
	db	', and were we sorry that we did! The wizard was horribly ang'
	db	'ry! And, well, I will just say that our agreements with such'
	db	' people are very, very binding."'
L077A:	db	00
L077B:	db	'Sharp-Hoof'
L0785:	db	00
L0786:	db	'binding'
L078D:	db	00
L078E:	db	'binding'
L0795:	db	00
L0796:	db	'"Not only were we bound in service to this wizard for a thou'
	db	'sand years, but he also placed a dreadful curse upon us."'
L080B:	db	00
L080C:	db	'binding'
L0813:	db	00
L0814:	db	'curse'
L0819:	db	00
L081A:	db	'service'
L0821:	db	00
L0822:	db	'service'
L0829:	db	00
L082A:	db	'"As it fell out, we did not actually have to serve the wizar'
	db	'd for a thousand years. He reduced the time by a few weeks a'
	db	'fter placing that curse on us." Lasher snorts sarcastically,'
	db	' "I was heartbroken."'
L08F3:	db	00
L08F4:	db	'service'
L08FB:	db	00
L08FC:	db	'curse'
L0901:	db	00
L0902:	db	'"We nature spirits used to be renowned for our randiness, an'
	db	'd this wizard had called upon us to assist him in the seduct'
	db	'ion of some maiden. When we stood him up... Well, let us jus'
	db	't say that he was one magician who was having a problem conv'
	db	'incing his magic wand to work. Anyway, in a pathetic attempt'
	db	' to bolster his diminished feelings of manhood, he ruined us'
	db	' with an awesomely powerful Curse of Chastity."'
L0A99:	db	00
L0A9A:	db	'curse'
L0A9F:	db	00
L0AA0:	db	'Chastity'
L0AA8:	db	00
L0AA9:	db	'Chastity'
L0AB1:	db	00
L0AB2:	db	'"It was a terrible curse. First, it drove us to kill all of '
	db	'the female members of our clan. Then it afflicted us with th'
	db	'e particular sensitivity for which we have become known."'
L0B63:	db	00
L0B64:	db	'Chastity'
L0B6C:	db	00
L0B6D:	db	'virgin detector'
