L003C:	db	'A ball of light approaches you.~~"'You' are not the entity k'
	db	'nown as 'Trellek'. 'You' call out in the manner of the speci'
	db	'es called 'emps'. 'Xorinia' was expecting the entity 'Trelle'
	db	'k'.'
L00F3:	db	00
L00F4:	db	'"But that is not of importance. From the information 'I' hav'
	db	'e, the local manifestation before 'me' is the entity known a'
	db	's 'Avatar'.'
L0177:	db	00
L0178:	db	'The Wisp glows brightly a second or two.~~"'Xorinia' wishes '
	db	'to exchange information with the human entity."'
L01E3:	db	00
L01E4:	db	'"Once again a local manifestation addresses the Xorinite dim'
	db	'ension."'
L0228:	db	00
L0229:	db	'name'
L022D:	db	00
L022E:	db	'"Highest probabilities indicate that a manifestation from th'
	db	'e Xorinite dimension will be called 'Wisp' by the entities k'
	db	'nown as 'humans'. I am also called 'Xorinia' by other manife'
	db	'stations of the Xorinite dimension."'
L0306:	db	00
L0307:	db	'name'
L030B:	db	00
L030C:	db	'Wisp'
L0310:	db	00
L0311:	db	'Wisp'
L0315:	db	00
L0316:	db	'"This label has been implemented by human entities to name m'
	db	'anifestations from the Xorinite dimension since the time whe'
	db	'n this dimension was discovered by Xorinite manifestations. '
	db	'Another common name is 'Will-o-the-wisp'.~~ "The preceding s'
	db	'ample of information was provided without charge. Usually th'
	db	'ere is a fee for information."'
L0460:	db	00
L0461:	db	'Wisp'
L0465:	db	00
L0466:	db	'information'
L0471:	db	00
L0472:	db	'"The Undrian Council seeks information regarding a certain e'
	db	'ntity by the name of 'Alagner'. 'You' have access to this in'
	db	'formation. 'I' have information regarding a certain entity w'
	db	'hich 'you' are seeking. The Undrian Council proposes a trade'
	db	'."'
L0564:	db	00
L0565:	db	'information'
L0570:	db	00
L0571:	db	'trade'
L0576:	db	00
