	db	'ernment'."'
L05E5:	db	00
L05E6:	db	'Undrian Council'
L05F5:	db	00
L05F6:	db	'job'
L05F9:	db	00
L05FA:	db	'"'Xorinia' is a conduit for information between different pl'
	db	'anes and dimensions. 'Xorinia' also catalogs information whi'
	db	'ch is necessary for growth of the Xorinite community. 'You' '
	db	'have information which may be valuable to 'me'. 'I' also hav'
	db	'e information that 'you' want."'
L0709:	db	00
L070A:	db	'information'
L0715:	db	00
L0716:	db	'Alagner'
L071D:	db	00
L071E:	db	'"The Undrian Council has information that there is a human e'
	db	'ntity in 'your' dimension that has been called 'the wisest m'
	db	'an in Britannia.' This entity is known as 'Alagner' and live'
	db	's in 'your' colony of 'New Magincia'. 'Alagner' has what the'
	db	' entity calls a 'notebook'. The 'notebook' is a collection o'
	db	'f information."'
L0859:	db	00
L085A:	db	'Alagner'
L0861:	db	00
L0862:	db	'trade'
L0867:	db	00
L0868:	db	'"'I' want to absorb the information in Alagner's 'notebook'.'
	db	' If 'you' bring the 'notebook' here, the Undrian Council wil'
	db	'l release information useful to 'you'. Do 'you' agree to the'
	db	' trade?"'
L0924:	db	00
L0925:	db	'"'Xorinia' recognizes 'your' usefulness. 'I' shall be here. '
	db	'Human entities will call 'my' activity 'waiting'."'
L0993:	db	00
L0994:	db	'"'Xorinia' recognizes 'your' hostility. 'I' shall be here sh'
	db	'ould 'you' reflect upon 'your' decision and decide to change'
	db	' it."*'
L0A12:	db	00
L0A13:	db	'trade'
L0A18:	db	00
L0A19:	db	'Time Lord'
L0A22:	db	00
L0A23:	db	'"The entity known as 'Time Lord' requests an audience with ''
	db	'you'. Before 'I' can give 'you' more information about this,'
	db	' 'I' must propose a trade."'
L0AB6:	db	00
L0AB7:	db	'information'
L0AC2:	db	00
L0AC3:	db	'"The entity known as 'Time Lord' is a being from the space/t'
	db	'ime dimension. The Xorinite Dimension has been communicating'
	db	' with 'Time Lord' for what 'humans' call 'centuries'."'
L0B71:	db	00
L0B72:	db	'Time Lord'
L0B7B:	db	00
L0B7C:	db	'notebook'
L0B84:	db	00
L0B85:	db	'"The human entity is welcomed by 'Xorinia'. 'You' have broug'
	db	'ht the item 'notebook'. 'I' shall now absorb the information'
	db	' contained therein."~~The Wisp glows brightly for a few seco'
	db	'nds. The notebook remains in your possession.~~"'I' have com'
	db	'pleted my absorption of the information. 'You' may now retur'
	db	'n the item 'notebook' to the entity 'Alagner'.~~"And now for'
	db	' the exchange of information and delivery of a message."'
L0D25:	db	00
L0D26:	db	'notebook'
L0D2E:	db	00
L0D2F:	db	'message'
L0D36:	db	00
L0D37:	db	'exchange'
L0D3F:	db	00
L0D40:	db	'message'
L0D47:	db	00
L0D48:	db	'"'Xorinia' must deliver a message to 'you'. The entity known'
	db	' as 'Time Lord' requests 'your' audience. 'Time Lord' is tra'
	db	'pped at the plane known as the Shrine of Spirituality. 'You''
	db	' can reach 'him' by using 'your' object 'Orb of the Moons' i'
	db	'n the location directly to 'your' 'northwest'.'
L0E66:	db	00
L0E67:	db	'message'
L0E6E:	db	00
L0E6F:	db	'Time Lord'
L0E78:	db	00
L0E79:	db	'exchange'
L0E81:	db	00
L0E82:	db	'"Now for the information 'you' seek. 'This' dimension known '
	db	'as 'Britannia' is under attack by an entity called 'The Guar'
	db	'dian'.~~"'The Guardian' lives in another dimension. 'Xorinia'
	db	'' sometimes trades information with this entity. Do 'you' wa'
	db	'nt to know more about 'The Guardian'?"'
L0F98:	db	00
L0F99:	db	'"'Xorinia' has digested information about 'The Guardian' and'
	db	' can state the following facts:~~"'The Guardian' possesses q'
	db	'ualities which human entities label 'vain', 'greedy', 'egoce'
	db	'ntric', and 'malevolent'. 'The Guardian' thrives on power an'
	db	'd domination. 'The Guardian' takes 'pleasure' from conquerin'
	db	'g other worlds. His sensory organs are now focused on 'this''
	db	' dimension known as 'Britannia'.~~"'The Guardian' is attempt'
	db	'ing to enter 'this' dimension by means of an item human enti'
	db	'ties call a 'Moongate'. This 'Moongate' is not a 'red' color'
	db	' or 'blue' color 'Moongate', which 'Xorinia' knows is the st'
	db	'andard form of this item. 'The Guardian' is building a 'Moon'
	db	'gate' of the color 'black'."'
L1249:	db	00
L124A:	db	'exchange'
L1252:	db	00
L1253:	db	'Black Gate'
L125D:	db	00
L125E:	db	'"'Xorinia' always responds to free information. Transaction '
	db	'complete."*'
L12A5:	db	00
L12A6:	db	'exchange'
L12AE:	db	00
L12AF:	db	'Black Gate'
L12B9:	db	00
L12BA:	db	'"The 'Black Gate' will be fully functional when the phenomen'
	db	'on known as 'Astronomical Alignment' next occurs.~~ "Althoug'
	db	'h 'Xorinia' does not normally seek to influence actions of o'
	db	'ther manifestations, 'Xorinia' warns 'you' that if 'The Guar'
	db	'dian' enters 'this' dimension, it will be the end of the dim'
	db	'ension known as 'Britannia'. 'The Guardian' is powerful in ''
	db	'his' own dimension. In 'your' dimension, 'he' will be unstop'
	db	'pable.~~"The Undrian Council sincerely hopes this informatio'
	db	'n is useful. Transaction complete."*'
L14BE:	db	00
L14BF:	db	'Black Gate'
L14C9:	db	00
L14CA:	db	'bye'
L14CD:	db	00
L14CE:	db	'"'Xorinia' always welcomes the exchange of information. Fare'
	db	'well."*'
L1511:	db	00
