		.data
L0000:	db	'"I am gladdened to see thee still alive, my good friend. I w'
	db	'as sorely grieved at thine apparent demise.~~"In the midst o'
	db	'f our battle I did lose track of thee. It is good to find th'
	db	'ee safe.~~"If thou art feeling up to it, let us then continu'
	db	'e our quest."*'
L00FE:	db	00
L00FF:	db	'"Thy recovery is a miracle! 'Twould have been a severe blow '
	db	'for this world to lose its Avatar.~~"When at last thou wert '
	db	'found, thy body was being taken to this place in a wagon dri'
	db	'ven by two hooded Fellowship members.~~"Thou hast suffered t'
	db	'hrough a terrible ordeal and travelled far. Perhaps thou sho'
	db	'uldst rest..."*'
L023A:	db	00
L023B:	db	'"The Fellowship members who brought thee to this place did n'
	db	'ot speak once during the entire journey.~~"But it seems they'
	db	' did the right thing in bringing thee here for thou hast bee'
	db	'n revived!~~"Let us all have a drink in celebration! We will'
	db	' be ready to leave whenever thou dost wish it."*'
L035B:	db	00
