		.funcnumber	06A0H
		.data
L0000:	db	'Amidst muttered curses detailing the uselessness of ether an'
	db	'd bothersome inter-dimensional beings, Erethian intones the '
	db	'magical words,'
L0086:	db	00
L0087:	db	'"An Vas Ailem!   Kal Bet Ailem!"*'
L00A8:	db	00
L00A9:	db	'Little beads of sweat appear on the elderly mage's furrowed '
	db	'brow. "That was a bit harder than I'd expected." He pauses t'
	db	'o mop his forehead with the tip of his sleeve, "I had to red'
	db	'irect a small underground river for the well to tap. Now, th'
	db	'en. Thou shalt have need of some few tools to make use of th'
	db	'is equipment, shan't thee?" His rhetorical question goes una'
	db	'nswered	as he once again prepares to unleash his will upon t'
	db	'he world.'
L0256:	db	00
L0257:	db	'He stops himself for a moment and says, "If perchance thou h'
	db	'adst some item or other laying upon the floor here, thou'lt '
	db	'find it within yonder chest." He motions to the chest sittin'
	db	'g on the floor, then continues with his spell.*'
