L0000:	db	'Erethian's face begins to take on an ashen palor, but he loo'
	db	'ks contented with a job well done. "As I have said, I myself'
	db	' once attempted to create an artifact of great power. I craf'
	db	'ted the hilt from a dark substance that is immutable, save b'
	db	'y magical means. The blade, however, is cast of an alloy of '
	db	'this substance and the purest metals known to Britannia. My '
	db	'artistic skills served me well enough to fashion the hilt bu'
	db	't, alas, the strength was not in my arm to beat a good tempe'
	db	'r into the blade. Perhaps, thou canst finish this great arti'
	db	'fact for me..." He pulls a poorly worked blade with a fine h'
	db	'ilt out of thin air. "Fear not to touch the hilt when the bl'
	db	'ade is hot, for heat apparently does not travel well across '
	db	'the medium of the pure, black substance. I wish thee good lu'
	db	'ck."'
L0310:	db	00
L0311:	db	'He hands the sword to you and wearily turns away.*'
L0343:	db	00
L0344:	db	'He places the sword upon the firepit and wearily turns away.'
	db	'"*'
