L0000:	db	'"Yes, Master. How may I serve thee?" The dark form in the mi'
	db	'rror bows deeply.'
L004D:	db	00
L004E:	db	'Erethian'
L0056:	db	00
L0057:	db	'the mage'
L005F:	db	00
L0060:	db	'Suprised, '
L006A:	db	00
L006B:	db	' looks around and says, "I don't recall summoning thee. Neve'
	db	'rmind, I have no need of thee at the current time. Begone!" '
	db	'The old man waves his hand, negligently.'
L010B:	db	00
L010C:	db	'Through a tightly clenched smile, the figure replies, "Very '
	db	'well..." And after a significant pause, "Master."*'
L017A:	db	00
L017B:	db	'Arcadion appears truly astonished, "For what dost thou wait?'
	db	'! I beg of thee! Release me!"'
L01D4:	db	00
L01D5:	db	'"There is a gem nearby that can free me! It is a small blue '
	db	'stone. Take it, quickly, and use it to free me of this accur'
	db	'sed mirror!" The large daemon seethes with pent up frustrati'
	db	'on.*'
L028D:	db	00
L028E:	db	'"Can I be of some small assistance in thy quest to release m'
	db	'e. If so, thou hast but to ask." Arcadion's smile stretches '
	db	'from ear to ear.'
L0316:	db	00
L0317:	db	'bye'
L031A:	db	00
L031B:	db	'release'
L0322:	db	00
L0323:	db	'job'
L0326:	db	00
L0327:	db	'name'
L032B:	db	00
L032C:	db	'"Thou hast within thy possessions a small blue gem. It can b'
	db	'e used to free me! Crack this accursed mirror with it! I'll '
	db	'enter it as I am freed!"	Arcadion looks prepared to burst fr'
	db	'om the mirror.*'
L03EF:	db	00
L03F0:	db	'"Can I be of some small assistance in thy quest to release m'
	db	'e. If so, thou hast but to ask." Arcadion's smile stretches '
	db	'from ear to ear.'
L0478:	db	00
L0479:	db	'bye'
L047C:	db	00
L047D:	db	'release'
L0484:	db	00
L0485:	db	'job'
L0488:	db	00
L0489:	db	'name'
L048D:	db	00
L048E:	db	'"Run along now little mortal. Do not pester thy betters with'
	db	' the idle rantings of thy tongue." He appears at first nonch'
	db	'allant, then his expression becomes intense, "That is unless'
	db	' thou hast reconsidered my offer... Hast thou?"'
L0571:	db	00
L0572:	db	'A wicked look of triumph flickers across Arcadion's face to '
	db	'be quickly replaced by a ludicrous semblance of gratitude, "'
	db	'Thou art truly courageous to vow to release	me. My eternal t'
	db	'hanks are thine." An oily grin coats the daemon's face, "Tho'
	db	'u hast made quite a powerful ally this day, mortal." His eye'
	db	's blink in what is possibly meant to be a charming manner.'
L06D8:	db	00
L06D9:	db	'bye'
L06DC:	db	00
L06DD:	db	'release'
L06E4:	db	00
L06E5:	db	'daemon'
L06EB:	db	00
L06EC:	db	'job'
L06EF:	db	00
L06F0:	db	'name'
L06F4:	db	00
L06F5:	db	'"Ah, I see. Still content to run about with the other sheep.'
	db	'" He waves you off and dims from sight.*'
L0759:	db	00
L075A:	db	'"Yes, Master. How may I serve thee..." The wavering visage i'
	db	'n the mirror hesitates for a moment, "Thou art not my master'
	db	'."'
L07D4:	db	00
L07D5:	db	'He then continues with a small bow, "Greetings Britannian. W'
	db	'hat dost thou wish of the great daemon, Arcadion?"'
L0843:	db	00
L0844:	db	'bye'
L0847:	db	00
L0848:	db	'daemon'
L084E:	db	00
L084F:	db	'job'
L0852:	db	00
L0853:	db	'name'
L0857:	db	00
L0858:	db	'"Greetings once again Britannian. What dost thou wish of me.'
	db	'" The daemon is the soul of congeniality.'
L08BD:	db	00
L08BE:	db	'bye'
L08C1:	db	00
L08C2:	db	'daemon'
L08C8:	db	00
L08C9:	db	'job'
L08CC:	db	00
L08CD:	db	'name'
L08D1:	db	00
L08D2:	db	'name'
L08D6:	db	00
L08D7:	db	'The big daemon smiles ingratiatingly, showing inch long poin'
	db	'ted	teeth. "As I have said, I am the daemon Arcadion."'
