L0027:	db	00
L0028:	db	'@According to the tome, a `heart' will be necessary to perfo'
	db	'rm this ritual.@'
L0074:	db	00
L0075:	db	'"I will give him mine!"'
L008C:	db	00
L008D:	db	'You watch in stunned horror as Bollux pierces his chest open'
	db	' with his fingers.'
L00DB:	db	00
L00DC:	db	'He pulls forth a heart-shape stone and, with a final flurry '
	db	'of action, drops the stone upon Adjhar's chest as he falls d'
	db	'ead to the ground.'
