L0000:	db	'"Well, thou didst certainly attempt to complete the quest. I'
	db	' cannot understand why the chest in Destard was empty. But w'
	db	'e shall forget it, shall we?'
L0094:	db	00
L0095:	db	'"Now that thou hast worked a little for The Fellowship, and '
	db	'hast learned what we stand for, dost thou still wish to join'
	db	'?"'
L010F:	db	00
L0110:	db	'"Then thou art most welcome to The Fellowship. '
L013F:	db	00
L0140:	db	'"Thou wilt officially be inducted during our nightly meeting'
	db	' this evening. Please come, and thou shalt receive thy medal'
	db	'lion then. Once again, we thank thee, Avatar."*'
L01E7:	db	00
L01E8:	db	'"The Ceremony shall begin."'
L0203:	db	00
L0204:	db	'join'
L0208:	db	00
L0209:	db	'"I can see that thou art not yet ready to take such a courag'
	db	'eous step in thy thinking and in thy life. But do remember w'
	db	'hat we spoke of today, my friend! Perhaps in time thou wilt '
	db	'become ready."*'
L02CC:	db	00
L02CD:	db	'"Ah, but first things first. I recommend that thou takest ou'
	db	'r Examination to determine if thou art truly in need of The '
	db	'Fellowship's teachings. Dost thou want to take the test?"'
L037E:	db	00
L037F:	db	'"Perhaps another time, then."*'
L039D:	db	00
