		.data
L0000:	db	'The ceremony begins as Batlin stands before the gathered mem'
	db	'bers of The Fellowship in Britain. He begins his sermon. "My'
	db	' friends, I originally created The Fellowship to help ready '
	db	'Britannia and its people for the future. Today one of the gr'
	db	'eatest symbols of its past has come here to join our Fellows'
	db	'hip. This is a great day, for as our past and present intert'
	db	'wine we shall send a message which shall be heard throughout'
	db	' Britannia. Soon all of its peoples will strive together for'
	db	' unity." The gathering breaks into loud cheers. "When they h'
	db	'ear that the Avatar has become a member of The Fellowship th'
	db	'ose who were at first distrustful of us will come to see the'
	db	' truth of what we stand for. Then we may bring about a day w'
	db	'hen all of Britannia is worthy of the ample rewards it shall'
	db	' receive."'
L0316:	db	00
L0317:	db	'Iolo whispers to you. "Art thou quite certain, '
L0346:	db	00
L0347:	db	', that thou dost wish to join with these people?"'
L0378:	db	00
L0379:	db	'"I am not certain if thou art brave or simply foolish."*'
L03B1:	db	00
L03B2:	db	'"It is a relief to me to hear that thou art not certain! All'
	db	'ow me to remind thee that it is not too late to refuse their'
	db	' offer! Let us leave, and quickly!"*'
L044E:	db	00
L044F:	db	'"Now is the time when our members give their testimonials of'
	db	' how they have been applying the Triad of Inner Strength to '
	db	'their lives. Who shall be the first?"'
L04EC:	db	00
L04ED:	db	'"The Fellowship has taught me to live with the shortcomings '
	db	'of others," says Gaye.'
L053F:	db	00
L0540:	db	'"I had lost all enthusiasm for life before I joined The Fell'
	db	'owship," says Candice.*'
L0593:	db	00
L0594:	db	'"Thank thee for sharing, Candice."*'
L05B7:	db	00
L05B8:	db	'"The Fellowship helps me to be more honest with people," say'
	db	's Patterson.*'
L0601:	db	00
L0602:	db	'"The Fellowship has taught me not to let others push me arou'
	db	'nd," says Figg.*'
L064E:	db	00
L064F:	db	'"The Triad of Inner Strength has helped me to improve my ski'
	db	'lls and build better weapons," says Grayson.*'
L06B8:	db	00
L06B9:	db	'"The Fellowship has put me back on the path to prosperity," '
	db	'says Gordon.*'
L0702:	db	00
L0703:	db	'"Yes! Thank thee for sharing, brother!"*'
L072B:	db	00
L072C:	db	'"The Fellowship has taught me not to be afraid of success," '
	db	'says Sean.*'
L0773:	db	00
L0774:	db	'"The Fellowship has given my life a whole new purpose. Just '
	db	'today I have recruited two more potential members!" says Mil'
	db	'lie.*'
L07F1:	db	00
L07F2:	db	'"The Fellowship has taught me about the evils of the class s'
	db	'tructure," says Nanna.*'
L0845:	db	00
L0846:	db	'You notice Iolo is whispering to Shamino. "I do not think th'
	db	'at '
L0885:	db	00
L0886:	db	' doth realize the significance of the situation. '
L08B7:	db	00
L08B8:	db	' cannot be dissuaded. Perhaps thou shouldst give it a try."'
L08F3:	db	00
L08F4:	db	'"All right, I shall give it a try." He nudges you and whispe'
	db	'rs. "Perhaps we should get out of here, '
L0958:	db	00
L0959:	db	', before one of us does something they may later regret? Let'
	db	' us leave these premises, all right?"'
L09BA:	db	00
L09BB:	db	'"I am glad thou dost see it my way. We can leave whenever th'
	db	'ou art ready."*'
L0A06:	db	00
L0A07:	db	'"Then I guess it is too late for I already regret coming her'
	db	'e."*'
L0A47:	db	00
L0A48:	db	'"Now is the time to welcome the newest member of The Fellows'
	db	'hip to sit at our table." Batlin beckons you to join him at '
	db	'the podium.'
L0ACB:	db	00
L0ACC:	db	'He pours a glass of wine into a crystal goblet and takes a s'
	db	'ip.'
L0B0B:	db	00
L0B0C:	db	'The goblet is passed around the hall, each member respective'
	db	'ly taking a sip. Finally, the goblet is handed to you. You l'
	db	'ook at it thoughtfully as you feel all eyes in the room upon'
	db	' you.'
L0BC5:	db	00
L0BC6:	db	'she'
L0BC9:	db	00
L0BCA:	db	'he'
L0BCC:	db	00
L0BCD:	db	'You hear Shamino desperately whispering to Dupre as they sta'
	db	'nd behind you. "Dupre, we are having no success in showing t'
	db	'he Avatar the mistake '
L0C5B:	db	00
L0C5C:	db	' must surely be making. Thou art our last hope."'
L0C8C:	db	00
L0C8D:	db	'You feel a tapping on your shoulder and you turn to see Dupr'
	db	'e as he whispers in your ear. "I know a much better place to'
	db	' get a drink than this one. Perhaps thou wouldst like to joi'
	db	'n thy comrades there?"'
L0D57:	db	00
L0D58:	db	'"Then let us be off. Now!"*'
L0D73:	db	00
L0D74:	db	'"Then I hope this game amuses thee, for it makes thy comrade'
	db	's sorely worried."*'
L0DC3:	db	00
L0DC4:	db	'"Now there remains but one more test of thy loyalty to The F'
	db	'ellowship. I presume thou hast read the Book of Fellowship b'
	db	'y now. I must ask you two questions. The answers may be foun'
	db	'd within the book." Batlin smiles modestly. "I am the author'
	db	', didst thou know? Well, never mind. Here we go."'
L0EE5:	db	00
L0EE6:	db	'"Excellent, Avatar!"'
L0EFA:	db	00
L0EFB:	db	'Fighting a tremble of hesitation you take a long deep drink '
	db	'from the goblet. Batlin steps up to you. "May the news sprea'
	db	'd far and wide that our newest member is none other than the'
	db	' Avatar!"'
L0FB8:	db	00
L0FB9:	db	'The other Fellowship members cheer with pleasure.'
L0FEA:	db	00
L0FEB:	db	'"Allow me to present thee with thy Fellowship medallion." Ba'
	db	'tlin gives you the medallion. "Please -- wear thy medallion '
	db	'at all times for it shall be a symbol to all who see it that'
	db	' thou dost walk with the Fellowship. Ready it to thy neck im'
	db	'mediately! Oh, and... welcome to The Fellowship, Avatar."*'
L1115:	db	00
L1116:	db	'"Thou art too encumbered to receive thy Fellowship medallion'
	db	'. Thou must lighten thy load."*'
L1171:	db	00
L1172:	db	'"My dear Avatar. Thou must realize that thou must know every'
	db	'thing there is to know about The Fellowship before I can ind'
	db	'uct thee. Please study thy Book of Fellowship and return to '
	db	'me."'
L122A:	db	00
L122B:	db	'Your mind seems unclear. I would not be surprised if thou do'
	db	'st not understand	another soul with whom thou dost speak."'
L12A1:	db	00
