L0000:	db	'"Excellent! Hast thou brought some pumpkins for me?"'
L0034:	db	00
L0035:	db	'"Very good! Let me see how many thou dost have..."'
L0067:	db	00
L0068:	db	'"But thou dost not have a single one in thy possession! Thou'
	db	' art as looney as Mack!"*'
L00BD:	db	00
L00BE:	db	'"Lovely! '
L00C7:	db	00
L00C8:	db	'! That means I owe thee '
L00E0:	db	00
L00E1:	db	' gold. Here thou art! I shall take the pumpkins from thee no'
	db	'w!"'
L0120:	db	00
L0121:	db	'"Come back and work for me at any time!"*'
L014A:	db	00
L014B:	db	'"If thou wouldst travel in a lighter fashion, thou wouldst h'
	db	'ave hands to take my gold!"'
L01A2:	db	00
L01A3:	db	'"No? What hast thou been doing in my field? Thou art as wort'
	db	'hless as most of the workers one finds!"'
L0207:	db	00
