L0000:	db	'the Avatar'
L000A:	db	00
L000B:	db	'"It seems that thou dost need a little more time to hone thy'
	db	' reflexes. If thou dost wish to return later, when thou hast'
	db	' more experience, I would be most happy to train thee."'
L00BA:	db	00
L00BB:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
L00F4:	db	00
L00F5:	db	' gold altogether.'
L0106:	db	00
L0107:	db	'"Thou hast not enough gold to pay me. I am sorry but I canno'
	db	't train thee now."'
L0155:	db	00
L0156:	db	'"Zounds! Thou art quick. Too quick, in fact, for me to be ab'
	db	'le to help thee become faster. I am sorry, '
L01BD:	db	00
L01BE:	db	'."'
L01C0:	db	00
L01C1:	db	'You pay '
L01C9:	db	00
L01CA:	db	' gold, and the training session begins.'
L01F1:	db	00
L01F2:	db	'You'
L01F5:	db	00
L01F6:	db	'you'
L01F9:	db	00
L01FA:	db	' and Chad spar for a few minutes. He teaches '
L0227:	db	00
L0228:	db	' several expert maneuvers that better utilize speed and agil'
	db	'ity in combat.'
L0272:	db	00
