L0000:	db	'"I am able to heal, cure poison, and resurrect. Art thou in '
	db	'need of one of these services?"'
L005B:	db	00
L005C:	db	'"Which of my services dost thou need?"'
L0082:	db	00
L0083:	db	'resurrect'
L008C:	db	00
L008D:	db	'cure poison'
L0098:	db	00
L0099:	db	'heal'
L009D:	db	00
L009E:	db	'heal'
L00A2:	db	00
L00A3:	db	'cure poison'
L00AE:	db	00
L00AF:	db	'heal'
L00B3:	db	00
L00B4:	db	'healed'
L00BA:	db	00
L00BB:	db	'cure poison'
L00C6:	db	00
L00C7:	db	'cured of poison'
L00D6:	db	00
L00D7:	db	'"Who dost thou wish to be '
L00F1:	db	00
L00F2:	db	'?"'
L00F4:	db	00
L00F5:	db	'"So thou art healthy? 'Tis good news. If thou dost need my s'
	db	'ervices in the future, do not hesitate to return."'
L0163:	db	00
L0164:	db	'resurrect'
L016D:	db	00
L016E:	db	'"I apologize, '
L017C:	db	00
L017D:	db	', but I do not see anyone who is in need of resurrection. I '
	db	'must be able to see the body to save the spirit. If thou art'
	db	' carrying thy misfortunate friend, pray lay them on the grou'
	db	'nd so that I may return them to this world."'
L025D:	db	00
L025E:	db	'"Indeed, thy friend has departed this life. I will attempt t'
	db	'o restore them to this world."'
L02B8:	db	00
L02B9:	db	'"My price is '
L02C6:	db	00
L02C7:	db	' gold. Is this satisfactory?"'
L02E4:	db	00
L02E5:	db	'heal'
L02E9:	db	00
L02EA:	db	'cure poison'
L02F5:	db	00
L02F6:	db	'resurrect'
L02FF:	db	00
L0300:	db	'"Thou dost not have any gold. I am truly sorry. I cannot hel'
	db	'p thee until thou canst provide the proper fee." Chantu bows'
	db	' respectfully.'
L0386:	db	00
L0387:	db	'"Then I am truly sorry. I must charge what I must charge. We'
	db	' do not live in prosperous times."'
L03E5:	db	00
L03E6:	db	'"Well, if thou dost decide that my services are needed, I am'
	db	' always here."'
L0430:	db	00
