L0000:	db	'"I am qualified to heal, cure poison, and resurrect. Art tho'
	db	'u interested in one of these services?"'
L0063:	db	00
L0064:	db	'"Which of my services dost thou have need of?"'
L0092:	db	00
L0093:	db	'resurrect'
L009C:	db	00
L009D:	db	'cure poison'
L00A8:	db	00
L00A9:	db	'heal'
L00AD:	db	00
L00AE:	db	'heal'
L00B2:	db	00
L00B3:	db	'cure poison'
L00BE:	db	00
L00BF:	db	'heal'
L00C3:	db	00
L00C4:	db	'healed'
L00CA:	db	00
L00CB:	db	'cure poison'
L00D6:	db	00
L00D7:	db	'cured of poison'
L00E6:	db	00
L00E7:	db	'"Who dost thou wish to be '
L0101:	db	00
L0102:	db	'?"'
L0104:	db	00
L0105:	db	'"Very well. It pleases me that thou art healthy."'
L0136:	db	00
L0137:	db	'resurrect'
L0140:	db	00
L0141:	db	'"I do not see anyone who needs resurrecting. I must be able '
	db	'to see the body to resurrect. If thou art carrying thy frien'
	db	'd, pray lay them on the ground so that I may attend to them.'
	db	'"'
L01F6:	db	00
L01F7:	db	'"Thy friend is badly wounded. I will attempt to restore them'
	db	'."'
L0235:	db	00
L0236:	db	'"My price is '
L0243:	db	00
L0244:	db	' gold. Is this price agreeable?"'
L0264:	db	00
L0265:	db	'heal'
L0269:	db	00
L026A:	db	'cure poison'
L0275:	db	00
L0276:	db	'resurrect'
L027F:	db	00
L0280:	db	'"Tsk, tsk. Thou dost not have enough gold for the service. I'
	db	' do hope I may help thee another day."'
L02E2:	db	00
L02E3:	db	'"Then thou must look elsewhere for that service."'
L0314:	db	00
L0315:	db	'"If thou hast need of my services later, I will be here."'
L034E:	db	00
