L0000:	db	'you'
L0003:	db	00
L0004:	db	'"I am sorry, but thou dost not have enough practical experie'
	db	'nce to train at this time. If thou couldst return at a later'
	db	' date, I would be most happy to train thee."'
L00A8:	db	00
L00A9:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
L00E2:	db	00
L00E3:	db	' gold altogether.'
L00F4:	db	00
L00F5:	db	'"I regret that thou dost not seem to have enough gold to tra'
	db	'in here. Mayhaps at another time, when thy fortunes are more'
	db	' prosperous..."'
L017C:	db	00
L017D:	db	'"Thou art already as proficient as I! I am afraid that thou '
	db	'cannot be trained further in this."'
L01DC:	db	00
L01DD:	db	'You pay '
L01E5:	db	00
L01E6:	db	' gold, and the training session begins.'
L020D:	db	00
L020E:	db	'you'
L0211:	db	00
L0212:	db	'complete'
L021A:	db	00
L021B:	db	'feel'
L021F:	db	00
L0220:	db	'your'
