L023E:	db	00
L023F:	db	'their'
L0244:	db	00
L0245:	db	'spends'
L024B:	db	00
L024C:	db	'them'
L0250:	db	00
L0251:	db	'Denby hands '
L025D:	db	00
L025E:	db	' a chart with runes printed on it. "Study these runes and me'
	db	'morize them," he says. After '
L02B7:	db	00
L02B8:	db	' '
L02B9:	db	00
L02BA:	db	' this task, '
L02C6:	db	00
L02C7:	db	' '
L02C8:	db	00
L02C9:	db	' that there is a bit of knowledge in '
L02EE:	db	00
L02EF:	db	' mind that was not there earlier.~~"Now we shall exercise. P'
	db	'ractice what I teach thee at least twice a day. Then thou sh'
	db	'alt become more agile and limber." ^'
L038B:	db	00
L038C:	db	' '
L038D:	db	00
L038E:	db	' a while mimicking the movements which Denby shows '
L03C1:	db	00
L03C2:	db	'. Finally, Denby teaches '
L03DB:	db	00
L03DC:	db	' a few magic words to intone for meditational purposes. When'
	db	' the training session is complete, '
L043B:	db	00
L043C:	db	' '
L043D:	db	00
L043E:	db	' much more energized and ready for anything that might come '
L047A:	db	00
L047B:	db	' way...*'
L0483:	db	00
