L0516:	db	'The Mayor is pleased.~~"It seems that thou art pursuing thin'
	db	'e investigation with genuine fervor. Methinks thou shouldst '
	db	'go to Britain and see if thou canst find this Man with a Hoo'
	db	'k."'
L05CD:	db	00
L05CE:	db	'"Here is half of thy reward money. Thou wilt receive the res'
	db	't when thou dost prove that the killer hath been brought to '
	db	'justice!"'
L064F:	db	00
L0650:	db	'"Thou dost not have enough companions to carry thy reward! T'
	db	'hou must return to me later, and I will give thee thy gold."'
L06C8:	db	00
L06C9:	db	'The Mayor hands you 100 gold coins.'
L06EC:	db	00
L06ED:	db	'"Dost thou need the password?"'
L070B:	db	00
L070C:	db	'"Excellent! I have no doubt now that thou art the one true A'
	db	'vatar!"'
L074F:	db	00
L0750:	db	'"Oh-- I almost forgot! The password to leave or enter the to'
	db	'wn is `Blackbird'!"*'
L07A0:	db	00
L07A1:	db	'"Hmmm. I am afraid that I still have my doubts about thou be'
	db	'ing the Avatar. My public duty disallows me to give thee the'
	db	' password. I am sorry."'
L0830:	db	00
L0831:	db	'"All right then. Thou dost know that thou must have the pass'
