	db	'er's Den?'
L0197:	db	00
L0198:	db	'What is the latitude of the northern-most point of the islan'
	db	'd Spektran?'
L01DF:	db	00
L01E0:	db	'"Before I give thee the password, I must admit I have had my'
	db	' doubts about thou truly being the Avatar. I must ask thee t'
	db	'o indulge me in order to satisfy my somewhat suspicious natu'
	db	're. I shall ask thee a few questions regarding the geography'
	db	' of Britannia. Please answer with the number of the longitud'
	db	'e or latitude from thy cloth map. Remember-- longitude refer'
	db	's to the lines that run north-south. They are determined by '
	db	'the numbers at the bottom of the map. Latitude refers to the'
	db	' lines that run east-west. They are determined by the number'
	db	's on the left side of thy map. If these questions are answer'
	db	'ed correctly, then I will cast aside all my doubts."'
