L003C:	db	'He kneels over the body and inspects the other golem. As his'
	db	' fingers trace around the gaping hole in Bollux's chest, an '
	db	'expression of understanding fills his visage.~"H-his heart i'
	db	's gone!"~ He stares down at his own chest. "He sacrificed hi'
	db	'mself by giving me his heart... the fool!" His words are ins'
	db	'ulting but his tone is affectionate.'
L018C:	db	00
L018D:	db	'sacrificed'
L0197:	db	00
L0198:	db	'Don't know'
L01A2:	db	00
L01A3:	db	'"I must help him, as he helped me! Wilt thou assist?"'
L01D8:	db	00
L01D9:	db	'"Very good," he says, noticeably relieved. "I thank thee in '
	db	'advance."'
L021E:	db	00
L021F:	db	'fool'
L0223:	db	00
L0224:	db	'job'
L0227:	db	00
L0228:	db	'name'
L022C:	db	00
L022D:	db	'"Then I must go this one myself," he says angrily. "'Tis no '
	db	'more than one friend would do for another... no more than Bo'
	db	'llux did for me!"'
L02B6:	db	00
L02B7:	db	'He looks at you carefully. His stoney features do nothing to'
	db	' hide the suspicion on his face, or in his voice.~"It is qui'
	db	'te obvious to me thou art but a lost traveler and certainly '
	db	'not the Avatar for whom I mistook thee."*'
