		.data
L0000:	db	'Bollux stares ahead, almost vacantly. Despite his features a'
	db	'nd lack of motion, it is apparent by his expression that som'
	db	'e of Castambre's magic still resides within.'
L00A4:	db	00
L00A5:	db	'"Bollux turns to see Adjar standing nearby, quite alive. Ins'
	db	'tantly, Bollux's expression changes detectably.'
L0110:	db	00
L0111:	db	'Adjhar simply smiles.~"Greetings, brother."'
L013C:	db	00
L013D:	db	'bye'
L0140:	db	00
L0141:	db	'job'
L0144:	db	00
L0145:	db	'name'
L0149:	db	00
L014A:	db	'name'
L014E:	db	00
L014F:	db	'name'
L0153:	db	00
L0154:	db	'name'
L0158:	db	00
L0159:	db	'He tilts his head and stares at you quizzicaly.~ "I apologiz'
	db	'e. Did I not already tell thee my master called me Bollux?"'
L01D0:	db	00
L01D1:	db	'"My master named me Bollux.'
L01EC:	db	00
L01ED:	db	'job'
L01F0:	db	00
L01F1:	db	'"I am here... to guard the Shrine... of Love."'
L021F:	db	00
L0220:	db	'bye'
L0223:	db	00
L0224:	db	'"Fare thee... well."*'
L0239:	db	00
