L0000:	db	'"I am able to heal, cure poison, and resurrect. Art thou int'
	db	'erested in one of these services?"'
L005E:	db	00
L005F:	db	'"Which of my services dost thou have need of?"'
L008D:	db	00
L008E:	db	'resurrect'
L0097:	db	00
L0098:	db	'cure poison'
L00A3:	db	00
L00A4:	db	'heal'
L00A8:	db	00
L00A9:	db	'heal'
L00AD:	db	00
L00AE:	db	'cure poison'
L00B9:	db	00
L00BA:	db	'heal'
L00BE:	db	00
L00BF:	db	'healed'
L00C5:	db	00
L00C6:	db	'cure poison'
L00D1:	db	00
L00D2:	db	'cured of poison'
L00E1:	db	00
L00E2:	db	'"Who dost thou wish to be '
L00FC:	db	00
L00FD:	db	'?"'
L00FF:	db	00
L0100:	db	'Nobody'
L0106:	db	00
L0107:	db	'"Avatar! Thou dost tell me to prepare to heal and then thou '
	db	'dost tell me 'Nobody'! Is this thine idea of a joke? Healing'
	db	' is a serious business!"'
L0197:	db	00
L0198:	db	'resurrect'
L01A1:	db	00
L01A2:	db	'"I do believe I am going blind. I do not see anyone who is i'
	db	'n need of resurrection. Art thou fooling me again, or art th'
	db	'ou hiding the injured one? I must be able to see the person '
	db	'to help them. If thou art carrying thy friend in thy pack, p'
	db	'ray lay them on the ground so that I may perform my duties a'
	db	's thou hast requested."'
L02E5:	db	00
L02E6:	db	'"Indeed, thy friend is grievously wounded. Make room here, a'
	db	'nd I will heal them to the best of mine abilities."'
L0355:	db	00
L0356:	db	'"Since I am travelling in thy group, I shall waive my fee."'
L0391:	db	00
L0392:	db	'heal'
L0396:	db	00
L0397:	db	'cure poison'
L03A2:	db	00
L03A3:	db	'resurrect'
L03AC:	db	00
L03AD:	db	'"My price is '
L03BA:	db	00
L03BB:	db	' gold. Is this price agreeable?"'
L03DB:	db	00
L03DC:	db	'heal'
L03E0:	db	00
L03E1:	db	'cure poison'
L03EC:	db	00
L03ED:	db	'resurrect'
L03F6:	db	00
L03F7:	db	'"Thou dost not have that much gold! Mayhaps thou couldst ret'
	db	'urn with more and purchase the service then."'
L0460:	db	00
L0461:	db	'"Then thou must look elsewhere for that service."'
L0492:	db	00
L0493:	db	'"If thou hast need of my services later, I will be here."'
L04CC:	db	00
