L001F:	db	00
L0020:	db	'he'
L0022:	db	00
L0023:	db	'his'
L0026:	db	00
L0027:	db	'Karenna looks at '
L0038:	db	00
L0039:	db	' and gives a small laugh. "Thou art not without skill, but t'
	db	'hou art not ready yet."'
L008C:	db	00
L008D:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
L00C6:	db	00
L00C7:	db	' gold altogether.'
L00D8:	db	00
L00D9:	db	'Karenna gives you a cross look. "I am not running a charity.'
	db	' Come back when thou dost have more money!"'
L0140:	db	00
L0141:	db	'Karenna glares at '
L0153:	db	00
L0154:	db	'. "Thou dost but waste my time. Thou art as swift and cunnin'
	db	'g as I, and I would wager that thou didst know it. I have no'
	db	't the time for such as thee."'
L01E9:	db	00
L01EA:	db	'You pay '
L01F2:	db	00
L01F3:	db	' gold, and the training session begins.'
L021A:	db	00
L021B:	db	'Karenna leaps like a panther around the padded mat of the tr'
	db	'aining ring. Her movements are so fast, they are a blur. She'
	db	' attacks. At first she lands her blows at will, causing stin'
	db	'gs of pain that send '
L02E4:	db	00
L02E5:	db	' reeling, but as the session progresses, '
L030E:	db	00
L030F:	db	' '
L0310:	db	00
L0311:	db	' '
L0312:	db	00
L0313:	db	' reflexes have been sharpened noticeably.'
L033C:	db	00
L033D:	db	'"I thank thee for a fine practice session. Thou wilt be back'
	db	'." She grins confidently.'
L0392:	db	00
