		.data
L0000:	db	'"The fortune vill cost thee 20 gold. All right?"'
L0030:	db	00
L0031:	db	'Margareta takes your money.'
L004C:	db	00
L004D:	db	'"Thou dost not have enough gold."'
L006E:	db	00
L006F:	db	'Margareta turns away from you.*'
L008E:	db	00
L008F:	db	'"Never mind, then."'
L00A2:	db	00
L00A3:	db	'Margareta turns away from you.*'
L00C2:	db	00
L00C3:	db	'The gypsy woman peers into her crystal ball.'
L00EF:	db	00
L00F0:	db	'"I see a voman standing by a shrine. She is in love vith the'
	db	'e. I do not see more on this subject.'
L0151:	db	00
L0152:	db	'"I see a voman standing by a shrine. She vill play an import'
	db	'ant role in thy life.'
L01A3:	db	00
L01A4:	db	'"Hmmm... The crystal ball is very murky...'
L01CE:	db	00
L01CF:	db	'"I see that thou must join The Fellowship if thou vantest to'
	db	' learn more about them and discover their true nature.'
L0241:	db	00
L0242:	db	'"Now that thou art a Fellowship member, thou vilt learn more'
	db	' about them and discover their true nature in due time.'
L02B5:	db	00
L02B6:	db	'"It is not very clear... ah, yes... there is a new evil that'
	db	' threatens Britannia. I see that thou shalt have to reckon v'
	db	'ith it in the future.'
L0343:	db	00
L0344:	db	'"The crystal ball tells me that the ether ov the vorld -- th'
	db	'e substance that controls magic -- has been affected by this'
	db	' new evil presence.'
L03CF:	db	00
L03D0:	db	'"I see further that this evil presence vill gain greater pow'
	db	'er during an event in the near future. This event has someth'
	db	'ing to do vith the planets. Seek out a man at the observator'
	db	'y in Moonglow to learn more about this. I see that he has a '
	db	'device which will be very useful to thee. See him soon, for '
	db	'this event is drawing near."'
L0518:	db	00
L0519:	db	'"Vhat is this? I see... I see... thou dost seek a Man vith a'
	db	' Hook. He is not thy true adversary, but finding him vill be'
	db	' necessary to complete thine ultimate quest.'
L05BD:	db	00
L05BE:	db	'"Vait! I see that thou must seek audience vith the Time Lord'
	db	'. He is in trouble, although I cannot see vhat that trouble '
	db	'is. The Time Lord knows much about this new evil, so do not '
	db	'fail to seek him out.'
L0687:	db	00
L0688:	db	'"To find the Time Lord, thou must first meet the Visps who l'
	db	'ive in the forest ov Yew. They are thy best link to him. The'
	db	' monks ov Empath Abbey may know how to contact the Visps.'
L0739:	db	00
L073A:	db	'"The ball has grown dark. I see no more."'
L0763:	db	00
L0764:	db	'Margareta looks up at you and says, "Thou dost face many dan'
	db	'gers ahead. Take care."'
L07B7:	db	00
L07B8:	db	'With those words, Margareta slumps and closes her eyes to re'
	db	'st. She is obviously exhausted.*'
L0814:	db	00
