L0000:	db	'"I am sorry, but thou dost not have enough practical experie'
	db	'nce with weights to train at this time. Perhaps in the futur'
	db	'e, when thou art ready, I could train thee."'
L00A4:	db	00
L00A5:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
L00DE:	db	00
L00DF:	db	' gold altogether.'
L00F0:	db	00
L00F1:	db	'"Thou dost not have enough gold to train here."'
L0120:	db	00
L0121:	db	'you begin'
L012A:	db	00
L012B:	db	'your'
L012F:	db	00
L0130:	db	' begins'
L0137:	db	00
L0138:	db	''s'
L013A:	db	00
L013B:	db	'"Thou art already as strong as I!" he exclaims, noticing '
L0174:	db	00
L0175:	db	' muscles and build. "Thou dost certainly know as much as I a'
	db	'bout building strong muscles."'
L01CF:	db	00
L01D0:	db	'You pay '
L01D8:	db	00
L01D9:	db	' gold, and the training session begins.'
L0200:	db	00
L0201:	db	'He begins with a short, but extensive, weight training progr'
	db	'am, followed by a sparring match with heavy weaponry. Shortl'
	db	'y, '
L027C:	db	00
L027D:	db	' to feel stronger, and better able to utilize that strength '
	db	'in battle.'
L02C3:	db	00
