		.funcnumber	08C2H
		.data
L0000:	db	'"Well, hello, Mayor Forsythe. Thou has finally decided to as'
	db	'sist in the salvation of our town." She gives him a pointed '
	db	'look.*'
L007E:	db	00
L007F:	db	'"Look here, I wasn't the one who gave that fool recipe to Ca'
	db	'ine, now was I?"*'
L00CC:	db	00
L00CD:	db	'"That fool recipe just got rid of Horance for us." Mistress '
	db	'Mordra speaks through clenched teeth.*'
L012F:	db	00
L0130:	db	'"Hmmph. Thou hast taken thy sweet time, madam. And now I am '
	db	'off to jump in a well."*'
L0184:	db	00
L0185:	db	'"Ignorant fool!"*'
L0196:	db	00
L0197:	db	'"Old biddy!"*'
L01A4:	db	00
L01A5:	db	'"Thou wilt regret that, Toad." Fire flares in the depths of '
	db	'her eyes and electricity crackles in her hair. She lifts her'
	db	' arms as if to cast some dreadful spell, but Forsythe whimpe'
	db	'rs and hides behind you. She sees the look on your face and '
	db	'slowly lowers her arms. The flames and lightning flicker, an'
	db	'd die.~~"Forgive my behavior, '
L02EF:	db	00
L02F0:	db	'. What was that about a well." You explain that Forsythe has'
	db	' volunteered to sacrifice himself for the spirits of the oth'
	db	'ers. She looks him in the eyes. He brushes himself off and s'
	db	'tands up straight. "I didst not think that thou had it in th'
	db	'ee, Mayor. I am in thy debt."*'
L03FE:	db	00
L03FF:	db	'"Yes, well. Thou art welcome, I guess." He looks as if his d'
	db	'ignity has been somewhat replenished.*'
L0461:	db	00
L0462:	db	'"I suppose thou hadst better get thee hence, then. Fare thee'
	db	' well, Forsythe. 'Tis not all that bad, roaming the ether. A'
	db	't least not once thou becomest accustomed to it."~~She turns'
	db	' to you. "Goodbye, '
L0529:	db	00
L052A:	db	'. If thou art successful, I will not see thee again. May thy'
	db	' fortunes be good.*"'
L057A:	db	00
