		.funcnumber	08CAH
		.data
L0000:	db	'After a few moments of questioning, he says, "I am sorry, bu'
	db	't thou dost not have a strong enough grasp of my theories fo'
	db	'r me to be able to instruct thee. Perhaps when thou hast had'
	db	' more time to study..."'
L00CB:	db	00
L00CC:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
L0105:	db	00
L0106:	db	' gold altogether.'
L0117:	db	00
L0118:	db	'"I must apologize, but I need my full fee to permit me to co'
	db	'ntinue my research. Mayhaps, at another time, when thou hast'
	db	' more money, I can teach thee."'
L01AF:	db	00
L01B0:	db	'After a few moments of questioning, he says, "Thou art alrea'
	db	'dy past my tutelage. I must humbly apologize, for there is n'
	db	'othing new I can teach thee."'
L0245:	db	00
L0246:	db	'You pay '
L024E:	db	00
L024F:	db	' gold, and the training session begins.'
L0276:	db	00
L0277:	db	'You'
L027A:	db	00
L027B:	db	'you'
L027E:	db	00
L027F:	db	00
L0280:	db	'have'
L0284:	db	00
L0285:	db	's'
L0286:	db	00
L0287:	db	'has'
L028A:	db	00
L028B:	db	' and Perrin dive excitedly into the pages of several tomes. '
	db	'Following an intensive study session, '
L02ED:	db	00
L02EE:	db	' find'
L02F3:	db	00
L02F4:	db	' the ability to comprehend and disseminate much more informa'
	db	'tion than ever before. In addition, '
L0354:	db	00
L0355:	db	' '
L0356:	db	00
L0357:	db	' a a better grasp of the theory behind spellcasting.'
L038B:	db	00
