L0000:	db	'The winged gargoyle begins his sermon.'
L0026:	db	00
L0027:	db	'You see the gargoyle clerk taking notes in the corner.'
L005D:	db	00
L005E:	db	'"To talk tonight about why The Fellowship is important to yo'
	db	'ur lives. To know that each of us sought The Fellowship to f'
	db	'eel complete. To have had dreams and longings."*'
L0106:	db	00
L0107:	db	'"To be very true."*'
L011A:	db	00
L011B:	db	'"To know that others who are not members have given up their'
	db	' dreams. To see that they succumb to the mediocrity of their'
	db	' lives to find stability."*'
L01AE:	db	00
L01AF:	db	'"This is truly boring. Let us get some food -- I am hungry!"'
	db	'*'
L01EC:	db	00
L01ED:	db	'"To see them begin to produce unreal ideas and become misali'
	db	'gned. To stray from the true path to what they seek. To lose'
	db	' contact with reality." He sighs. "To find failure, not succ'
	db	'ess in what they do."*'
L02B7:	db	00
L02B8:	db	'"To be very sad."*'
L02CA:	db	00
L02CB:	db	'"To know," he smiles, "that each of the members present has '
	db	'faced such an awakening into the real world. To find in the '
	db	'order a clear path to reach what we seek!"~~ The members pre'
	db	'sent all stand and shout.*'
L0399:	db	00
L039A:	db	'"'Tis time for us to depart, '
L03B7:	db	00
L03B8:	db	'."*'
L03BB:	db	00
