L0000:	db	'Raymundo hands you a script and you take center stage. The l'
	db	'ights feel hot on your face. Although you are a little nervo'
	db	'us, you clear your throat and begin to read the lines on the'
	db	' page.'
L00BA:	db	00
L00BB:	db	'I am the -Avatar-!'
L00CD:	db	00
L00CE:	db	'I am -the- Avatar!'
L00E0:	db	00
L00E1:	db	'I -am- the Avatar!'
L00F3:	db	00
L00F4:	db	'-I- am the Avatar!'
L0106:	db	00
L0107:	db	'"No, no, no! That is all wrong! Thou art the 'Avatar'! Thou '
	db	'must feel like the Avatar! Thou must sound like the Avatar! '
	db	'Thou must -be- the Avatar! Try it again."'
L01A8:	db	00
L01A9:	db	'I am the -Avatar-!'
L01BB:	db	00
L01BC:	db	'I am -the- Avatar!'
L01CE:	db	00
L01CF:	db	'I -am- the Avatar!'
L01E1:	db	00
L01E2:	db	'-I- am the Avatar!'
L01F4:	db	00
L01F5:	db	'"Better... better... but I think perhaps thou dost need a pr'
	db	'op."'
L0235:	db	00
L0236:	db	'"Jesse, hand our friend thy staff."*'
L025A:	db	00
L025B:	db	'"Here it is, milady."*'
L0271:	db	00
L0272:	db	'"Here it is, milord."*'
L0288:	db	00
L0289:	db	'Raymundo hands you a staff.'
L02A4:	db	00
L02A5:	db	'With the staff in hand, you try the lines once more. This ti'
	db	'me you feel like a true actor. The lines flow from your lips'
	db	' as if the Avatar were really saying them. You feel an excit'
	db	'ement you have never before felt. You like this 'acting' thi'
	db	'ng. You crave more! You anxiously await Raymundo's critique.'
	db	'..'
L03D3:	db	00
L03D4:	db	'Raymundo takes the staff and says, "Hmmmm. Yes, that's fine.'
	db	' I thank thee. Fine. We shall be in touch, yes? Thank thee f'
	db	'or coming in. If thou hast a resume, just leave it by the do'
	db	'or, yes? Thank thee."*'
