L0070:	db	'cured'
L0075:	db	00
L0076:	db	'"Who needs to be '
L0087:	db	00
L0088:	db	'?"'
L008A:	db	00
L008B:	db	'"None of you seem to require mine aid."~~She appears pleased'
	db	'.'
L00C8:	db	00
L00C9:	db	'resurrection'
L00D5:	db	00
L00D6:	db	'"I am sorry, but thou hast not presented anyone to me who re'
	db	'quires mine assistance. If there is someone who truly needs '
	db	'my skills, I must have a closer look."'
L0174:	db	00
L0175:	db	'"I must charge thee '
L0189:	db	00
L018A:	db	' gold. Is this price agreeable?"'
L01AA:	db	00
L01AB:	db	'healing'
L01B2:	db	00
L01B3:	db	'curing'
L01B9:	db	00
L01BA:	db	'resurrection'
L01C6:	db	00
L01C7:	db	'"I am sorry, '
L01D4:	db	00
L01D5:	db	', but thou dost not have enough gold. Perhaps, I will be abl'
	db	'e to aid thee next time."'
L022A:	db	00
L022B:	db	'"Then I cannot help thee, '
L0245:	db	00
L0246:	db	'. I am truly sorry, but my fees are set."'
L026F:	db	00
L0270:	db	'"I am glad of that, '
L0284:	db	00
L0285:	db	'. I am happy to help those in need, but I would be far happi'
	db	'er if there were never a need!"'
