L0000:	db	'"Where, oh where has my dear husband gone. I cannot stand to'
	db	' be away from him!"*'
L0050:	db	00
L0051:	db	'As far as you can tell, the couple haven't released their em'
	db	'brace since they were first reunited, and they show no sign '
	db	'of doing so at any time in the near future.'
L00F4:	db	00
L00F5:	db	'bye'
L00F8:	db	00
L00F9:	db	'sacrifice'
L0102:	db	00
L0103:	db	'sacrifice'
L010C:	db	00
L010D:	db	'"No, '
L0112:	db	00
L0113:	db	'. She is my life. If thou takest her, thou takest mine heart'
	db	'." Trent holds on tightly to his wife.'
L0175:	db	00
L0176:	db	'"I cannot leave my lord like this. Surely thou canst underst'
	db	'and, '
L01B7:	db	00
L01B8:	db	'."'
L01BA:	db	00
L01BB:	db	'bye'
L01BE:	db	00
L01BF:	db	'The couple continue staring into one another's eyes as if to'
	db	' make up for all of the years they lost.*'
L0224:	db	00
