L0000:	db	'The starcrossed lovers rush into each other's ghostly embrac'
	db	'e. For a time it's hard to see where one spirit ends and the'
	db	' other begins, then the two slowly turn to face you. "Thou h'
	db	'ast done so much for us, I hope that in helping us, thou has'
	db	't been assisted in thine own quest." Rowena performs a curts'
	db	'ey then turns to regard her handsome husband.*'
L015A:	db	00
L015B:	db	'"How can I help thee, '
L0171:	db	00
L0172:	db	'? I must get to Trent quickly." She looks impatient to be wi'
	db	'th her husband.'
L01BD:	db	00
L01BE:	db	'bye'
L01C1:	db	00
L01C2:	db	'Trent'
L01C7:	db	00
L01C8:	db	'Trent'
L01CD:	db	00
L01CE:	db	'Her face lights up as you say her husband's name. "He is the'
	db	' town smith. He hand crafted that music box thou didst use t'
	db	'o awaken me from Horance's dark power."'
L026D:	db	00
L026E:	db	'Trent'
L0273:	db	00
L0274:	db	'sacrifice'
L027D:	db	00
L027E:	db	'"I cannot do that to my poor Trent, at least not without see'
	db	'ing him one more time." She shakes her head in negation.'
L02F2:	db	00
L02F3:	db	'bye'
L02F6:	db	00
L02F7:	db	'"Yes, we must be getting to the smithy. Trent will be worryi'
	db	'ng about me."*'
L0341:	db	00
L0342:	db	'"This place is horrible. Wouldst thou be so kind as to take '
	db	'me to mine husband, Trent? He has a tendency to worry about '
	db	'me."'
L03BE:	db	00
L03BF:	db	'Rowena smiles radiantly, "Thank thee, '
L03E5:	db	00
L03E6:	db	'. Thy spirit is a generous one, indeed."*'
L040F:	db	00
L0410:	db	'She steps in line and motions for you to lead on.*'
L0442:	db	00
L0443:	db	'"Thou hast too many people in thy party at the moment for me'
	db	' to travel with thee."'
L0495:	db	00
L0496:	db	'"Then I shall wait here for one of virtue who would safeguar'
	db	'd my well being, and help me to return to mine husband." She'
	db	' seems distanced as she turns away from you.*'
L053B:	db	00
