L01BD:	db	00
L01BE:	db	'"On guard!" Sentri cries as he draws his sword. ^'
L01EF:	db	00
L01F0:	db	' '
L01F1:	db	00
L01F2:	db	' forced to respond with the most easily readied weapon '
L0229:	db	00
L022A:	db	' '
L022B:	db	00
L022C:	db	'. Without a word, Sentri advances upon '
L0253:	db	00
L0254:	db	', swinging his blade in a seemingly wild, yet entirely contr'
	db	'olled manner. ^'
L029F:	db	00
L02A0:	db	' '
L02A1:	db	00
L02A2:	db	' forced to block his blows to the best of '
L02CC:	db	00
L02CD:	db	' ability. Luckily, Sentri stops just short of striking '
L0304:	db	00
L0305:	db	', which he is often able to do. Slowly but surely, over the '
	db	'course of the training session, '
L0361:	db	00
L0362:	db	' blocking improves and '
L0379:	db	00
L037A:	db	' '
L037B:	db	00
L037C:	db	' to get in a few thrusts of '
L0398:	db	00
L0399:	db	' own. ^'
L03A0:	db	00
L03A1:	db	' agility improves, and the improvement is tangibly perceptib'
	db	'le.'
L03E0:	db	00
L03E1:	db	'"I enjoyed that!" Sentri exclaims after it is all over.*'
L0419:	db	00
