		.data
L0000:	db	'nobody'
L0006:	db	00
L0007:	db	'"Thy good health, sir. Many campaigns sit upon thy brow. It '
	db	'is an honor."'
L0050:	db	00
L0051:	db	'"Avatar, this stranger grows upon me by the moment. Surely h'
	db	'e would be a boon travelling companion."'
L00B5:	db	00
L00B6:	db	'"Oh, please."'
L00C3:	db	00
L00C4:	db	'"Hush, '
L00CB:	db	00
L00CC:	db	'."'
L00CE:	db	00
L00CF:	db	'"How art thou, Shamino? Thy woodcraft is renowned in Britann'
	db	'ia."'
L010F:	db	00
L0110:	db	'"Renown follows those who travel with the Avatar. I thank th'
	db	'ee."'
L0150:	db	00
L0151:	db	'"Greetings young man. How comes one so young into such compa'
	db	'ny?"'
L0191:	db	00
L0192:	db	'"I am an orphan! My father has been most cruelly murdered, m'
	db	'utilated in the stables of Trinsic."'
L01F2:	db	00
L01F3:	db	'"That is a grievous tale! But surely the time for grief is p'
	db	'ast. Thou art in the company of great companions."'
L0261:	db	00
L0262:	db	'"Thou speakest rightly. I shall bring my father's murderer t'
	db	'o justice or die in the attempt."'
L02BF:	db	00
L02C0:	db	'"Greetings '
L02CB:	db	00
L02CC:	db	'."'
L02CE:	db	00
L02CF:	db	'May good fortune be thine.'
L02E9:	db	00
L02EA:	db	'Good health to thee.'
L02FE:	db	00
L02FF:	db	'Thou art looking quite well today.'
L0321:	db	00
L0322:	db	'"'
L0323:	db	00
L0324:	db	'"'
L0325:	db	00
L0326:	db	'"Glad to make thine aquaintance."'
L0347:	db	00
L0348:	db	'"But did I hear thee say 'Avatar?' Say not that thy leader i'
	db	's the one -true- Avatar!"'
L039D:	db	00
L039E:	db	'"It is indeed true."'
L03B2:	db	00
L03B3:	db	'"'Tis an honor to meet thee, Avatar."'
L03D8:	db	00
