		.funcnumber	091AH
		.data
L0000:	db	'"The Fellowship advances the philosophy of 'sanguine cogniti'
	db	'on', a way to apply a confident order of thought to one's li'
	db	'fe, through what is called the Triad of Inner Strength. The '
	db	'Triad is simply three basic principles that, when applied in'
	db	' unison, enable one to be more creative, satisfied, and succ'
	db	'essful in life. They are: Strive For Unity, Trust Thy Brothe'
	db	'r, and Worthiness Precedes Reward. Strive For Unity basicall'
	db	'y means that people should cooperate and work together. Trus'
	db	't Thy Brother implies that we are all the same and that we s'
	db	'hould not hate or fear each other. Worthiness Precedes Rewar'
	db	'd suggests that we must each strive to be worthy of that whi'
	db	'ch we want out of life."'
L02AC:	db	00
L02AD:	db	'"Dost thou want to join?"'
L02C6:	db	00
L02C7:	db	'"Then thou shouldst go immediately to see Batlin at the Fell'
	db	'owship Hall headquarters in Britain."'
L0328:	db	00
L0329:	db	'"Oh. Well, perhaps thou canst become enlightened another tim'
	db	'e."'
L0368:	db	00
L0369:	db	'"Oh! I just now noticed thy medallion! Thou dost already kno'
	db	'w all of this! Thou art one of us! Excuse me for going on an'
	db	'd on about it!"'
L03F0:	db	00
