L0000:	db	'After a very quick run, he turns and says, "Thou dost not ye'
	db	't have the stamina. If thou so wishest, I could train thee a'
	db	't a later date."'
L0088:	db	00
L0089:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
L00C2:	db	00
L00C3:	db	' gold altogether.'
L00D4:	db	00
L00D5:	db	'"It seems thou dost not have enough gold to train at this ti'
	db	'me."'
L0115:	db	00
L0116:	db	'After a short run, he turns and says, "Thou art already as s'
	db	'trong as I! I am afraid that there is nothing further I can '
	db	'show thee."'
